<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Non</para>
  <para style="toc1">NONB YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nonb</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nonb</para>
  <para style="mt1">NOMB YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/>SENYÈ a te pale a Moïse nan dezè Sinaï a, nan tant asanble a, nan premye jou a dezyèm mwa a, nan dezyèm ane lè yo te fin sòti nan peyi Égypte la. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:37">Egz 12:37</ref> </char></note>“Fè yon chif kontwòl tout asanble fis Israël yo selon fanmi zansèt pa yo, selon papa lakay yo, selon kantite, non a chak gason, tèt pa tèt, <verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:14">Egz 30:14</ref> </char></note>ventan oplis, nenpòt moun ki kapab fè lagè an Israël. Ou menm avèk Aaron va konte yo pa lame yo. <verse eid="NUM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>Anplis de nou menm, va genyen yon moun ki sòti nan chak tribi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:21-25">Egz 18:21-25</ref> </char></note>yo chak ki se tèt a fanmi zansèt pa li.<verse eid="NUM 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>“Alò, sa yo se nonm mesye ki va kanpe avèk ou yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:6">Det 33:6</ref> </char></note>pou Ruben: Élitsur, fis a Schedéur; <verse eid="NUM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>pou Siméon: Schelumiel, fis a Tsurischaddaï; <verse eid="NUM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>pou Juda: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:20">Rt 4:20</ref> </char></note>Nachschon, fis a Amminadab; <verse eid="NUM 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>pou Issacar: Nethaneel, fis a Tsuar; <verse eid="NUM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>pou Zabulon: Éliab, fis a Hélon; <verse eid="NUM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>pou fis a Joseph yo, pou Éphraïm: Élischama, fis a Ammihud; pou Manassé: Gamaliel, fis a Pedahtsur; <verse eid="NUM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>pou Benjamin: Abidan, fis a Guideoni; <verse eid="NUM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>pou Dan: Ahiézer, fis a Mamischaddaï; <verse eid="NUM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>pou Aser: Paguiel, fis a Ocran; <verse eid="NUM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>pou Gad: Éliasapah, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:14">Nonb 2:14</ref> </char></note>Déuel; <verse eid="NUM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>pou Nephthali: Ahira, fis a Énan.”<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Se sila yo ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:21">Egz 18:21</ref> </char></note>rele pa asanble a, dirijan a tribi fanmi zansèt pa yo; yo te chèf a dè milye an Israël. <verse eid="NUM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17"/>Konsa, Moïse avèk Aaron te pran mesye sa yo ki te chwazi pa non yo. <verse eid="NUM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18"/>Yo te reyini tout kongregasyon an ansanm nan premye jou nan dezyèm mwa a. Konsa, yo te fè anrejistreman selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:59">Esd 2:59</ref> </char></note>fanmi zansèt pa yo, selon kay papa yo, selon kantite ki te nome yo, soti nan ventan oswa plis, tèt pa tèt. <verse eid="NUM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19"/>Jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:1">II Sam 24:1</ref> </char></note>SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la, konsa li te konte yo nan dezè ki rele Sinaï a.<verse eid="NUM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:5-7">Nonb 26:5-7</ref> </char>
    </note>Alò fis a Ruben yo, premye ne pou Israël, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite ki te nome yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Ruben an te karann-si-mil-senk san (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:12-14">Nonb 26:12-14</ref> </char>
    </note>Pou fis Siméon yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite ki te nome yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Siméon an te senkant-nèf-mil, twa-san (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 4:12">Jos 4:12</ref> </char>
    </note>Pou fis Gad yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite ki te nome yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Gad la te karann-senk-mil-sis-san-senkant (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:68">Sòm 78:68</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou fis Juda yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Juda a te swasann-katòz-mil-sis-san (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:23-35">Nonb 26:23-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou fis Issacar yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Issacar a te senkant-kat-mil-kat-san (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:26-27">Nonb 26:26-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou fis Zabulon yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Zabulon an te senkant-sèt-mil-kat-san (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:15">Jr 7:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou fis Joseph sa vle di Éphraïm, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Éphraïm nan te karann-sèt-mil-senk-san (47,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:28-34">Nonb 26:28-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou fis Manassé yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35"/>Fòs kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Manassé a te trann-de-mil-de-san (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 17:17">II Kwo 17:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou fis Benjamin yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Benjamin an te trann-senk-mil-kat-san (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 30:6">Jen 30:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou fis Dan yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Dan nan te swasann-de-mil-sèt-san (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:44-47">Nonb 26:44-47</ref> </char>
    </note>Pou fis Aser yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Aser a te karanteyen-mil-senk-san (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:48-50">Nonb 26:48-50</ref> </char>
    </note>Pou fis Nephthali yo, anrejistreman pa yo selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè. <verse eid="NUM 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43"/>Kantite mesye ki te konte nan tribi Nephtali a te senkant-twa-mil-kat-san (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44"/>Sa yo se sila ki te konte yo, ke Moïse avèk Aaron te konte yo, selon chèf Israël yo, douz gason, chak ki te sòti lakay zansèt papa pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45"/>Konsa se tout gason nan fis Israël yo ki te konte selon fanmi zansèt yo, selon fanmi papa pa yo, selon kantite non yo, tèt pa tèt, tout gason soti nan ventan oswa plis ki ta kapab fè lagè an Israël. <verse eid="NUM 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46"/>Jiskaske tout mesye ki te konte yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:32">Nonb 2:32</ref> </char></note>sis-san-twa-mil-senk-san-senkant. (603,550).<verse eid="NUM 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 2:33">Nonb 2:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men Levit yo pa t konte pami yo selon tribi zansèt papa pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>Paske SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>“Sèlman tribi Levi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:62">Nonb 26:62</ref> </char></note> nou p ap konte, ni nou p ap fè kontwòl anrejistreman pa yo pami fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50"/>Men nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:21">Egz 38:21</ref> </char></note>chwazi Levit yo sou tabènak temwayaj la, sou tout zafè li yo ak tout sa ki apatyen a li menm. Yo va pote tabènak la avèk tout zafè li, e yo va okipe li; yo va osi fè kan antoure tabènak la. <verse eid="NUM 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:1-33">Nonb 4:1-33</ref> </char></note>Konsa lè tabènak la ap pati, Levit yo va desann li; epi lè tabènak la vin kanpe, Levit yo va monte li. Men sila ki pa Levit ki vin toupre va vin mete a lanmò.<verse eid="NUM 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 2:2-34">Nonb 2:2-34</ref> </char>
    </note> “Fis Israël yo va fè kan, chak mesye bò kote kan pa li, e chak mesye bò drapo pa li, selon lame yo. <verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Men Levit yo va fè kan antoure tabènak temwayaj la, pou kòlè pa vin sou asanble fis Israël yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 8:24">Nonb 8:24</ref> </char></note> Konsa Levit yo va kenbe chaj sou Tabènak Temwayaj la.”<verse eid="NUM 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Se konsa ke fis Israël yo te fè. Selon tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse yo, konsa yo te fè.<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:52">Nonb 1:52</ref> </char></note> Fis Israël yo va fè kan, chak bò kote pwòp drapo pa yo, avèk drapo lakay papa zansèt pa yo. Yo va fè kan antoure tant asanble a, a yon distans.<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>Alò, sila ki fè kan nan kote lès la vè solèy leve yo va sila nan drapo kan an Juda yo, selon lame pa yo. Chèf dirijan a fis Juda yo va<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:10">I Kwo 2:10</ref> </char></note>Nachschon, fis a Amminadab la, <verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye ki te konte yo, swasann-katòz-mil-sis-san (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Sila ki fè kan bò kote li yo va nan tribi Issacar. Chèf dirijan an va Nethaneel, fis a Tsuar a, <verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>avèk lame pa li. Mesye ki te konte yo te senkant-kat-mil-kat-san (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Sila a va swiv pa Zabulon, avèk chèf dirijan fis Zabulon yo:<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:9">Nonb 1:9</ref> </char></note> Eliab, fis a Hélon an, <verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>avèk lame pa li, men mesye ki te konte yo, senkant-sèt-mil-kat-san (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Total a mesye ki te konte nan kan Juda a te: san-katreven-si-mil-kat-san (186,400) selon lame pa yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:14">Nonb 10:14</ref> </char></note>Yo va sòti avan.<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>Nan kote sid la va gen drapo a kan Ruben an selon lame pa yo. Chèf a fis Ruben yo te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:5">Nonb 1:5</ref> </char></note>Élitsur fis a Schedéur a, <verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye ki konte yo, karant-si-mil-senk-san (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Sila ki fè kan bò kote li yo va nan tribi Siméon. Chèf a fis Siméon yo te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:6">Nonb 1:6</ref> </char></note> Schelumiel, fis a Tsurischaddaï la, <verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>avèk lame pa li. Mesye ki te konte yo te senkant-nèf-mil-twa-san (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Swiv pa tribi Gad la, avèk chèf a fis Gad yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:14">Nonb 1:14</ref> </char></note>Éliasapah, fis a Déuel la, <verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye ki te konte yo; karann-senk-mil-sis-san-senkant (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>Total a mesye konte nan kan Ruben an te: san-senkanteyen-mil-kat-san-senkant (151,450). <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:18">Nonb 10:18</ref></char></note>Se yo k ap sòti nan dezyèm nan.<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 1:53">Nonb 1:53</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, tant asanble a va sòti avèk kan levit yo nan mitan kan yo. Menm jan ke yo fè kan an, konsa yo va sòti, chak moun nan plas li bò kote drapo pa li. <verse eid="NUM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>Nan kote lwès la, va gen drapo kan Ephraïm lan selon lame pa yo e chèf a fis Ephraïm yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:10">Nonb 1:10</ref></char></note>Élischama fis a Ammihud la. <verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>Nan lame pa li, men sa ki konte yo; karann-mil-senk-san (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Akote li va gen tribi Manassé a, e chèf a fis Manassé yo te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:10">Nonb 1:10</ref> </char></note>Gamaliel, fis a Pedahstsur a, <verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye sila ki te konte yo, trant-de-mil-de-san (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Apre se tribi a Benjamin an, e chèf a tribi Benjamin an te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:11">Nonb 1:11</ref></char></note>Abidan, fis a Gideoni a, <verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye sila ki te konte yo; trann-senk-mil-kat-san (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Total a mesye konte nan kan Ephraïm yo te: san-ui-mil-san (108,100) pa lame pa yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:22">Nonb 10:22</ref></char></note>Yo va sòti nan twazyèm nan.<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>Nan kote nò va gen drapo pou kan Dan an, selon lame pa yo, e chèf a fis Dan yo te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:12">Nonb 1:12</ref> </char></note> Ahiézer, fis a Ammischaddaï a, <verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye ki te konte yo; swasann-de-mil-sèt-san (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Sila ki fè kan bò kote li yo va nan tribi Aser, e chèf a fis a Aser yo te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:13">Nonb 1:13</ref></char></note>Paguiel, fis a Ocran an, <verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye sila ki te konte yo; karanteyen-mil-senk-san (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Apre se te tribi a Nephtali a, e chèf a fis a Nephtali yo te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:15">Nonb 1:15</ref></char></note>Ahira, fis a Énan an, <verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>avèk lame pa li. Men mesye sila ki te konte yo; senkant-twa-mil-kat-san (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Total a mesye nan kan Dan yo te san-senkant-sèt-mil-sis-san. (157,600) <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:25">Nonb 10:25</ref> </char></note>Yo va sòti dènye avèk drapo pa yo.<verse eid="NUM 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Sa yo se mesye ki te konte a fis Israël yo selon lakay papa zansèt pa yo; total a mesye a tout kan yo ki te konte pa lame yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:26">Egz 38:26</ref> </char></note>sis-san-twa-mil-senk-san-senkant (603,550) <verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Malgre sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:47">Nonb 1:47</ref></char></note> Levit yo pa t konte pami fis Israël yo, jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Konsa fis a Israël te fè. Selon tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse yo, yo te fè kan bò kote drapo pa yo, e konsa yo te sòti, yo chak avèk pwòp fanmi pa yo selon lakay zansèt papa yo.<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>Alò sa yo se chif desandan a Aaron<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:20-27">Egz 6:20-27</ref></char></note> avèk Moïse nan tan lè SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse sou Mòn Sinaï a.<verse eid="NUM 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/>Sa yo se non a fis Aaron yo: Nadab, premye ne a, Abith, Éléazar ak Ithamar. <verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Sa yo se non a fis Aaron yo, prèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:41">Egz 28:41</ref> </char></note>onksyone ke li te konsakre pou sèvi kòm prèt yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lev 10:1-2</ref></char></note>Men Nadab avèk Abihu te mouri devan SENYÈ a lè yo te ofri dife etranje devan SENYÈ a nan dezè Sinaï a. Yo pa t gen pitit. Konsa, Éléazar avèk Ithamar te sèvi kòm prèt pandan papa yo, Aaron, t ap viv.<verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 8:6-22">Nonb 8:6-22</ref></char></note> “Mennen tribi Levi a vin pre ou, e fè yo chita devan Aaron, prèt la, pou yo kapab sèvi li. <verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>Yo va ranpli devwa pou li ak pou tout kongregasyon an devan tant asanble a, pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:50">Nonb 1:50</ref></char></note> sèvis tabènak la. <verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>Yo va osi kenbe tout zafè ki founi tant asanble a, ansanm avèk devwa a fis Israël yo, pou fè sèvis tabènak la. <verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>Konsa ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:6">Nonb 18:6</ref> </char></note> bay Levit yo a Aaron avèk fis li yo; yo va bay nèt a li pami fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>Konsa, ou va chwazi Aaron avèk fis li yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:9">Egz 29:9</ref> </char></note>yo kapab ranpli fonksyon prèt yo, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:51">Nonb 1:51</ref></char></note>nenpòt lòt moun ki pwoche va vin mete a lanmò.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>Ankò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12"/>“Alò, veye byen, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:45">Nonb 3:45</ref></char></note>te pran Levit yo pami fis Israël yo olye de chak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Egz 13:2</ref></char></note>premye ne, premye bebe a chak vant pami fis Israël yo. Konsa, Levit yo se pa M. <verse eid="NUM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13"/>Paske, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Egz 13:2</ref> </char></note> tout premye ne se pa M yo ye. Nan jou ke M te frape tout premye ne nan peyi Égypte yo, Mwen te sanktifye pou Mwen menm tout premye ne an Israël yo soti nan lòm pou rive nan bèt yo. Yo va pou Mwen; Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1">Egz 19:1</ref></char></note>nan dezè Sinaï a. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:47">Nonb 1:47</ref></char></note>“Konte fis a Levi yo selon lakay papa pa yo, pa fanmi yo; tout gason soti nan laj a yon mwa oswa plis, ou va konte yo.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Alò, Moïse te konte yo selon pawòl a SENYÈ a, jis jan ke li te kòmande a.<verse eid="NUM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:16-22">Egz 6:16-22</ref></char></note>se sa yo ki te fis a Levi yo pa non yo: Guerschon, Kehath, ak Merari.<verse eid="NUM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18"/>Sa se non a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:17">Egz 6:17</ref> </char></note>fis a Guerschon yo selon fanmi pa yo: Libni ak Schimeï; <verse eid="NUM 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19"/>Fis a Kehath yo selon fanmi pa yo: Amram, Jitsehar, Hébron ak Uziel; <verse eid="NUM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20"/>Fis a Merari yo selon fanmi pa yo: Machli ak Muschi. Sa yo se fanmi Levit yo selon lakay papa pa yo.<verse eid="NUM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Nan Guerschon te sòti fanmi a Libni yo ak fanmi a Schimeï yo. Sa yo se te fanmi a Gèchonit yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>Nan mesye konte yo tout gason soti nan yon mwa oswa plis te vin konte nan sèt-mil-senk-san (7,500). <verse eid="NUM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Fanmi a Gèchonit yo te toujou gen pou fè kan dèyè tabènak la nan kote lwès la. <verse eid="NUM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>Chèf a lakay papa yo pami Gèchonit yo te Élaisaph, fis a Laël la. <verse eid="NUM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:24-26">Nonb 4:24-26</ref></char></note>devwa a fis Guerschon yo nan tant asanble a se te tabènak la avèk tant lan, kouvèti li, rido pòtay tant asanble a, <verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:9-15">Egz 27:9-15</ref></char></note>bagay pandye sou galeri a, ki antoure tabènak la ak lotèl la, e kòd li yo avèk tout sèvis konsènan li yo.<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Nan Kehath, te sòti fanmi a Amramit yo, fanmi Jitseharit yo, fanmi Ebwonit yo avèk fanmi Izyelit yo. Sila yo se te fanmi a Kehath yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>Nan konte tout gason nan laj yon mwa oswa plis, te gen ui-mil-sis-san (8,600) ki t ap fè devwa sanktyè a. <verse eid="NUM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Fanmi a Kehath yo te gen pou fè kan nan kote sid a tabènak la, <verse eid="NUM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>epi chèf a tout kay papa yo pou Kehath yo se te Élitsaphan, fis a Uziel la. <verse eid="NUM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Alò, devwa pa yo se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Egz 25:10-22</ref> </char></note>lach la, tab la, chandelye a, lotèl yo, tout zouti pou sèvis sanktyè a, rido a, ak tout sèvis ki fèt avèk yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Éléazar, fis a Aaron an se te chèf an tèt a chèf Levit yo, e li te responsab pou tout sila ki te fè devwa sanktyè a.<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Nan Merari, te sòti fanmi a Machli yo ak fanmi Muschi yo. Se sa yo ki te fanmi a Merari yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>Mesye pa yo ki te konte pa tout gason ak laj yon mwa oswa plis yo, te si-mil-de-san (6,200). <verse eid="NUM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Chèf a lakay papa Merari yo se te Tsuriel, fis a Abihaïl la. Yo te gen pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:53">Nonb 1:53</ref> </char></note>kan sou kote nò a tabènak la. <verse eid="NUM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Alò, devwa a fis Merari yo se te pou okipe ankadreman tabènak la, poto li yo, baz reseptikal li yo, tout bagay sa yo avèk sèvis ki konsène yo, <verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>ak pilye ki antoure galeri a, avèk baz reseptikal pa yo avèk pikèt ak kòd yo.<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Alò, sila ki te gen pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:53">Nonb 1:53</ref> </char></note>kan devan tabènak la vè lès la devan tant asanble a, vè solèy leve a, se te Moïse avèk Aaron avèk fis li yo, ki pou fè devwa sanktyè yo, pou ranpli obligasyon a fis Israël yo. Men nenpòt moun ki pa prèt va vin mete a lanmò si li vin toupre.<verse eid="NUM 3:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>Tout mesye ki te konte pami Levit yo, ke Moïse avèk Aaron te konte selon kòmand a SENYÈ a, pa fanmi pa yo, tout gason ki te gen yon mwa oswa plis, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:43">Nonb 3:43</ref> </char></note>venn-de-mil (22,000).<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:15">Nonb 3:15</ref> </char></note>“Konte tout gason, premye ne pami fis Israël yo soti nan laj yon mwa oswa plis, e fè yon chif ak non yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41"/>Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:12-45">Nonb 3:12-45</ref> </char></note>va pran Levit yo pou Mwen—Mwen se SENYÈ a—olye de premye ne pami fis Israël yo; ak bèt a Levit yo olye de tout premye ne nan bèt a fis Israël yo.”<verse eid="NUM 3:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Konsa, Moïse te konte tout premye ne pami fis Israël yo, jan SENYÈ a te kòmande li a. <verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>Tout premye ne nan gason yo soti nan laj a yon mwa oswa plis, mesye ki te konte pou yo te venn-de-mil-de-san-swasann-trèz<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:39">Nonb 3:39</ref> </char></note>22,273 <verse eid="NUM 3:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:12">Nonb 3:12</ref> </char></note>“Pran Levit yo olye de tout premye ne pami fis Israël yo ak bèt a Levit yo olye bèt pa yo. Konsa, Levit yo va pou Mwen: Mwen se SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:13-15">Egz 13:13-15</ref> </char></note> Pou ranson a de-san-swasann-trèz (273) nan premye ne an Israël ki plis ke Levit yo, <verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>ou va pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:6">Lev 27:6</ref> </char></note> senk sik pou chak, pa tèt. Ou va pran yo an valè sik sanktyè a (sik la se ven gera), <verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>epi bay Aaron avèk fis li lajan la, ki te peye pou ranson pa Levit yo.”<verse eid="NUM 3:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Moïse te pran lajan ranson an ki sòti nan sila ki te anplis sila ki te ransonen pa Levit yo; <verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>nan men a premye ne a fis Israël yo, li te pran lajan an an valè sik sanktyè a, mil-twa-san-swasann-senk (1,365) sik. <verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>Epi Moïse te bay lajan ranson an bay Aaron avèk fis li yo, selon kòmand a SENYÈ a, jan SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse ak Aaron. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>Fè yon chif kontwòl a desandan Kehath yo pami fis Levit yo, selon fanmi pa yo, e selon lakay papa pa yo, <verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:3-27">I Kwo 23:3-27</ref> </char></note>trantan oswa plis, menm jiska senkantan; tout moun ki antre nan sèvis pou fè travay a Tant Asanble a.<verse eid="NUM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>Sa se travay a desandan a Kehath yo nan Tant Asanble a, selon bagay ki sen pase tout bagay yo. <verse eid="NUM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>Lè kan an pati, Aaron avèk fis li yo va antre ladann. Yo va fè desann vwal rido a, e yo va kouvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">Egz 25:10-16</ref> </char></note>lach temwayaj la avèk li. <verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:25">Nonb 4:25</ref> </char></note>kouvri li avèk po dofen, ouvri sou li yon twal, koulè ble pi, e pase fè poto antre nan wondèl yo.<verse eid="NUM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>Sou tab a pen Prezans lan, yo va osi ouvri yon twal ble. Yo va mete sou li asyèt avèk bonm yo ak veso pou fè sakrifis yo, bokal pou ofrann bwason an, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:30">Egz 25:30</ref> </char></note>pen k ap la tout tan an, va sou li. <verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>Yo va kouvri yo avèk yon twal wouj, yo va kouvri li avèk yon po dofen, e yo va fè poto yo antre pase nan wondèl yo.<verse eid="NUM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>Yo va pran yon twal ble, e yo va kouvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31">Egz 25:31</ref></char></note>chandelye a pou limyè a, ansanm avèk lanp pa li yo, touf yo, asyèt li yo, ak veso lwil li yo, avèk sa yo konn okipe li yo. <verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>Yo va mete tout zouti li yo nan yon kouvèti po dofen, e yo va mete li nan poto ki fèt pou pote a.<verse eid="NUM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>Sou lotèl an lò a, yo va mete yon twal ble. Yo va kouvri li avèk yon kouvèti po dofen, e yo va fè pase antre poto li yo nan wondèl yo. <verse eid="NUM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>Yo va pran tout zouti a sèvis yo avèk sila yo fè sèvis nan sanktyè a. Yo va mete yo nan yon twal ble, kouvri yo avèk yon kouvèti po dofen, e mete yo sou ankadreman an.<verse eid="NUM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>Yo va retire sann dife ki sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Egz 27:1-8</ref> </char></note>lotèl la, e yo va kouvri lotèl la avèk yon twal mov. <verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>Yo va anplis mete sou li tout zouti li yo avèk sila yo sèvi e ki gen korespondans avèk li; veso dife yo, fouch avèk pèl yo, ak basen yo, tout zouti lotèl la. Epi yo va fè l kouvri avèk yon po dofen, e fè poto li yo pase antre.<verse eid="NUM 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>Lè Aaron avèk fis li yo fin kouvri bagay sen yo avèk tout sa ki founi sanktyè yo, lè kan an prèt pou sòti, apre sa, fis Kehath yo va vini pou pote yo; men fòk yo pa touche bagay sen yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:51">Nonb 1:51</ref> </char></note>pou yo pa mouri. Sa yo se bagay nan Tant Asanble a ke fis Kehath yo va pote.<verse eid="NUM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>Devwa a Éléazar, fis a Aaron an, prèt la, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:1-3">Lev 24:1-3</ref> </char></note> lwil pou limyè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:34-38">Egz 30:34-38</ref></char></note>lansan santi bon an, ofrann sereyal ki pa janm sispann nan ak lwil onksyon an—lesansyèl tabènak la avèk tout sa ki ladann yo, sanktyè a avèk sa ki founi li yo.<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse ak Aaron. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18"/>Pa kite tribi a Kehath yo vin koupe retire pami Levit yo. <verse eid="NUM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19"/>Men fè sa ak yo pou yo kapab viv, e pou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:15">Nonb 4:15</ref> </char></note>pa mouri lè yo vin pwoche bagay ki sen pase tout bagay yo: Aaron avèk fis li yo va antre bay yo chak travay pa yo, avèk chaj yo; <verse eid="NUM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20"/>men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:21">Egz 19:21</ref> </char></note>yo pa pou antre pou wè sa ki sen an, menm pou yon moman, oswa yo va mouri.<verse eid="NUM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>“Pran yon chif kontwòl nan fis Guerschon yo selon lakay papa pa yo, ak papa fanmi pa yo; <verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:3">Nonb 4:3</ref> </char></note>trantan oswa plis jiska senkantan, ou va konte yo; tout moun ki antre pou fè sèvis, pou fè travay nan Tant Asanble a.<verse eid="NUM 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>“Sa se sèvis a fanmi Gèchonit yo, pou sèvi e pou pote: <verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>Yo va pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:19">Egz 40:19</ref> </char></note> rido a tabènak la, Tant Asanble a avèk kouvèti li, kouvèti po dofen ki sou li a, ak rido pòtay a Tant Asanble a, <verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>bagay pandye ki sou galeri a, rido a ki pou pòtay galeri a ki antoure tabènak la avèk lotèl la, kòd pa yo avèk tout bagay ki pou sèvis la; epi tout sa ki gen pou fèt, se yo ki pou fè l. Yo va sèvi andedan. <verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Tout sèvis a fis Gèchonit yo, nan tout chaj ak tout travay yo, yo va fèt selon kòmand Aaron avèk fis li yo. Ou va dirije yo selon devwa yo nan tout chaj yo. <verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Sa se sèvis a fanmi Gèchonit yo nan Tant Asanble a, e devwa yo va anba direksyon a Ithamar, fis a Aaron, prèt la.<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>“Selon fis Merari yo, ou va konte yo pa fanmi yo, pa lakay papa pa yo; <verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:3">Nonb 4:3</ref> </char></note>trantan oswa plis jis rive nan laj senkantan, ou va konte yo, yo chak ki antre pou fè sèvis Tant Asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>Alò, se sa ki devwa pou chaj pa yo, pou tout sèvis pa yo nan Tant Asanble a: planch a tabènak la avèk travès li yo, pilye li yo avèk baz reseptikal yo, <verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>pilye ki antoure galeri a ak baz reseptikal pa yo, pikèt ak kòd yo, avèk tout bagay pou sèvi ladann yo. Ou va chwazi chak moun pa non li, pou bagay ke li gen pou pote yo. <verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Sa se sèvis fanmi a fis Merari yo selon tout sèvis pa yo nan Tant Asanble a, anba direksyon a Ithamar, fis a Aaron, prèt la.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34"/>Alò, Moïse ak Aaron avèk chèf asanble yo te konte fis Koatit yo selon fanmi yo e selon lakay a papa pa yo, <verse eid="NUM 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35"/>soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:24">I Kwo 23:24</ref> </char></note> trantan anplis menm pou rive nan senkantan, tout sila ki te antre sèvis pou travay nan Tant Asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36"/>Mesye pa yo ki te konte pa fanmi pa yo se te de-mil-sèt-san-senkant (2,750). <verse eid="NUM 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37"/>Sila yo se mesye yo ki te konte pami fis Koatit yo, tout sila ki t ap sèvi nan Tant Asanble a, ke Moïse avèk Aaron te konte selon kòmandman SENYÈ a, selon Moïse.<verse eid="NUM 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38"/>Mesye konte pa fis Gèchonit yo pa fanmi pa yo e pa lakay fanmi pa yo, <verse eid="NUM 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39"/>soti nan trantan oswa plis menm jiska laj senkantan, tout sila ki te antre nan travay nan Tant Asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40"/>Mesye ki te konte pa fanmi pa yo, pa lakay papa pa yo se te de-mil-sis-san-trant (2,630). <verse eid="NUM 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41"/>Sila yo se mesye ki te konte nan fanmi a fis Guerschon yo, tout sila ki te sèvi nan Tant Asanble a, ke Moïse avèk Aaron te konte selon kòmandman a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42"/>Mesye konte nan fanmi a fis Merari yo pa fanmi pa yo, pa lakay papa pa yo, <verse eid="NUM 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43"/>soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 8:24-26">Nonb 8:24-26</ref> </char></note> trantan oswa plis, jis rive nan laj senkantan, tout moun ki te antre nan sèvis pou fè travay nan Tant Asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44"/>Mesye ki te konte pa fanmi pa yo se te twa-mil-de-san (3,200). <verse eid="NUM 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45"/>Sila yo se mesye ki te konte nan fanmi a fis Merari yo, ke Moïse avèk Aaron te konte selon kòmandman SENYÈ a, selon Moïse.<verse eid="NUM 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46"/>Tout mesye konte a Levit yo, ke Moïse avèk Aaron ak chèf Israël yo te konte selon fanmi yo e selon lakay a papa pa yo, <verse eid="NUM 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47"/>soti nan trantan oswa plis jiska senkantan, tout moun ki te konn antre pou fè travay sèvis ak travay pote nan Tant Asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48"/>Mesye konte yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:39">Nonb 3:39</ref> </char></note>ui-mil-senk-san-katreven (8,580).<verse eid="NUM 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>Selon kòmandman SENYÈ a, selon Moïse, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:47">Nonb 1:47</ref> </char></note> te konte, yo chak selon sèvis oswa pote yo te fè. Konsa sila yo se te mesye ki te konte yo, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>Kòmande fis Israël yo pou yo voye fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:8-46">Lev 13:8-46</ref> </char></note> kite kan an chak moun lalèp ak tout sila ki gen ekoulman yo, oswa chak moun ki pa pwòp akoz a yon moun mouri. <verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>“Nou va voye ale ni gason, ni fanm. Nou va voye yo deyò kan an pou yo pa konwonpi kan pa yo a, kote Mwen rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref> </char></note>nan mitan yo a.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>Fis Israël yo te fè sa, e yo te voye yo deyò kan an; jis jan ke SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse la, se konsa ke fis Israël yo te fè.<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 5:14-17">Lev 5:14-17</ref> </char></note> ‘Lè yon nonm, oswa yon fanm fè yon lòt mal, aji avèk mank lafwa kont SENYÈ a, e moun sa a koupab, <verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>alò, li va konfese peche ke li te fè yo; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:4-5">Lev 6:4-5</ref> </char></note> li va peye pou tò ke li te fè a, li va peye yon senkyèm nan valè donmaj la anplis, e li va bay sa a sila ke li te fè tò a. <verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Men si nonm nan pa gen relasyon pou resevwa pèyman, pèyman ki fèt pou tò a, li va oblije ale bay SENYÈ a pou prèt la, ansanm avèk belye ekspiyatwa ki pou fè ekspiyasyon pou li a. <verse eid="NUM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:32-34">Lev 7:32-34</ref> </char></note>Tout don ki apatyen a kado sen a fis Israël yo, ke yo ofri a prèt la, va pou li. <verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Konsa kado a chak moun va pou li; nenpòt bagay ke nenpòt moun bay a prèt la, li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:13">Lev 10:13</ref> </char></note>vin pou li.’”<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo e di yo: ‘Si madanm a yon nonm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:19-29">Nonb 5:19-29</ref> </char></note>vin vire, e li vin enfidèl anvè li, <verse eid="NUM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13"/>epi yon lòt gason <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:20">Lev 18:20</ref> </char></note>vin antre nan li, epi si sa kache a zye mari li, sa rete an kachèt, malgre ke li te konwonpi tèt li, men pa gen temwayaj kont li ni li pa t kenbe nan zak la, <verse eid="NUM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14"/>si yon espri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:34">Pwov 6:34</ref> </char></note>jalouzi vin antre sou nonm nan, e si li jalou pou madanm li, e li te konwonpi tèt li a, oswa si yon espri jalouzi vin sou li e li jalou lè li pa t vrèman konwonpi tèt li, <verse eid="NUM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>mesye a, alò, va mennen madanm li devan prèt la. Konsa, li va mennen kòm ofrann pou li yon dizyèm efa nan lòj moulen an. Li pa pou vide lwil sou li, ni mete lansan sou li, paske li se yon ofrann sereyal de jalouzi, yon ofrann sereyal pou sonje, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:18">I Wa 17:18</ref> </char></note>pou pa bliye inikite.<verse eid="NUM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>“‘Alò, prèt la va mennen li vin toupre li, e fè l kanpe devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17"/>Prèt la va pran dlo sen an nan yon veso fèt an ajil. Li va pran kèk nan poud ki atè nan tabènak la, e li va mete nan dlo a. <verse eid="NUM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18"/>Konsa, prèt la va fè fanm nan kanpe devan SENYÈ a, kite très cheve tèt a fanm nan vin desann, mete ofrann sonje a nan men li, ki se ofrann sereyal jalouzi a, pandan prèt la kenbe dlo anmè ki pote madichon an. <verse eid="NUM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19"/>Prèt la va fè fanm sèmante. Li va di li: “Si nanpwen gason ki te kouche avèk ou, si ou pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:12">Nonb 5:12</ref> </char></note>vin vire pou antre nan sa ki pa pwòp, alò akoz ou anba otorite mari ou, rete san afekte pa dlo anmè sa a ki mennen yon madichon. <verse eid="NUM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20"/>Sepandan, si ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:12">Nonb 5:12</ref> </char></note>vin vire, akoz ou anba otorite mari ou, si ou te konwonpi tèt ou, e yon lòt gason ki pa mari ou te kouche avèk ou,” <verse eid="NUM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21"/>(alò, prèt la va fè fanm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:26">Jos 6:26</ref></char></note> fè sèman madichon an, e prèt la va di a fanm nan): “Ke SENYÈ a fè ou modi, yon madichon pami pèp ou a lè SENYÈ a fè kwis ou vin pouri pou disparèt, e vant ou vin anfle; <verse eid="NUM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22"/>epi dlo sa a ki pote yon madichon va antre nan vant ou, fè vant ou anfle e fè kwis ou vin pouri e disparèt.” Konsa, fanm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:15">Det 27:15</ref></char></note>va di: “Amen, Amen.” <verse eid="NUM 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>Epi prèt la va ekri madichon sa yo sou yon woulo papye, e li va lave fè yo sòti nan dlo anmè a. <verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24"/>Epi li va fè fanm nan bwè dlo anmè ki pote madichon an, pou dlo ki pote madichon an kab antre nan li e li va fè l vin anmè. <verse eid="NUM 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25"/>Prèt la va pran ofrann sereyal pou jalouzi a nan men fanm nan, e li va balanse li devan SENYÈ a pou mennen li vè lotèl la. <verse eid="NUM 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:2-9">Lev 2:2-9</ref></char></note> prèt la va pran yon men plen nan ofrann sereyal la kòm ofrann tout moun sonje, li va ofri li anlè nan lafimen sou lotèl la, e apre, li va fè fanm nan bwè dlo a. <verse eid="NUM 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Lè li fin fè li bwè dlo a, alò li va vin rive, ke si li te konwonpi tèt li, li pa t kenbe bòn fwa avèk mari li, ke dlo ki mennen madichon an kab antre nan li pou fè l vin anmè a, vant li va vin anfle, kwis li va vin pouri, e fanm nan va devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:19">Jr 29:19</ref> </char></note> madichon pami pèp li a. <verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Men si fanm nan pa t konwonpi tèt li e li te pwòp, li va, alò, lib e li va fè pitit.<verse eid="NUM 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29"/>“‘Sa se lalwa jalouzi a: lè yon fanm, anba otorite mari li, vin vire e konwonpi tèt li, <verse eid="NUM 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30"/>oswa lè yon espri jalouzi vin sou yon mesye, e li vin jalou pou madanm li. Li va, alò, fè fanm nan kanpe devan SENYÈ a, e prèt la va aplike tout lwa sa a anvè li. <verse eid="NUM 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Anplis, mesye a va lib, san koupabilite, men fanm nan va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:17">Lev 20:17</ref> </char></note> pote koupabilite pa li a.’”<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>Ankò, SENYÈ a te pale avè Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo e di yo: ‘Lè yon nonm oswa yon fanm fè yon ve, ve a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:5">Jij 13:5</ref> </char></note> Nazareyen, pou dedye tèt li bay SENYÈ a, <verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/>li va refize diven avèk bwason fò. Li pa pou bwè vinèg, kit li fèt avèk diven kit bwason fò, ni li p ap bwè ji rezen, ni manje rezen, ni fre, ni sèch. <verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>Tout jou apa sa yo, li pa pou manje anyen ki pwodwi pa pye rezen, soti nan grenn li yo, jis rive nan po li.<verse eid="NUM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>“‘Tout jou yo, pandan ve apa li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">I Sam 1:11</ref></char></note> okenn razwa p ap pase sou tèt li. Li va sen jiskaske jou li yo vin akonpli pou sa li te separe tèt li bay SENYÈ a. Li va kite cheve tèt li vin long.<verse eid="NUM 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 21:1-3">Lev 21:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “‘Tout jou a separasyon li yo, li pa pou pwoche yon mò. <verse eid="NUM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7"/>Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:6">Nonb 9:6</ref> </char></note> pa pou fè tèt li pa pwòp ni pou papa li, ni manman li, pou frè li, oswa pou sè li, lè yo ta mouri, akoz separasyon li pou Bondye poze sou tèt li. <verse eid="NUM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>Tout jou a separasyon li yo, li va sen a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>“‘Men si yon nonm mouri sibitman bò kote li, e li konwonpi tèt cheve ki se apa li a, alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:8-9">Lev 14:8-9</ref> </char></note> li va pase razwa sou tèt li nan jou ke li vin pwòp la.Li va pase razwa sou li nan setyèm jou a. <verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Konsa, nan dizyèm jou a, li va pote de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 5:7">Lev 5:7</ref> </char></note> toutrèl oswa de jenn pijon vè prèt la, nan pòtay tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Prèt la va ofri youn kòm yon ofrann peche a, e lòt la kòm yon ofrann brile, epi fè ekspiyasyon pou li konsènan peche li, akoz mò a. Epi nan menm jou sa a, li va konsakre tèt li, <verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>epi li va dedye a SENYÈ a jou li yo kòm yon Nazareyen, e li va mennen yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan oswa plis kòm yon ofrann koupab. Men jou tan pase yo va vin anile akoz tan separasyon li an te vin konwonpi.<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13"/>“‘Alò, sa se lalwa a yon Nazareyen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:26">Trav 21:26</ref> </char></note> Lè jou separasyon yo vin fini, li va mennen ofrann nan nan pòtay a tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14"/>Li va prezante ofrann li an bay SENYÈ a: yon mal mouton laj 1 nan san defo kòm yon ofrann brile a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:10">Lev 14:10</ref> </char></note> mouton femèl laj 1 nan san defo kòm yon ofrann peche, ak yon belye san defo kòm yon ofrann lapè, <verse eid="NUM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15"/>epi yon panye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:2">Egz 29:2</ref></char></note>gato san ledven fèt avèk farin fen, mele avèk lwil, ofrann sereyal, ak galèt san ledven kouvri avèk lwil, ansanm avèk ofrann pa yo, ak ofrann bwason pa yo.<verse eid="NUM 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>“‘Alò, prèt la va prezante yo devan SENYÈ a. Li va ofri ofrann peche pa li a avèk ofrann brile pa li a. <verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>Li va osi ofri belye a kòm yon ofrann sakrifis lapè bay SENYÈ a, ansanm avèk yon panye gato san ledven. Prèt la va osi ofri ofrann sereyal li avèk ofrann bwason li.<verse eid="NUM 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:9">Nonb 6:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “‘Alò, apre sa, Nazareyen an va pase razwa sou tèt cheve dedye pa li nan pòtay a tant asanble a. Li va pran cheve dedye a tèt li a, e mete li sou dife ki anba ofrann sakrifis lapè yo.<verse eid="NUM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 7:28-34">Lev 7:28-34</ref> </char>
    </note>“‘Prèt la va pran zepòl belye a lè li fin bouyi, ak yon gato san ledven sòti nan panye a, yon galèt san ledven, e li va mete yo sou men a Nazareyen an lè l fin pase razwa a sou cheve dedye li a. <verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Konsa, prèt la va balanse yo kòm yon ofrann balanse vè lotèl la devan SENYÈ a. Li sen pou prèt la, ansanm avèk pwatrin ki ofri pa balanse a e kwis ki ofri pa leve anlè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 9:7">Ekl 9:7</ref> </char></note> Apre Nazareyen an kapab bwè diven an.<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>“‘Sa se lalwa a Nazareyen ki fè ve ofrann li bay SENYÈ a, an akò avèk separasyon li, anplis tout lòt bagay ke li gen posibilite fè, selon ve ke li te fè a. Konsa, li va fè selon lalwa separasyon li an.’”<verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>Pale avèk Aaron ak fis li yo pou di: ‘Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:13">I Kwo 23:13</ref> </char></note> nou va beni fis Israël yo. Nou va di yo:<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:3-6">Det 28:3-6</ref> </char></note> beni nou e kenbe nou;<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:3-19">Sòm 80:3-19</ref> </char></note> fè limyè figi li limen sou nou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 6:25">epi fè gras anvè nou;<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:6">Sòm 4:6</ref> </char></note> fè vizaj li vin gade nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 6:26">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 29:11">Sòm 29:11</ref></char></note>bannou lapè.’<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>Se konsa yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:23">II Sam 7:23</ref> </char></note> rele non Mwen pou fis Israël yo, e se konsa Mwen va beni yo.<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Alò nan jou ke Moïse te fin monte tabènak la, li te onksyone li, e li te konsakre li avèk tout zouti li yo, ak lotèl la, avèk tout zouti li yo. Li te onksyone yo e li te konsakre yo. <verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:5-16">Nonb 1:5-16</ref> </char></note> Chèf Israël yo, chèf lakay zansèt papa pa yo, te fè yon ofrann. Yo menm te chèf a tribi yo. Se te sila ki te sou mesye kontwolè yo. <verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>Lè yo te mennen ofrann pa yo devan SENYÈ a, sis kabwèt kouvri, avèk douz bèf kabwèt, yon kabwèt pou chak de chèf, yon bèf pou chak nan yo, epi yo te prezante yo devan tabènak la.<verse eid="NUM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>“Aksepte bagay sa yo pou yo menm, pou yo kapab sèvi nan sèvis Tant Asanble a, e ou va bay yo a Levit yo, a chak mesyè selon sèvis pa yo.”<verse eid="NUM 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6"/>Konsa, Moïse te pran kabwèt yo avèk bèf yo, e li te bay yo a Levit yo. <verse eid="NUM 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7"/>De kabwèt ak kat bèf, li te bay a fis Guerschon yo, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:24-26">Nonb 4:24-26</ref> </char></note> sèvis pa yo, <verse eid="NUM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8"/>epi kat kabwèt avèk uit bèf, li te bay a fis Merari yo, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:31-32">Nonb 4:31-32</ref> </char></note> sèvis pa yo, anba direksyon a Ithamar, fis a Aaron, prèt la. <verse eid="NUM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>Men li pa t bay a fis Kehath yo akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:5-15">Nonb 4:5-15</ref> </char></note> sèvis pa yo se te sèvis bagay sen ke yo te pote sou zepòl yo.<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Chèf yo te ofri ofrann dedikasyon an pou lotèl la lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 7:1">Nonb 7:1</ref> </char></note> li te fin onksyone. Konsa chèf yo te ofri ofrann yo devan lotèl la. <verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/>SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Kite yo prezante ofrann pa yo, yon chèf chak jou, pou dedikasyon lotèl la.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12"/>Alò, sila ki te prezante ofrann li nan premye jou a, se te Nachschon, fis a Amminadab nan tribi Juda a. <verse eid="NUM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13"/>Ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:13">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:29">Egz 25:29</ref> </char></note> plato fèt an ajan avèk yon pèz de san trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:13">yon bòl fèt an ajan a swasann-dis sik, selon sik a sanktyè a, tou de ki plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14"/>yon kiyè fèt an lò a dis sik ranpli avèk lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:15">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:15">yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 4:23">Lev 4:23</ref> </char>
    </note> yon mal kabrit kòm ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17"/>epi pou sakrifis ofrann lapè a, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:32-33">Luc 3:32-33</ref> </char></note> Nachschon, fis a Amminadab la.<verse eid="NUM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18"/>Nan dezyèm jou a Nethaneel, fis a Tsuar a, chèf a Issacar a, te prezante yon ofrann. <verse eid="NUM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19"/>Li te prezante kòm ofrann li</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:19">yon kiyè fèt an ajan avèk yon pèz de san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:19">yon bòl an ajan a swasann-dis sik, selon sik a sanktyè a, tou de te plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20"/>yon kiyè soup an lò a dis sik ranpli avèk lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21"/>Yon towo, yon belye, yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22"/>yon mal kabrit pou yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23"/>epi pou sakrifis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:11-13">Lev 7:11-13</ref> </char></note> ofrann lapè a, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan.<verse eid="NUM 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24"/>Nan twazyèm jou a, se te Éliab fis a Hélon an, chèf a Zabulon an. <verse eid="NUM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25"/>Ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:25">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz de trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:25">yon bòl an ajan a swasann-dis sik, selon sik a sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26"/>yon kiyè soup an lò a dis sik plen avèk lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27"/>yon jenn towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:27">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:27">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">És 53:7</ref> </char></note> mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, pou yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28"/>Yon mal belye pou yon ofrann peche,<verse eid="NUM 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29"/>epi pou sakrifis ofrann lapè a, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Éliab la, fis a Hélon an.<verse eid="NUM 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30"/>Nan katriyèm jou a, se te Élitsur, fis a Schedéur a, chèf a fis Ruben yo; <verse eid="NUM 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31"/>ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:31">yon plato an ajan avèk pèz de san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:31">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon sik sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32"/>yon kiyè nan dis sik plen avèk lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:33">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:33">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:28">Eb 9:28</ref> </char></note> mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34"/>yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35"/>epi pou ofrann sakrifis lapè a, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Élitsur a, fis a Schedéur a.<verse eid="NUM 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36"/>Nan senkyèm jou a, se te Schelumiel, fis a Schedéur a, chèf a fis Siméon yo; <verse eid="NUM 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37"/>ofrann pa li a, se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:37">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz de san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:37">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon sik sanktyè a, tou de nan yo plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik, ranpli avèk lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:39">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:39">yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40"/>yon mal kabrit pou yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41"/>epi pou ofrann sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Schelumiel la, fis a Schedéur a.<verse eid="NUM 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42"/>Nan sizyèm jou a, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:14">Nonb 1:14</ref> </char></note> Élisaph, fis a Déuel la, chèf a fis Gad yo; <verse eid="NUM 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43"/>ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:43">yon plato an ajan nan pèz san-trant sik, yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon sik sanktyè a, tou de nan yo plen avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:5">Lev 2:5</ref> </char></note> farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik ranpli avèk lansan<verse eid="NUM 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:8-14">Sòm 50:8-14</ref> </char>
    </note> yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:45">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:45">yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46"/>yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47"/>epi pou ofrann sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Élisaph la, fis a Déuel la.<verse eid="NUM 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48"/>Nan setyèm jou a, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:10">Nonb 1:10</ref> </char></note> Élischama fis a Ammihud la, chèf a fis Ephraïm yo; <verse eid="NUM 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49"/>ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:49">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:49">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon sik sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik, ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:11">Éz 8:11</ref> </char></note> lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 6:6-8">Mi 6:6-8</ref> </char>
    </note> yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:51">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:51">yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52"/>yon mal kabrit pou yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53"/>epi pou ofrann sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Élischama a, fis a Ammihud la.<verse eid="NUM 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54"/>Nan uityèm jou a, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:20">Nonb 2:20</ref> </char></note> Gamaliel, fis a Pedahtsur a, chèf a fis Mannasé yo; <verse eid="NUM 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55"/>ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:55">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:55">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon sik sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik, ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:7">Egz 30:7</ref> </char></note> lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:57">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:57">yon<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:32">Trav 8:32</ref> </char></note> mal mouton nan laj 1 nan kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58"/>yon mal kabrit pou yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59"/>epi pou ofrann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:1-17">Lev 3:1-17</ref> </char></note> sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann Gamaliel, fis a Pedahtsur a.<verse eid="NUM 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60"/>Nan nevyèm jou a, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:11">Nonb 1:11</ref> </char></note> Abidan fis a Guideoni a, chèf a fis Benjamin yo;<verse eid="NUM 7:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61"/>ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:61">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:61">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon sik sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik, ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:8">Rev 5:8</ref> </char></note> lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:63">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:63">yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64"/>yon mal kabrit pou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:21">II Kor 5:21</ref> </char></note> ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65"/>epi pou ofrann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1:20</ref> </char></note> sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Abidan, fis a Guideoni a.<verse eid="NUM 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66"/>Nan dizyèm jou a, se te Ahiézer fis a Ammischaddaï a, chèf a fis Dan yo. <verse eid="NUM 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67"/>Ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:67">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:67">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Egz 30:13</ref> </char></note> sik sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik, ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 141:2">Sòm 141:2</ref> </char></note> lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:69">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:69">yon mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70"/>yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71"/>epi pou ofrann sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Ahiézer, fis a Ammischaddaï a.<verse eid="NUM 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72"/>Nan onzyèm jou a, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:72 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:13">Nonb 1:13</ref> </char></note> Paguiel, fis a Ocran an, chèf a fis Acer yo; <verse eid="NUM 7:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73"/>ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:73">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:73">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon sik sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik, ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:74 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:11">Mal 1:11</ref> </char></note> lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:74"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:75">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:75">yon mal mouton avèk laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile; <verse eid="NUM 7:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76"/>yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:76"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77"/>epi pou ofrann sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Paguiel, fis a Ocran an.<verse eid="NUM 7:77"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78"/>Nan douzyèm jou a, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:78 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:15">Nonb 1:15</ref> </char></note> Ahira, fis a Énan an, chèf a fis Nephtali yo; <verse eid="NUM 7:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79"/>ofrann pa li a se te</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:79">yon plato an ajan avèk yon pèz san-trant sik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:79">yon bòl an ajan nan swasann-dis sik, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:79 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:9-10">Esd 1:9-10</ref> </char></note> sik sanktyè a, tou de plen avèk farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal;<verse eid="NUM 7:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80"/>yon kiyè soup an lò nan dis sik, ranpli avèk lansan;<verse eid="NUM 7:80"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81"/>yon towo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:81">yon belye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:81">yon mal mouton avèk laj 1 nan, kòm yon ofrann brile;<verse eid="NUM 7:81"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82"/>Yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche;<verse eid="NUM 7:82"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83"/>epi pou ofrann sakrifis lapè yo, de bèf, senk belye, senk mal kabrit, senk mal mouton nan laj 1 nan. Sa se te ofrann a Ahira, fis a Énan nan.<verse eid="NUM 7:83"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84"/>Sa se te ofrann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:84 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 7:10">Nonb 7:10</ref> </char></note> dedikasyon pou lotèl la pa chèf Israël yo nan jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:84 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 7:1">Nonb 7:1</ref></char></note> lotèl la te onksyone a: douz plato an ajan, douz bòl an ajan, douz kiyè soup ki fèt an lò, <verse eid="NUM 7:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85"/>chak plato ajan te peze san-trant sik e chak bòl swasann-dis; tout ajan a zouti yo se te de-mil-kat-san (2,400) sik, selon sik sanktyè a; <verse eid="NUM 7:85"/><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86"/>douz kiyè soup an lò, plen lansan, ki peze dis sik chak, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:86 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Egz 30:13</ref> </char></note> sik a sanktyè a, tout lò a kiyè yo te fè san-ven (120) sik.<verse eid="NUM 7:86"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87"/>Tout bèf pou ofrann brile a, douz towo, belye yo douz, mal mouton nan laj 1 nan avèk ofrann sereyal pa yo, e douz mal kabrit kòm ofrann peche a; <verse eid="NUM 7:87"/><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88"/>epi tout bèf pou sakrifis lapè yo, venn-kat towo, belye yo, swasant, mal kabrit yo, swasant, mal mouton nan laj 1 nan yo, swasant. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:88 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 7:1-10">Nonb 7:1-10</ref> </char></note> Sa se te ofrann dedikasyon lotèl la apre li te fin onksyone a.<verse eid="NUM 7:88"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Alò, lè Moïse te antre nan Tant Asanble a pou pale avèk Li, li te tande vwa la pale avèk li soti anwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:89 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:21-22">Egz 25:21-22</ref></char></note>twòn pwopiyatwa a ki te sou lach temwayaj la, ki sòti depi nan antre cheriben yo; e Li te pale avèk li.<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>“Pale avèk Aaron e di li: ‘Lè ou monte lanp yo, sèt lanp sa yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:37">Egz 25:37</ref> </char></note> bay limyè pa devan chandelye a.’”<verse eid="NUM 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Konsa, Aaron te fè sa. Li te monte lanp pa li a pa devan chandelye a, jis jan SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la. <verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Men kòman mendèv chandelye a te ye; fèt avèk lò ki bat, soti nan baz li jis rive nan flè yo, li te yon travay ki bat. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:9-40">Egz 25:9-40</ref> </char></note> Selon modèl ke SENYÈ a te montre a Moïse la, konsa li te fè chandelye a.<verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>Ankò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>“Pran Levit yo soti nan fis Israël yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">És 52:11</ref> </char></note> fè yo vin pwòp. <verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>Se konsa ou va fè pou fè yo vin pwòp: flite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:9-20">Nonb 19:9-20</ref></char></note> dlo ki pirifye sou yo. Kite yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:8-9">Lev 14:8-9</ref></char></note>pase razwa sou tout kò yo e lave rad yo; epi yo va vin pwòp. <verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>Konsa, kite yo pran yon towo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:1">Lev 2:1</ref> </char></note> ofrann sereyal li a, farin fen mele avèk lwil; epi yon dezyèm towo, ou va pran kòm yon ofrann peche. <verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:4">Egz 29:4</ref> </char></note> ou va prezante Levit yo devan Tant Asanble a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:3">Lev 8:3</ref></char></note>Ou va osi rasanble tout kongregasyon a fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>Ou va prezante Levit yo devan SENYÈ a. Fis Israël yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:4">Lev 1:4</ref> </char></note> va poze men yo sou Levit yo, <verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>epi Aaron va prezante Levit yo devan SENYÈ a kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:30-34">Lev 7:30-34</ref> </char></note> ofrann balanse vè lotèl la, soti nan fis Israël yo, pou yo kapab kalifye pou fè sèvis SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>“Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:10">Egz 29:10</ref></char></note>Levit yo va poze men yo sou tèt a towo yo, epi ou va ofri youn kòm yon ofrann peche, e lòt la kòm yon ofrann brile bay SENYÈ a pou fè ekspiyasyon pou Levit yo. <verse eid="NUM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>Ou va fè Levit yo kanpe devan Aaron ak devan fis li yo pou prezante yo kòm yon ofrann balanse vè lotèl la bay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Konsa, ou va separe Levit yo soti nan fis Israël yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:12">Nonb 3:12</ref> </char></note> Levit yo va vin pou Mwen.<verse eid="NUM 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>“Epi apre sa, Levit yo kapab antre pou fè sèvis nan Tant Asanble a. Konsa, ou va netwaye yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:24">Egz 29:24</ref> </char></note> prezante yo kòm yon ofrann balanse vè lotèl la; <verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>paske yo te vin pou Mwen nèt soti nan fis Israël yo. Mwen te pran yo pou Mwen menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Egz 13:2</ref> </char></note> nan plas a tout sila ki sòti nan vant yo, premye ne nan tout fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2-15">Egz 13:2-15</ref> </char></note> tout gason premye ne pami fis Israël yo se pou Mwen, pami moun yo, ak pami bèt yo. Nan jou ke M te frape tout premye ne nan peyi Égypte yo, Mwen te sanktifye yo pou Mwen menm. <verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Men Mwen te pran Levit yo nan plas a chak premye ne pami fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:9">Nonb 3:9</ref> </char></note> Mwen te bay Levit yo kòm yon kado bay Aaron ak fis li yo soti pami fis Israël yo, pou ranpli sèvis a fis Israël yo nan Tant Asanble a, e pou fè ekspiyasyon pou fis Israël yo, jis pou pa vin gen gwo epidemi pami fis Israël yo akoz ke yo vin pwoche toupre sanktyè a.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20"/>Konsa Moïse avèk Aaron, ak tout kongregasyon a fis Israël yo te fè pou Levit yo. Selon tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse konsènan Levit yo, konsa fis Israël yo te fè yo. <verse eid="NUM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 8:7">Nonb 8:7</ref> </char></note> Levit yo tou, te pirifye yo menm de peche e te lave rad yo. Aaron te prezante yo kòm yon ofrann balanse vè lotèl la devan SENYÈ a. Aaron, osi, te fè ekspiyasyon pou yo, pou fè yo vin pwòp. <verse eid="NUM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22"/>Epi apre Levit yo te antre pou fè sèvis pa yo nan Tant Asanble a, devan Aaron ak devan fis li yo: jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse konsènan Levit yo, se konsa yo te fè pou yo.<verse eid="NUM 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24"/>“Sa se lòd ki aplike pou Levit yo: soti nan laj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:3">Nonb 4:3</ref> </char></note> venn-senkan e plis, yo va antre pou fè sèvis nan travay a Tant Asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25"/>Men nan laj a senkantan, yo va pran retrèt nan sèvis travay la. Yo p ap travay ankò. <verse eid="NUM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>Sepandan, yo va asiste frè yo nan Tant Asanble a, pou kenbe devwa yo, men yo pa pou travay yo menm. Konsa ou va aji avèk Levit yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:53">Nonb 1:53</ref> </char></note> konsènan devwa yo.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse nan dezè Sinaï a, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:2">Egz 40:2</ref> </char></note> premye mwa nan dezyèm ane a lè yo te fin sòti nan Égypte la. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2"/>“Alò, kite fis Israël yo obsève fèt Pak la nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:6">Egz 12:6</ref> </char></note> lè ki apwente pou li a. <verse eid="NUM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3"/>Nan katòzyèm jou nan mwa sa a, nan aswè avan li fènwa, nou va obsève li nan lè apwente a. Nou va obsève li avèk tout règleman e avèk tout òdonans li yo.”<verse eid="NUM 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Konsa, Moïse te pale ak fis Israël yo pou obsève Pak la. <verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:10">Jos 5:10</ref> </char></note> Yo te obsève Pak la nan premye mwa, nan katòzyèm jou a, nan aswè lè li fenk kòmanse fènwa, nan dezè Sinaï a. Selon tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse yo, se konsa fis Israël yo te fè.<verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Men te gen kèk mesye ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:2">Nonb 5:2</ref> </char></note> pa t pwòp akoz yon mò. Akoz sa, yo pa t kab obsève Pak la nan jou sa a. Konsa yo te vin devan Moïse avèk Aaron nan jou sa a. <verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>Mesye sa yo te di li: “Malgre nou pa pwòp akoz mò a, poukisa nou anpeche vin prezante ofrann SENYÈ a nan lè apwente pami fis Israël yo?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Konsa, Moïse te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:15">Egz 18:15</ref> </char></note> “Tann, e mwen va koute sa ke SENYÈ a va kòmande pou nou menm.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>Epi SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo pou di: ‘Si nenpòt nan nou, oswa nan desandan nou yo vin pa pwòp akoz yon mò, oswa se nan yon vwayaj, malgre sa, li kapab obsève Pak SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11"/>Nan dezyèm mwa a, sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:2-15">II Kwo 30:2-15</ref> </char></note> katòzyèm jou a, nan aswè lè l fenk kòmanse fènwa, yo va obsève li. Yo va manje li avèk pen san ledven ak zèb anmè. <verse eid="NUM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/>Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:10">Egz 12:10</ref> </char></note> p ap kite anyen ladann pou rive nan maten, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:36">Jn 19:36</ref></char></note>ni kase okenn zo ladann. Selon tout règleman a Pak la, yo va obsève li. <verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Men mesye ki pwòp e ki pa nan yon vwayaj, ki malgre sa, neglije obsève Pak la, moun sa a va vin koupe retire de pèp li a. Paske li pa t prezante ofrann bay SENYÈ a nan lè chwazi a. Nonm sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:31">Nonb 5:31</ref> </char></note> va pote peche li.<verse eid="NUM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>“‘Si yon etranje demere pami nou e li obsève Pak SENYÈ a, li gen pou fè l selon règleman a Pak la, ak selon òdonans li. Nou va genyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:49">Egz 12:49</ref> </char></note> yon sèl règleman, ni pou etranje, ni pou natif peyi a.’”<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15"/>Alò, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:2-17">Egz 40:2-17</ref> </char></note> jou ke tabènak la te monte a, nwaj te vin kouvri tabènak la ak tant temwayaj la, e nan aswè, li te tankou aparans dife sou tabènak la, jis rive nan maten. <verse eid="NUM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16"/>Se konsa li te ye tout tan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34">Egz 40:34</ref> </char></note> Nwaj te vin kouvri li nan lajounen, e aparans dife a nan lannwit.<verse eid="NUM 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 40:36-38">Egz 40:36-38</ref> </char>
    </note> Nenpòt lè nwaj te leve sou tant lan, fis Israël yo te leve vwayaje. Nan plas kote nwaj la te vin poze a, se la fis Israël yo te kanpe fè kan an. <verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Sou kòmand a SENYÈ a, fis Israël yo te pati, e sou kòmand a SENYÈ a, yo te fè kan an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:1">I Kor 10:1</ref> </char></note> Tout tan ke nwaj la te poze sou tabènak la, yo te rete nan kan an.<verse eid="NUM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Menm lè nwaj la te fè reta sou tabènak la pandan anpil jou, fis Israël yo te kenbe lòd SENYÈ a. Yo pa t pati. <verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Si, pafwa nwaj la te rete kèk jou sou tabènak la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:14">Sòm 48:14</ref> </char></note> selon kòmand SENYÈ a, yo te rete nan kan an. Epi selon kòmand SENYÈ a, yo te vin pati.<verse eid="NUM 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Si, pafwa nwaj la te rete soti nan aswè pou jis rive nan maten, lè nwaj la te leve nan maten, yo te deplase; oswa, si li te rete nan lajounen ak lannwit, nenpòt lè ke nwaj la te leve a, yo te vin pati. <verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Sof ke se te pou de jou, oswa yon mwa, oswa 1 nan ke nwaj la te mize sou tabènak la, depi li rete anwo li, fis Israël yo te rete nan kan an. Yo pa t pati. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:14">Sòm 48:14</ref> </char></note> lè li te vin leve, yo te pati.<verse eid="NUM 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:24">Sòm 73:24</ref> </char>
    </note> Ak kòmand a SENYÈ a, yo te fè kan an, e nan kòmand a SENYÈ a, yo te pati. Yo te kenbe lòd SENYÈ a selon kòmand SENYÈ a, selon Moïse.<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>Senyè a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di li: <verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>Fè pou ou menm de twonpèt an ajan, yon zèv ajan ki bat, ou va fè yo. Konsa, ou va sèvi ak yo pou fè tout asanble a rasanble, e pou fè kan yo pati. <verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:5">Jr 4:5</ref> </char></note> Lè toude vin sone, tout kongregasyon an va rasanble yo menm anvè ou nan pòtay a tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Men si se yon sèl ki sone, alò, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:21">Egz 18:21</ref> </char></note> chèf yo, tèt a dè milye an Israël yo ki va rasanble devan ou. <verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5"/>Lè nou sone pou avèti, kan ki rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:14">Nonb 10:14</ref> </char></note> nan kote lès yo, va pati. <verse eid="NUM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6"/>Lè nou sone pou avèti yon dezyèm fwa, kan ki nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:18">Nonb 10:18</ref> </char></note> kote sid yo, va pati. Yon son avèti va soufle pou yo pati. <verse eid="NUM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Sepandan, lè nou ap reyini asanble a, ou va soufle twonpèt yo, men pa avèk son <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:1">Jl 2:1</ref> </char></note> avèti yo.<verse eid="NUM 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 31:6">Nonb 31:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Anplis, se prèt yo, fis a Aaron yo ki va soufle twonpèt yo. Konsa, sa va pou nou yon règleman pou tout tan pandan tout jenerasyon nou yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9"/>Lè nou fè lagè nan peyi nou kont advèsè ki vin atake nou yo, alò, nou va sone yon son avèti avèk twonpèt yo, pou nou kapab<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:1">Jen 8:1</ref> </char></note> sonje devan SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, e vin sove de lènmi nou yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10"/>“Osi, nan jou kè kontan yo, nan fèt apwente nou yo, ak nan premye jou nan mwa nou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 81:3-5">Sòm 81:3-5</ref> </char></note> nou va sone twonpèt yo sou ofrann brile nou yo, sou ofrann sakrifis lapè yo. Yo va tankou yon son pou nou menm devan Bondye nou an. Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Alò, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:17">Egz 40:17</ref> </char></note> dezyèm ane a, nan dezyèm mwa a, nan ventyèm nan mwa a, nwaj la te leve pa anwo tabènak temwayaj la. <verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>Konsa, fis Israël yo te pati nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:36">Egz 40:36</ref> </char></note> vwayaj yo soti nan dezè a Sinaï a. Epi nwaj la te vin tan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:16">Nonb 12:16</ref></char></note>dezè Paran an. <verse eid="NUM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:6">Det 1:6</ref> </char></note> Konsa, yo te derape pou premye fwa selon kòmandman SENYÈ a, selon Moïse.<verse eid="NUM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Drapo kan Juda a selon lame pa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:3-9">Nonb 2:3-9</ref></char></note>te sòti avan, avèk Nachschon, fis a Amminadab la sou lame pa li. <verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Nethaneel, fis a Tsuar a, te sou lame tribi a fis Issacar yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>Eliab, fis a Hélon an, te sou lame tribi a fis Zabulon an, <verse eid="NUM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:21-32">Nonb 4:21-32</ref></char></note>Tabènak la te vin demonte, epi fis a Guerschon yo avèk fis a Merari yo, ki t ap pote tabènak la, te pati.<verse eid="NUM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18"/>Apre, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:10-16">Nonb 2:10-16</ref></char></note>drapo kan Ruben an, selon lame pa yo te pati avèk Élitsur, fis a Schedéur a sou lame pa li. <verse eid="NUM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19"/>Schelumiel, fis a Tsurischaddaï a te sou lame tribi a fis Siméon yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20"/>Élisaph, fis a Déuel la te sou lame tribi a fis Gad yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:4-20">Nonb 4:4-20</ref></char></note>Epi Kehath yo te derape. Yo t ap pote bagay sen yo. Lòt yo te gen tan monte tabènak avan ke yo te rive.<verse eid="NUM 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 2:18-24">Nonb 2:18-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apre, drapo a kan Ephraïm nan te pati, selon lame pa yo. Élischama, fis a Ammihud la te sou tèt lame pa li a. <verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>Gamaliel, fis a Pedahstsur te sou tèt lame tribi a fis Manassé yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>Abidan, fis a Guideoni te sou tèt lame a fis Benjamin yo.<verse eid="NUM 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Drapo kan fis a Dan nan, selon lame yo, te fòme gad an aryè pou tout kan yo. Yo derape avèk Ahiézer, fis a Ammischaddaï sou tèt lame pa li a. <verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Paguiel, fis a Ocran an te sou tèt lame tribi a fis Aser yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>Ahira, fis a Énan an, te sou tèt lame tribi a fis Nephtali yo. <verse eid="NUM 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Konsa te lòd vwayaj la a pou fis Israël yo selon lame pa yo, lè yo te vin pati.<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Moïse te di a Hobab, fis a Réuel la, Madyanit lan, bòpè a Moïse la: “Nou ap pati pou kote ke SENYÈ a te di a, ‘Mwen va bannou li.’ Vini avèk nou, e nou va fè ou byen; paske SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:40">Det 4:40</ref></char></note>te pwomèt sa ki bon konsènan Israël.”<verse eid="NUM 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Men li te di li: “Mwen p ap vini, men olye de sa, m ap ale nan peyi pa m avèk fanmi pa mwen yo.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Alò li te di: “Souple, pa kite nou, kòmsi ou konnen kote nou dwe fè kan nan dezè a, e ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:15">Job 29:15</ref></char></note>va pou nou tankou zye nou. <verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Se konsa sa va ye, ke si ou ale avèk nou, ke nenpòt sa ki bon ke SENYÈ a fè pou nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:34">Lev 19:34</ref></char></note>nou va fè pou ou tou.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Konsa yo te pati soti nan mòn SENYÈ a, yon vwayaj twa jou avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:33">Det 1:33</ref></char></note>lach temwayaj SENYÈ a ki te vwayaje pandan twa jou devan yo pou chache yon kote pou yo kab poze. <verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:15-23">Nonb 9:15-23</ref></char></note>Nwaj SENYÈ a te sou yo nan lajounen lè yo te kite kan an.<verse eid="NUM 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/>Epi li te vin rive ke lè lach la te derape ke Moïse te di: “Leve O SENYÈ! Kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:10">Det 7:10</ref></char></note>sila ki rayi Ou yo Sove ale devan Ou.”<verse eid="NUM 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Lè l te vin poze li te di: “Retounen, O SENYÈ a vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:10">Det 1:10</ref></char></note>bokou milye de Israël yo.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Alò, pèp la te devni kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:2">Nonb 14:2</ref> </char></note> sila ki plenyen zafè pwoblèm nan zòrèy a SENYÈ a. Lè SENYÈ a te tande sa, kòlè li te vin limen, dife SENYÈ a te brile pami yo. Li te detwi kèk nan yo nan zòn deyò kan an. <verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:11-13">Nonb 12:11-13</ref> </char></note> Pou sa, pèp la te kriye fò bay Moïse. Moïse te priye bay SENYÈ a, e dife a te ralanti. <verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>Konsa, non a kote sa a te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:22">Det 9:22</ref> </char></note> Tabeéra akoz dife SENYÈ a ki te brile pami yo.<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:6">I Kor 10:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Sanzave nan mele yo ki te pami yo te gen lide voras. Menm fis Israël yo tou te kriye dlo nan zye ankò. Yo te di: “Kilès k ap bannou vyann pou nou manje? <verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:3">Egz 16:3</ref> </char></note> Nou sonje pwason ke nou te konn manje gratis nan peyi Égypte, avèk konkonb ak melon, zonyon, ak lay; <verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>men koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5">Nonb 21:5</ref> </char></note> nanm nou vin sèch. Nanpwen anyen pou nou ta gade sof ke lamàn sa a.”<verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:31">Egz 16:31</ref> </char>
    </note> Alò, lamàn nan te tankou grenn pitimi avèk aparans gonm arabik. <verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8"/>Pèp la t ap fè ale retou pou ranmase li. Yo te moulen li antre de wòch moulen, oswa bat li nan yon pilon, bouyi li nan yon chodyè, epi fè gato avèk li. Li gen gou tankou gou a gato ki fèt ak lwil. <verse eid="NUM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:13-14">Egz 16:13-14</ref> </char></note> Lè lawouze te vin tonbe nan kan an pandan nwit lan, lamàn te tonbe avè l.<verse eid="NUM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Alò, Moïse te tande pèp la ki t ap kriye pami tout fanmi yo, chak mesye nan pòtay a tant li. Konsa, chalè a SENYÈ a te vin limen anpil, e Moïse te malkontan. <verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:22">Egz 5:22</ref> </char></note> Pou sa, Moïse te di SENYÈ a: “Poukisa Ou te tèlman di avèk sèvitè Ou a? Epi poukisa mwen pa t jwenn favè nan zye ou, ke Ou te vin mete chaj tout pèp sa a sou Mwen? <verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>Èske se mwen menm ki te vin peple fè tout pèp sa a? Èske se mwen menm ki te fè yo vin parèt pou Ou ta di mwen: ‘Pote yo nan sen ou tankou yon fanm nouris pote yon ti bebe k ap tete, pou rive nan yon peyi ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:7">Jen 24:7</ref> </char></note> Ou te sèmante a papa yo?’ <verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13"/>Kote mwen ap jwenn vyann pou bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:21-22">Nonb 11:21-22</ref> </char></note> tout pèp sa a? Paske yo kriye devan m! Yo te di: ‘Bannou vyann pou nou kapab manje!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:18">Egz 18:18</ref> </char></note> Mwen sèl mwen p ap kab pote tout pèp sa a; se twòp chaj pou mwen. <verse eid="NUM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Egz 32:32</ref> </char></note> Konsa, si W ap aji konsa avè m, souple touye mwen koulye a; konsa, si Mwen pa t twouve favè nan zye Ou, pa kite mwen vin wè mizè mwen.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Rasanble pou Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:1-9">Egz 24:1-9</ref> </char></note> swasann-dis nonm ki soti nan ansyen Israël yo, pami sila a ou konnen kòm ansyen a pèp la, ak ofisyèl yo. Mennen yo nan tant asanble a e kite yo vin fè kanpe pa yo ansanm avè w la a. <verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>Alò, Mwen va vin desann pou pale avèk ou la a. Konsa, Mwen va pran nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:6">I Sam 10:6</ref> </char></note> lespri ki sou ou a, pou mete li sou yo; epi yo va pote fado a avèk ou, pou ou pa oblije pote li ou sèl ou.<verse eid="NUM 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>“Di a pèp la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:10-22">Egz 19:10-22</ref> </char></note> ‘Konsakre nou pou demen e nou va manje vyann; paske nou te kriye nan zòrèy SENYÈ a, e te di: “O ke yon moun bannou vyann pou nou manje! Paske nou te byen okipe an Égypte.” Konsa, SENYÈ a va bannou vyann, e nou va manje. <verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>Nou va manje, pa pou yon jou, ni de jou, ni senk jou, ni di jou, ni ven jou, <verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>men yon mwa nèt, jis li vin sòti nan nen nou, e vin abominab pou nou; akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:27">Jos 24:27</ref> </char></note> nou te rejte SENYÈ a ki pami nou, e nou te kriye devan Li pou te di: “Poukisa nou te janmen kite Égypte?”’”<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Men Moïse te di: “Pèp pami sila Mwen ye a se sis-san-mil sou pye; sepandan, Ou te di, ‘Mwen va bay yo vyann, pou yo kab manje jis yon mwa nèt.’<verse eid="NUM 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>“Si bann mouton avèk twoupo yo ta touye pou yo èske sa ta sifi pou yo?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Èske pouvwa SENYÈ a limite? Koulye a, ou va wè si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:25">Éz 12:25</ref></char></note>pawòl Mwen va vin vrè pou ou oswa non.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Konsa, Moïse te sòti deyò. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:6">Nonb 11:6</ref> </char></note> di pèp la pawòl SENYÈ a. Osi, li te rasanble swasann-dis gason nan ansyen pami pèp la, e li te estasyone yo antoure tant la. <verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:17">Nonb 11:17</ref> </char></note> Alò, SENYÈ a te vin desann nan nwaj la, e Li te pale avèk li. Li te pran nan Lespri ki te sou li a, e li te plase Li sou swasann-dis ansyen yo. Epi lè Lespri a te poze sou yo, yo te pwofetize. Men yo pa t fè sa ankò.<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Men de mesye nan ansyen yo te rete nan kan an; Non a youn te Eldad, e non a lòt la te Médad. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:2">Nonb 24:2</ref> </char></note> Lespri a te vin rete sou yo. Yo menm te pami sila ki te anrejistre kòm ansyen yo, men ki pa t sòti pou ale nan tant lan; men yo te pwofetize nan kan an. <verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Konsa, yon jennonm te kouri di Moïse: “Eldad avèk Médad ap pwofetize nan kan an.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:11">Egz 33:11</ref> </char></note> Josué, fis a Nun nan, ki te sèvitè Moïse depi nan jenès li, te di: “Moïse, senyè mwen an, anpeche yo.”<verse eid="NUM 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Men Moïse te di li: “Èske ou jalou pou tèt mwen? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:5">I Kor 14:5</ref> </char></note> Pito ke tout pèp SENYÈ a te pwofèt, pou SENYÈ a ta mete Lespri Li sou yo!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Epi Moïse te retounen nan kan an, ni li, ni ansyen Israël yo.<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:26-28">Sòm 78:26-28</ref> </char>
    </note> Alò, te vin souleve yon van sòti nan SENYÈ a. Li te mennen zwazo kay sòti nan lanmè, e Li te kite yo tonbe akote kan an, anviwon distans de yon vwayaj yon jounen sou yon bò, e vwayaj a yon jounen de lòt bò a, toutotou kan an, epi plis oswa mwens de koude (twa pye) pwofondè sou sifas tè a.<verse eid="NUM 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Pèp la te pase tout jounen, tout nwit lan, ak tout jou aprè a nan ranmase zòtolan. Sila ki te ranmase mwens lan, te ranmase dis omè (ven lit), e yo te poze yo gaye pou yo toupatou nan kan an. <verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:29-31">Sòm 78:29-31</ref> </char></note> Pandan vyann nan te toujou nan dan yo, avan yo te menm moulen li, kòlè SENYÈ a te vin limen kont pèp la, e SENYÈ a te frape pèp la avèk yon epidemi byen sevè. <verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Konsa, non a kote sa a te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:22">Det 9:22</ref> </char></note> Kibroth Hattaava, akoz ke se ladann, yo te antere pèp ki te voras yo.<verse eid="NUM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Soti nan Kibroth Hattaava, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:17">Nonb 33:17</ref> </char></note> pèp la te ale Hazeroth, e yo te vin rete Hazeroth.<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Marie avèk Aaron te vin pale kont Moïse akoz fanm Koushit ke li te marye a; paske li te marye avèk yon fanm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:21">Egz 2:21</ref> </char></note> Koushit; <verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:3">Nonb 16:3</ref> </char></note> Konsa, yo te di: “Èske SENYÈ a vrèman te pale sèlman ak Moïse? Èske Li pa t pale ak nou menm tou?” Epi SENYÈ a te tande sa.<verse eid="NUM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Alò, nonm Moïse la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mat 11:29</ref> </char></note> trè enb, plis pase tout moun ki te sou sifas latè a.<verse eid="NUM 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Sibitman, SENYÈ a te di a Moïse ak Aaron avèk Marie: “Nou twa a, vin sòti nan tant asanble a”. Alò, yo twa a te sòti. <verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>Epi SENYÈ a te desann nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:9">Egz 19:9</ref> </char></note> pilye nwaj. Li te kanpe nan pòtay tant asanble a, e Li te rele Aaron avèk Marie. Yo toude te vin avanse. <verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>Li te di: “Koute pawòl Mwen koulye a: Si gen yon pwofèt pami nou, Mwen, SENYÈ a, Mwen va fè Mwen menm vin rekonèt a li menm nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:15">I Sam 3:15</ref> </char></note> vizyon. Mwen va pale avèk li nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:11">Jen 31:11</ref></char></note> rèv. <verse eid="NUM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/>Se pa konsa avèk sèvitè Mwen, Moïse. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:2-5">Eb 3:2-5</ref> </char></note> Li fidèl nan tout kay Mwen; <verse eid="NUM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>Avèk li, Mwen pale bouch a bouch, byen klè, pa nan pawòl parabòl, epi li wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:10-11">Egz 24:10-11</ref> </char></note> fòm SENYÈ a menm. Poukisa, konsa, nou pa t pè pou pale kont sèvitè Mwen an, kont Moïse?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>Epi kòlè SENYÈ a te brile kont yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:22">Jen 17:22</ref> </char></note> Li te pati. <verse eid="NUM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>Lè nwaj la te kite tant lan, vwala, Marie te gen lalèp, blan tankou lanèj.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 12:10">Epi lè Aaron te gade, alò, Marie te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:6">Egz 4:6</ref> </char></note> lalèp. <verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>Aaron te di Moïse: “O senyè Mwen an! Mwen mande ou souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:19">II Sam 19:19</ref> </char></note> pa konte peche sa a kont nou, nan sila nou te aji avèk foli a, ak nan sila nou te peche a. <verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>O Pa kite chè Marie rete kòm yon timoun ki fenk fèt mouri, ki sòti nan vant manman li avèk chè li mwatye manje!”<verse eid="NUM 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Moïse te kriye fò bay SENYÈ a. Li te di: “O Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:26">És 30:26</ref> </char></note> geri li, mwen priye Ou!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/>Men SENYÈ a te reponn Moïse: “Si papa li te sèlman krache nan figi li, èske li pa t ap pote wont li pandan sèt jou? Kite li rete fèmen pandan sèt jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:1-4">Nonb 5:1-4</ref> </char></note> deyò kan an. Apre, l ap kapab rantre ankò.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Konsa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:9">Det 24:9</ref> </char></note> Marie te fèmen deyò kan an pandan sèt jou, e pèp la pa t deplase jiskaske Marie te vin rantre ankò.<verse eid="NUM 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Apre sa a, pèp la te deplase kite Hatséroth pou te fè kan nan dezè Paran an.<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:22-23">Det 1:22-23</ref> </char></note> SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:22">Det 1:22</ref> </char></note> Voye mesye ki kapab fè espyonaj nan peyi Canaran ke Mwen va bay fis Israël yo. Ou va voye yon nonm sòti nan chak tribi zansèt a papa pa yo, youn nan chèf pami yo.<verse eid="NUM 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3"/>Konsa, Moïse te voye yo soti nan dezè Paran an selon kòmand a SENYÈ a. Yo tout te chèf a fis Israël yo.<verse eid="NUM 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>Sa yo, alò, se te non yo: soti nan tribi Ruben an, Schammua, fis a Zaccur a; <verse eid="NUM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>soti nan tribi a Siméon an: Schaphath, fis a Hori a; <verse eid="NUM 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>pou tribi a Juda a: Caleb, fis a Jephaunné a; <verse eid="NUM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>pou tribi a Issacar a: Jigual, fis a Joseph la; <verse eid="NUM 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>pou tribi a Ephraïm nan: Hosée, fis a Nun nan <verse eid="NUM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>pou tribi a Benjamin an: Palthi, fis a Raphu a; <verse eid="NUM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>pou tribi a Zabulon an: Gaddiel, fis a Sodi a; <verse eid="NUM 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>pou tribi a Joseph la, tribi a Manassé a: Gaddi, fis a Sisi a; <verse eid="NUM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>pou tribi a Dan nan: Ammiel, fis a Guemalli a; <verse eid="NUM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>pou tribi a Hacer a: Sethur, fis a Micaël la; <verse eid="NUM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>pou tribi a Nephtali a: Nachbi, fis a Vophsi a; <verse eid="NUM 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>pou tribi a Gad la: Guéuel, fis a Maki a.<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Sa yo, se non a mesye ke Moïse te voye pou fè espyonaj peyi a. Men Moïse te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:8">Nonb 13:8</ref> </char></note> Hosée, fis a Nun nan, Josué. <verse eid="NUM 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Lè Moïse te voye yo espyone peyi Canaan an, li te di yo: “Monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:9">Jen 12:9</ref> </char></note> negev la; epi monte toujou nan peyi ti kolin yo. <verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>Kontwole pou wè kijan peyi a ye, si pèp ki rete ladann nan, gen fòs, oswa si yo fèb, e si yo gen anpil, oswa pa anpil moun. <verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>Kijan tè kote yo viv la ye, kit li bon, oswa pa bon? Epi kijan vil kote yo viv la ye, èske se kan san pwotèj, oswa avèk fò? <verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>Kijan tè a ye? Èske li rich, oswa pòv? Si gen pyebwa oswa si pa genyen? Epi fè yon efò pou pran kèk nan fwi peyi a.” Alò, se te tan ke premye rezen yo t ap vin mi.<verse eid="NUM 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Se konsa, yo te monte pou te fè espyonaj sou peyi a soti nan dezè a Tsin nan, jis pou rive Rehob, nan chemen Hamath (Lebo-Hamath) lan. <verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>Lè yo te fin monte Negev, yo te rive Hébron kote Ahiman, Schéschaï ak Talmaï, desandan a Anak yo te ye a. (Alò, Hébron te bati sèt ane avan Tsoan an Égypte.) <verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>Yo te rive nan vale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:24">Nonb 13:24</ref> </char></note> Eschcol e soti la, yo te koupe yon sèl branch avèk yon sèl grap rezen; epi yo te pote li sou yon poto antre de gason avèk kèk grenad ak pye fig frans. <verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>Kote sa a te vin rele vale a Eschcol, akoz gwo grap rezen ke fis Israël la te koupe fè desann soti la yo. <verse eid="NUM 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Yo te sòti retounen nan espyonaj peyi a, nan fen karant jou yo. <verse eid="NUM 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>Yo te vini vè Moïse avèk Aaron ak tout kongregasyon a fis Israël yo nan dezè Paran an, vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:1-14">Nonb 20:1-14</ref> </char></note> Kadès; epi yo te pote nouvèl la pou di a tout kongregasyon an, e pou te montre yo fwi peyi a. <verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>Konsa, yo te pale li. Yo te di: “Nou te antre nan peyi kote nou te voye nou an. Vrèman, li koule avèk lèt ak siwo myèl, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:25">Det 1:25</ref> </char></note> sa a se fwi li.<verse eid="NUM 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>“Sepandan, pèp ki rete la yo, gen fòs, vil yo byen fòtifye, byen gwo. Anplis, nou te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Nonb 13:33</ref> </char></note> desandan Anak yo la. <verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Desandan a Amalèk yo ap viv nan peyi Negev la, Etyen yo, Jebisyen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:6">Jos 10:6</ref> </char></note> Amoreyen yo ap viv nan mòn yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:43-45">Nonb 14:43-45</ref> </char></note> Kananeyen yo ap viv bò kote lanmè ak bò kote rivyè Jourdain an.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Men Caleb te kalme pèp la devan Moïse e te di: “Sètènman, nou dwe monte pran posesyon a peyi a, paske nou va, anverite, konkeri li.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Men mesye ki te monte avè l yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:28">Det 1:28</ref> </char></note> “Nou pa kapab monte kont pèp la, paske yo twò fò pou nou.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32"/>Konsa, yo te livre yon move rapò a fis Israël yo sou peyi kote yo te fè ankèt la. Yo te di: “Peyi kote nou te ale a, nan ankèt sa a, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:13-14">Éz 36:13-14</ref> </char></note> yon peyi ki devore moun li ye, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:9">Am 2:9</ref></char></note>tout pèp ke nou te wè ladann yo, se moun ki byen gran. <verse eid="NUM 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33"/>La, osi, nou te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:4">Jen 6:4</ref> </char></note> jeyan, fis a Anak yo ki soti nan jeyan yo. Konsa, nou te vin tankou krikèt nan pwòp zye nou ak nan zye pa yo.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Epi tout kongregasyon an te leve vwa yo pou te rele, e pèp la te kriye nan nwit lan. <verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>Tout fis Israël yo te bougonnen kont Moïse ak Aaron. Tout kongregasyon an te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:5">Nonb 11:5</ref> </char></note> “Pito ke nou te mouri nan peyi Égypte la! O pito nou te mouri nan dezè sa a! <verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>Poukisa SENYÈ a ap mennen nou nan peyi sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:21">Egz 5:21</ref> </char></note> pou tonbe anba nepe? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:31">Nonb 14:31</ref></char></note> Madanm nou yo avèk pitit nou yo va devni piyay. Èske li pa t ap pi bon pou nou pou retounen an Égypte?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>Epi yo te di youn lòt: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:17">Nonb 9:17</ref> </char></note> “Annou chwazi yon chèf, pou retounen an Égypte.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:4">Nonb 16:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Konsa, Moïse avèk Aaron te tonbe sou figi yo nan prezans a tout asanble kongregasyon a fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Josué, fis a Nun lan avèk Caleb, fis a Jephaunné a, nan sila ki te fè espyonaj nan peyi a, te chire rad yo. <verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>Yo te pale avèk tout kongregasyon a fis Israël yo, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:27">Nonb 13:27</ref> </char></note> “Peyi ke nou te pase ladann pou fè ankèt la, se yon vrèman bon peyi. <verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:15">Det 10:15</ref> </char></note> Si SENYÈ a kontan avèk nou, alò, Li va mennen nou nan peyi sa a pou bannou li—yon peyi ki koule avèk lèt ak siwo myèl. <verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/>Sèlman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:26">Det 1:26</ref> </char></note> pa fè rebèl kont SENYÈ a; ni pa pè pèp peyi sa a, paske, nou va devore yo. Pwoteksyon yo ale, e SENYÈ a avèk nou. Pa pè yo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Men tout kongregasyon an te kòmanse lapide yo avèk kout wòch. Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:10">Egz 16:10</ref> </char></note> laglwa SENYÈ a te parèt nan tant asanble a a tout fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Pou konbyen de tan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:24">Sòm 106:24</ref> </char></note> moun sa yo va desann mwen konsa? Pou konbyen de tan yo va refize kwè nan Mwen, malgre tout sign ke M te fè nan mitan yo? <verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>Mwen va frape yo avèk gwo mizè. Mwen va dizerite yo. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:10">Egz 32:10</ref> </char></note> fè ou menm vin fòme yon nasyon pi gwo e pi fò ke yo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Egz 32:11-14</ref> </char>
    </note> Men Moïse te reponn SENYÈ a: “Alò Ejipsyen yo va tande bagay sa a, paske pa pwisans Ou, Ou te mennen fè monte pèp sa a soti nan mitan yo. <verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>Konsa, yo va pale sa a sila ki rete nan peyi sila yo. Yo te tande ke Ou menm, O SENYÈ a, rete nan mitan pèp sa a. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Egz 13:21</ref> </char></note> Ou menm, O SENYÈ a, yo fè wè fasafas, e nwaj Ou kanpe sou yo; epi Ou ale devan yo nan yon pilye nwaj pandan lajounen ak yon pilye dife pandan lannwit la. <verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15"/>Alò, si ou touye pèp sa a tankou se yon sèl moun, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:12">Egz 32:12</ref> </char></note> alò, nasyon ki te tande tout istwa Ou yo, va di: <verse eid="NUM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16"/>‘Akoz SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:7">Jos 7:7</ref> </char></note> pa t kab mennen pèp sa nan peyi ke Li te pwomèt yo avèk sèman an, pou sa, li te detwi yo nan dezè a.’<verse eid="NUM 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17"/>“Men koulye a, mwen priye, pou pwisans a SENYÈ a vin gwo, jis jan ke Ou te deklare a, <verse eid="NUM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 145:8">Sòm 145:8</ref> </char></note> ‘SENYÈ a lan nan fè kòlè; Li ranpli avèk lanmou dous, ki padone inikite avèk transgresyon yo. Li p ap janm bliye tò a koupab yo, men Li va vizite inikite a papa yo sou pitit yo jis rive nan twazyèm ak katriyèm jenerasyon.’<verse eid="NUM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:32">Egz 32:32</ref> </char>
    </note> “Padone, mwen priye Ou, inikite a pèp sa a selon grandè lanmou dous Ou a, jis jan ke Ou menm, osi, te padone pèp sa a, depi an Égypte pou jis rive koulye a.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:18-20">Mi 7:18-20</ref> </char></note> “Mwen te padone yo, jan ou te mande a; <verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/>men vrèman, jan Mwen viv la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:3">És 6:3</ref> </char></note> tout latè va ranpli avèk laglwa SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>Vrèman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:5">I Kor 10:5</ref> </char></note> tout mesye ki te wè glwa Mwen ak sign Mwen te fè an Égypte ak nan dezè a, malgre sa, yo vin pase Mwen a leprèv pandan menm dis fwa sa yo, e yo pa t koute vwa M. <verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>Pa gen youn nan yo k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:65">Nonb 26:65</ref> </char></note> wè peyi ke M te sèmante a papa yo a, ni p ap gen nan sila ki te rejte M yo, k ap wè l. <verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/>Men sèvitè Mwen an, Caleb, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:6-9">Nonb 14:6-9</ref> </char></note> akoz li te gen yon lòt lespri, e li te swiv Mwen nèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:6-15">Jos 14:6-15</ref></char></note>Mwen va mennen l nan peyi kote li te antre a, e desandan li yo va vin pran posesyon li. <verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:29">Nonb 13:29</ref> </char></note> Alò, moun Amalec avèk Canaran yo ap viv nan vale yo. Vire demen pou pati pou dezè a pa chemen Lamè Wouj la.<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>“SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse, e te di: <verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>Pou konbyen de tan, Mwen va sipòte kongregasyon mechan sila k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:1">Nonb 11:1</ref> </char></note> bougonnen kont Mwen an? Mwen fenk tande plent ke fis Israël yo ap fè kont Mwen.<verse eid="NUM 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>“Di yo: ‘Jan Mwen vivan an, di SENYÈ a, mwen va fè pou ou tout bagay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:14-15">Det 2:14-15</ref> </char></note> jan Mwen te tande ou di a. <verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:17">Eb 3:17</ref> </char></note> Kadav nou yo va tonbe nan dezè sila a, menm tout mesye konte yo, nou tout soti nan ventan oswa plis, ki te bougonnen kont Mwen yo, <verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>vrèman, nou p ap antre nan peyi kote Mwen te sèmante pou mete nou an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:24">Nonb 14:24</ref> </char></note> sof Caleb, fis a Jephunné a ak Jousé, fis a Nun nan. <verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:3">Nonb 14:3</ref> </char></note> pitit nou yo, ke nou te di ki ta devni yon objè lachas— Mwen va mennen yo antre ladann. Yo va konnen peyi ke nou menm te rejte a.<verse eid="NUM 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:64-65">Nonb 26:64-65</ref> </char>
    </note>“‘Men pou nou menm, kadav nou va tonbe nan dezè sila a. <verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/>Fis nou yo va vin bèje pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:7">Det 2:7</ref> </char></note>karantan nan dezè a, e yo va soufri pou enfidelite nou yo jiskaske kadav nou kouche nan dezè a. <verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Selon nonb de jou ke nou te fè ankèt nan peyi a, karant jou, pou chak jou, nou va pote inikite nou yo pandan 1 nan, Ki fè karantan total, e nou va konprann opozisyon Mwen an.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Nonb 23:19</ref> </char></note>Mwen, SENYÈ a te pale. Se vrèman sa Mwen va fè a tout kongregasyon mechan sila ki rasanble kont Mwen an. Nan dezè sa a, yo va vin detwi, e la yo va mouri.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 13:4-32">Nonb 13:4-32</ref> </char>
    </note>Pou mesye ke Moïse te voye pou fè ankèt nan peyi a, e ki te retounen pou fè tout kongregasyon an bougonnen kont Li yo lè yo te vin sòti avèk yon move rapò sou peyi a, <verse eid="NUM 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37"/>menm mesye sila yo ki te fè sòti rapò byen move a, yo te vin mouri akoz yon epidemi devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>Men Josué, fis Nun nan ak Caleb, fis a Jephaunné a te rete vivan pami sila ki te ale fè espyonaj peyi a.<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>Lè Moïse te pale pawòl sa yo a tout fis Israël yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:4">Egz 33:4</ref></char></note>pèp la te leve fè gwo lamantasyon. <verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Sepandan, nan maten, yo te leve bonè, yo te monte vè krèt kolin ki nan peyi kolin yo. Yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:41-44">Det 1:41-44</ref> </char></note>“Men nou isit la! Nou te vrèman fè peche, men nou va monte vè kote ke SENYÈ a te pwomèt la.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Men Moïse te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:20">II Kwo 24:20</ref> </char></note>“Poukisa nou ap transgrese kòmandman a SENYÈ a, lè sa p ap reyisi? <verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:42">Det 1:42</ref> </char></note>Pa monte, oswa nou va frape devan lènmi nou yo, paske SENYÈ a pa pami nou. <verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Paske, moun Amalec yo ak Kananeyen yo va la devan nou, e nou va vin tonbe anba nepe, akoz ke nou te vire an aryè kite SENYÈ a. Konsa, SENYÈ a p ap avèk nou.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>Men san prekosyon, yo te monte nan krèt peyi kolin nan. Men ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:6">Nonb 31:6</ref> </char></note>lach temwayaj la, ni Moïse te kite kan an. <verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>Alò, moun Amalec yo avèk Kananeyen ki te rete nan peyi kolin yo, te vin desann. Yo te frape yo, e te bat yo jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:3">Nonb 21:3</ref> </char></note>Horma.<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo. Di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:10">Lev 23:10</ref> </char></note>‘Lè nou antre nan peyi kote nou dwe viv la, peyi ke Mwen ap bannou an, <verse eid="NUM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>alò, fè yon ofrann pa dife a SENYÈ a—yon ofrann brile, oswa yon sakrifis pou akonpli yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:21">Lev 22:21</ref> </char></note>ve espesyal, swa kòm yon ofrann bòn volonte, swa nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:1-44">Lev 23:1-44</ref></char></note>tan apwente yo, pou fè yon odè ki santi bon a SENYÈ a, soti nan twoupo oswa nan bann mouton— <verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:1-31">Nonb 28:1-31</ref> </char></note>sila ki prezante ofrann li an, va prezante bay SENYÈ a yon ofrann sereyal de yon dizyèm efa farin fen mele avèk yon ka lwil. <verse eid="NUM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5"/>Ou va prepare diven pou ofrann bwason an, yon ka boutèy, avèk ofrann brile a oswa pou sakrifis la, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:34">Lev 19:34</ref></char></note>chak jenn mouton.<verse eid="NUM 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>“‘Oswa pou yon belye, ou va prepare kòm yon ofrann sereyal, de dizyèm efa farin fen mele avèk yon tyè boutèy lwil; <verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>epi pou ofrann bwason an, ou va ofri yon tyè boutèy diven kòm yon odè santi bon a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>“‘Lè ou fin prepare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:3">Lev 1:3</ref> </char></note>yon towo kòm yon ofrann brile, oswa yon sakrifis pou akonpli yon ve espesyal, oswa ofrann lapè bay SENYÈ a, <verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9"/>alò, ou va ofri avèk towo a yon ofrann sereyal fèt ak twa dizyèm efa farin fen mele avèk yon mwatye boutèy lwil; <verse eid="NUM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10"/>epi ou va ofri kòm ofrann bwason, yon mwatye boutèy diven kòm yon ofrann pa dife, kòm yon odè ki bon a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>Konsa, li va fèt pou chak bèf, oswa chak belye, oswa chak nan jenn mouton mal yo, oswa kabrit yo. <verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Selon kantite ke nou prepare yo, konsa nou va fè pou chak selon kantite ki genyen an.<verse eid="NUM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>“‘Tout sila ki natif peyi yo, yo va fè bagay sa yo nan menm mod la, nan prezante yon ofrann pa dife a, kòm yon odè ki bon a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Si yon etranje vin demere pami nou, oswa youn ki kapab pami nou pandan tout jenerasyon yo, e li vle fè yon ofrann pa dife, kòm yon ofrann ki santi bon a SENYÈ a, menm jan ak nou, se konsa li va fè l. <verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Epi pou asanble a, va genyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:14">Nonb 9:14</ref> </char></note>yon sèl règleman pou nou ak pou etranje ki demere pami nou an, yon règleman pou tout tan pandan tout jenerasyon nou yo. Jan nou menm ye a, se konsa etranje a va ye devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/>Va genyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:22">Lev 24:22</ref> </char></note>yon sèl lwa, ak yon sèl òdonans pou nou ak pou etranje ki demere pami nou an.’”<verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo pou di yo: ‘Lè nou antre nan peyi kote Mwen mennen nou an, <verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19"/>alò konsa sa va rive, ke lè nou manje nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:11-12">Jos 5:11-12</ref> </char></note> manje peyi a, nou va leve yon ofrann bay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:26">Egz 34:26</ref> </char>
    </note>“‘Nan premye bòl farin moulen nou an, nou va fè leve yon gato kòm yon ofrann. Kòm ofrann moulen glasi, nou va leve li. <verse eid="NUM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Soti nan premye bòl farin moulen an, nou va bay SENYÈ a yon ofrann pandan tout jenerasyon nou yo. <verse eid="NUM 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>Men lè nou tonbe fè yon fòt ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:2">Lev 4:2</ref> </char></note>pa eksprè, e nou vin pa obsève tout kòmandman sila ke SENYÈ a te pale a Moïse yo— <verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande pa Moïse yo soti nan jou ke SENYÈ a te bay kòmandman an, avanse rive nèt pou tout jenerasyon yo— <verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>alò, li va konte ke si sa fèt san entansyon, e san konesans kongregasyon an, ke tout kongregasyon an va ofri yon towo kòm yon ofrann brile, kòm yon odè ki bon a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:8-10">Nonb 15:8-10</ref></char></note>avèk ofrann sereyal pa li a, ak ofrann bwason li an, selon òdonans lan, ak yon mal kabrit pou yon ofrann peche. <verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:20">Lev 4:20</ref> </char></note>prèt la va fè ekspiyasyon pou tout kongregasyon fis Israël yo, e yo va vin padone; paske se te yon erè, e yo te pote ofrann pa yo, yon ofrann pa dife bay SENYÈ a, ofrann peche pa yo devan SENYÈ a, pou erè a.<verse eid="NUM 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>“‘Konsa, tout kongregasyon fis Israël yo va vin padone, avèk etranje ki demere pami yo, paske sa te rive a tout pèp la akoz fòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:24">Nonb 15:24</ref> </char></note> erè a. <verse eid="NUM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/>Osi, si yon moun fè peche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:27-31">Lev 4:27-31</ref> </char></note>ki pa eksprè, alò, li va ofri yon femèl kabrit nan laj 1 nan kòm yon ofrann peche. <verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:35">Lev 4:35</ref> </char></note>Prèt la va fè ekspiyasyon devan SENYÈ a pou moun ki kite chemen an lè li fè peche ki pa eksprè a, pou li k ap fè ekspiyasyon pou li pou jiskaske li kapab padone. <verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Nou va genyen yon sèl lwa pou sila ki fè yon bagay ki pa eksprè, pou sila ki natif pami fis Israël yo, e pou sila ki se yon etranje k ap demere pami yo. <verse eid="NUM 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>Men moun ki fè yon bagay avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:40-44">Nonb 14:40-44</ref> </char></note> rebelyon an, menm si se yon natif, oswa yon etranje, sila ap blasfeme SENYÈ a. Nanm sa va koupe retire de pèp li a. <verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:9">II Sam 12:9</ref> </char></note>Akoz ke li te meprize pawòl a SENYÈ a, e li te vyole kòmandman Li an, moun sa a va konplètman koupe retire. Koupabilite li va rete sou li.’”<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Alò, pandan fis Israël yo te nan dezè a, yo te twouve yon nonm ki t ap ranmase bwa nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:14-15">Egz 31:14-15</ref> </char></note>jou Saba a. <verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>Sila ki te twouve li yo nan ranmase bwa a te mennen li vè Moïse avèk Aaron, ak tout asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>Konsa, yo te arete li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:8">Nonb 9:8</ref> </char></note>akoz ke li potko deside kisa pou fè avèk li. <verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Nonm nan va vrèman vin mete a lanmò. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:14-23">Lev 24:14-23</ref> </char></note>Tout kongregasyon an va lapide li avèk kout wòch deyò kan an.”<verse eid="NUM 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>Konsa, tout kongregasyon an te mennen li deyò kan an, e yo te lapide li jiska lanmò avèk kout wòch, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>SENYÈ a te osi pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo e di yo ke yo va fè pou yo menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:12">Det 22:12</ref> </char></note>ponpon sou kwen vètman yo pandan tout jenerasyon yo, e ke yo va mete sou ponpon nan chak kwen an, yon kòd ble. <verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>Se va yon ponpon pou nou gade, e pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:23">Det 4:23</ref> </char></note>sonje tout kòmandman SENYÈ yo, pou nou obeyi yo, e pa pwostitiye tèt nou jan noun te kon fè, nan swiv dezi pwòp kè nou ak zye nou, <verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>e pou nou sonje pou fè tout kòmandman Mwen yo, e pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Lev 11:44-45</ref> </char></note> rete sen a Bondye nou an.<verse eid="NUM 15:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>“Mwen menm se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ki te mennen nou sòti nan peyi Égypte la, pou M kab vin Bondye nou. Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1"/>Alò, Koré, fis a Jitsehar, ansanm avèk Dathan ak Abiram, fis a Éliab avèk On, fis a Péleth, fis a Ruben yo, te pran desizyon. Yo te pran moun avèk yo, <verse eid="NUM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2"/>epi yo te vin souleve devan Moïse. Ansanm avèk kèk nan fis Israël yo, de-san-senkant nan chèf kongregasyon an, mesye ki te byen rekonèt, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:16">Nonb 1:16</ref> </char></note>chwazi pa asanble a, <verse eid="NUM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>yo te reyini ansanm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:16">Sòm 106:16</ref> </char></note>kont Moïse avèk Aaron. Yo te di yo: “Nou te ale ase lwen, paske tout kongregasyon an sen, yo tout, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:3">Nonb 5:3</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a nan mitan yo! Konsa, poukisa nou egzalte tèt nou pi wo pase asanble SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Lè Moïse te tande sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:5">Nonb 14:5</ref> </char></note>li te tonbe sou figi li. <verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>Li te pale avèk Koré ak tout konpanyen li yo. Li te di: “Demen maten, SENYÈ a va montre kilès ki apatyen ak Li e kilès ki sen, epi Li va fè moun sa a vin touprè Li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 17:5-8">Nonb 17:5-8</ref> </char></note>Menm sila ke Li chwazi a, Li va mennen li toupre Li menm. <verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6"/>Fè sa: Fè Koré ak tout konpanyen li pran asanswa a pou kont nou. <verse eid="NUM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7"/>Konsa, mete dife ladann, e poze lansan sou yo nan prezans a SENYÈ a, demen. Moun nan ke SENYÈ a chwazi a, va sila ki sen an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:3">Nonb 16:3</ref> </char></note>Nou gen tan ale ase lwen, fis a Levi yo!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Moïse te di a Koré: “Tande koulye a fis a Levi yo! <verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:13">És 7:13</ref> </char></note>Èske li pa sifi pou nou ke Bondye Israël la te separe nou soti nan tout rès kongregasyon Israël la, pou mennen nou touprè a Li menm? Pou fè sèvis tabènak SENYÈ a, e pou vin kanpe devan kongregasyon an pou sèvi yo? <verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>E ke li te mennen nou touprè, tout frè ou yo Koré, fis a Levi yo avèk ou? Epi èske w ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:10">Nonb 3:10</ref> </char></note>chache pozisyon prèt la tou? <verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>Pou sa, ou menm avèk tout konpanyen ou yo vin rasanble ansanm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:7">Egz 16:7</ref> </char></note>kont SENYÈ a! Men pou Aaron, kilès li ye pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:10">I Kor 10:10</ref></char></note>nou vin plenyen kont li?”<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Konsa, Moïse te voye yon lòd bay Dathan avèk Abiram, fis a Éliab yo, men yo te di: “Nou p ap monte.” <verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>Èske sa pa ase ke ou te mennen nou sòti nan yon peyi ki koule avèk lèt ak siwo myèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:2-3">Nonb 14:2-3</ref> </char></note>pou fè nou vin mouri nan dezè a, men ou ta, osi, vin chèf sou nou?<verse eid="NUM 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>Vrèman, ou pa t mennen nou nan yon peyi ki koule avèk lèt ak siwo myèl, ni ou pa t bannou yon eritaj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:10-11">Egz 23:10-11</ref> </char></note>tèren, avèk chan rezen. Èske ou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:2">I Sam 11:2</ref></char></note>pete zye a mesye sa yo? Nou p ap monte? <verse eid="NUM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Alò Moïse te vin byen fache. Li te di a SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:4-5">Jen 4:4-5</ref> </char></note>“Pa aksepte ofrann pa yo! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:3">I Sam 12:3</ref></char></note>Mwen pa t pran menm yon bourik nan men yo, ni mwen pa t fè mal a okenn nan yo.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Moïse te di a Koré: “Ou menm avèk tout konpanyen ou yo, parèt devan SENYÈ a demen; ni ou menm, yo menm ansanm avèk Aaron. <verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Chak nan nou pran veso dife li, mete lansan sou li, e chak nan nou pote veso lansan an devan SENYÈ a, de-san-senkant veso dife; osi ou menm avèk Aaron va chak pote veso dife pa li a.” <verse eid="NUM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>Konsa, yo chak te pran pwòp veso dife a e te mete dife ladann. Yo te mete lansan sou li, epi yo te kanpe nan pòtay tant asanble a, avèk Moïse ak Aaron. <verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Konsa, Koré te rasanble tout kongregasyon anfas yo a nan pòtay a tant asanble a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:19">Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:10">Nonb 14:10</ref> </char></note>glwa a SENYÈ a te vin parèt a tout kongregasyon an. <verse eid="NUM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse ak Aaron, e te di: <verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:45">Nonb 16:45</ref> </char></note>“Separe nou nan mitan kongregasyon sila a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:10-12">Egz 32:10-12</ref></char></note>pou Mwen kapab manje yo koulye a.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Men yo te tonbe sou figi yo e te di: “O Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:16">Nonb 27:16</ref> </char></note>Bondye a lespri de tout chè a, èske Ou va an kòlè avèk tout kongregasyon an lè yon sèl moun fè peche?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24"/>“Pale avèk kongregasyon an e di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:45">Nonb 16:45</ref> </char></note> ‘Sòti nan andwa tant Koré yo, Dathan avèk Abiram!’”<verse eid="NUM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Alò, Moïse te leve ale vè Dathan ak Abiram, avèk ansyen a Israël ki t ap swiv li yo. <verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>Li te pale avèk kongregasyon an. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">És 52:11</ref> </char></note>“Kite tant a moun mechan sa yo, e pa touche anyen ki pou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:15">Jen 19:15</ref></char></note>sinon, nou va vin pote ale ak tout peche yo.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Konsa, yo te soti nan tant a Koré yo, Dathan ak Abiram de tout kote. Dathan ak Abiram te vin kanpe nan pòtay tant pa yo a, ansanm avèk madanm yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:11">Nonb 26:11</ref> </char></note>fis yo, ansanm ak timoun yo.<verse eid="NUM 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>Moïse te di: “Selon sa, nou va konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12-15">Egz 3:12-15</ref> </char></note>SENYÈ a te voye mwen pou fè tout zèv sa yo; paske sa se pa nan tèt mwen y ap soti. <verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Si mesye sila yo mouri yon mò natirèl, oswa si yo soufri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:19">Ekl 3:19</ref> </char></note>desten a tout moun nòmal, alò SENYÈ a pa t voye mwen. <verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Men si SENYÈ a fè vin parèt yon bagay tounèf, tè a vin ouvri bouch li pou vale yo nèt avèk tout sa ki pou yo, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 55:15">Sòm 55:15</ref> </char></note>desann tou vivan kote mò yo ye a, alò, konsa, nou va konprann ke mesye sila yo te meprize SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Pandan li te fin pale tout pawòl sa yo, tè ki te anba yo a te fann e li te ouvri. <verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:6">Det 11:6</ref> </char></note>latè te louvri bouch li e te vale yo nèt avèk moun lakay yo, ak tout mesye ki te apatyen a Koré avèk tout byen yo. <verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>Konsa, yo menm avèk tout sa ki te pou yo, te desann vivan nan sejou mò yo. Tè a te vin fèmen sou yo, e yo te peri nan mitan asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>Tout Israël ki te antoure yo te sove ale pandan yo t ap rele, paske yo te di: “Tè a kapab vin vale nou nèt!”<verse eid="NUM 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:1-3">Nonb 11:1-3</ref> </char>
    </note>Dife te sòti nan SENYÈ a pou brile <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:2">Nonb 16:2</ref></char></note>de san senkant mesye ki te ofri lansan yo.<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37"/>“Di a Éléazar, fis a Aaron an, prèt la, ke li va ranmase veso lansan yo nan mitan dife a, paske yo sen. Epi nou va gaye sann dife k ap brile lwen kan an, paske yo sen. <verse eid="NUM 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38"/>Epi menm selon veso lansan a mesye sa yo ki te peche e te peye ak lavi yo, kite yo fin bat yo byen plat pou sèvi yo pou kouvri lotèl la, pwiske yo te prezante yo devan SENYÈ a. Yo sen. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:8">Éz 14:8</ref> </char></note>yo va sèvi kòm yon sign a fis Israël yo.”<verse eid="NUM 16:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39"/>Éléazar, prèt la, te pran veso lansan ki te fèt an bwonz ke mesye ki te brile yo te ofri, epi yo te bat yo pou fè yo plat pou kouvri lotèl la, <verse eid="NUM 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40"/>kòm yon sonj komemoratif a fis Israël yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:51">Nonb 1:51</ref> </char></note>pèsòn ki pa nan ras Aaron pa ta dwe pwoche pou brile lansan devan SENYÈ a; jis pou li pa devni tankou Koré ak konpanyen li yo—jis jan ke SENYÈ a te pale a li pa Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 16:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41"/>Men nan pwochen jou a, tout kongregasyon fis Israël yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:31">Nonb 16:31</ref> </char></note>bougonnen kont Moïse avèk Aaron. Yo te di: “Se nou ki touye pèp SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="NUM 16:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42"/>Lè kongregasyon an te reyini ansanm kont Moïse avèk Aaron, yo te gade vè tant asanble a, e vwala, nwaj la te kouvri li e glwa SENYÈ a te parèt. <verse eid="NUM 16:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43"/>Alò, Moïse avèk Aaron te vini devan tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 16:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te pale a Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45"/>“Mete ou lwen kongregasyon sila a, pou Mwen kapab detwi yo kounye a menm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:45">Yo te tonbe sou figi yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:21-24">Nonb 16:21-24</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 16:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46"/>Moïse te di a Aaron: “Pran veso lansan an, mete dife lotèl la ladann. Mete lansan an sou li e pote li vit bay kongregasyon an pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:6-7">És 6:6-7</ref> </char></note>fè ekspiyasyon pou yo. Paske lakòlè gen tan sòti nan SENYÈ a. Gwo epidemi an kòmanse!”<verse eid="NUM 16:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47"/>Alò Aaron te pran li jan Moïse te pale a. Li te kouri nan mitan asanble a, paske, gade byen, gwo epidemi an te kòmanse pami pèp la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:6-13">Nonb 25:6-13</ref> </char></note>Konsa li te mete lansan an pou fè ekspiyasyon pou pèp la. <verse eid="NUM 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48"/>Li te kanpe antre mò yo ak moun vivan, e gwo epidemi an te rete. <verse eid="NUM 16:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:9">Nonb 25:9</ref> </char></note>Men sila ki te mouri nan gwo epidemi yo te katòz-mil-sèt-san (14,700), anplis sila ki te mouri akoz Koré yo.<verse eid="NUM 16:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50"/>Alò, Aaron te retounen vè Moïse nan pòtay tant asanble a, paske gwo epidemi an te vin rete.<verse eid="NUM 16:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo, e pran yon branch bwa pou chak kay fanmi zansèt yo: douz branch bwa ki sòti nan tout chèf yo selon kay fanmi zansèt yo. Nou va ekri non a chak sou branch pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>Ekri non a Aaron sou branch Levi a. Konsa, va gen yon sèl branch pou tèt a chak kay fanmi zansèt yo. <verse eid="NUM 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Epi nou va depoze yo nan tant asanble a devan lach <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:16-22">Egz 25:16-22</ref> </char></note>temwayaj la, kote Mwen rankontre nou an.<verse eid="NUM 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>“Li va vin rive ke branch <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Nonb 16:5</ref> </char></note>moun ke Mwen chwazi a, va boujonnen. Konsa, Mwen va fè sispann tout bougonnen fis Israël k ap fèt kont nou menm.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Konsa, Moïse te pale avèk fis Israël yo, e tout chèf yo te bay li yon branch pou chak nan yo; pou chak chèf, selon kay fanmi zansèt yo, douz branch avèk branch Aaron an pami branch yo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>Konsa, Moïse te depoze branch yo devan SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:50-53">Nonb 1:50-53</ref> </char></note>nan tant asanble a.<verse eid="NUM 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/>Alò, nan jou apre a, Moïse te antre nan tant lan; epi vwala, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:24">Éz 17:24</ref> </char></note>branch Aaron an pou fanmi zansèt Levi a te boujonnen. E li pa t sèlman boujonnen, men li te pwodwi flè, e osi li te pote zanmann mi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Konsa, Moïse te pote deyò tout branch ki te nan prezans a SENYÈ a vè tout fis Israël yo. Yo te gade, e chak mesye te pran pwòp branch pa l.<verse eid="NUM 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>Men SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Remete branch Aaron a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 17:4">Nonb 17:4</ref> </char></note>devan lach temwayaj la, pou kenbe kòm yon sign kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:7-24">Det 9:7-24</ref></char></note>rebèl yo, pou ou kapab mete fen a plent kont Mwen yo, pou yo pa mouri.”<verse eid="NUM 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Konsa, Moïse te fè; jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande li a, konsa li te fè.<verse eid="NUM 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Alò, fis Israël yo te pale avèk Moïse e te di l: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:5">És 6:5</ref> </char></note> “Gade byen, n ap mouri, nou tout ap mouri! <verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:51">Nonb 1:51</ref> </char></note>Tout moun ki pwoche, ki vin pwoche toupre tabènak SENYÈ a, fòk li mouri. Èske nou tout va peri nèt?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di a Aaron: “Ou menm avèk fis ou yo avèk lakay zansèt ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:38">Egz 28:38</ref> </char></note>pote inikite la pou zafè sanktyè a, e nou menm avèk fis nou yo va pote inikite la kon prèt. <verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>Mennen avè w osi frè nou yo, tribi Levi a, tribi papa zansèt ou a, pou yo kapab vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-10">Nonb 3:5-10</ref> </char></note>jwenn avèk ou e sèvi ou, pandan ou menm avèk fis ou yo devan tant temwayaj la. <verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>Yo va kenbe lòd ou avèk devwa tout asanble a, men<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:15-20">Nonb 4:15-20</ref> </char></note> yo p ap pwoche veso sanktyè yo avèk lotèl la, pou yo pa mouri; ni yo, ni ou menm. <verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>Yo va vin jwenn avèk ou, e fè devwa a tant asanble a pou tout sèvis tant lan. Men yon etranje pa pou pwoche prè nou.<verse eid="NUM 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>“Konsa nou va fè tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:21">Egz 27:21</ref> </char></note>devwa a sanktyè a ak devwa a lotèl la, pou pa toujou gen kòlè sou fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>Veye byen, se Mwen Menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:12">Nonb 3:12</ref> </char></note>te pran Levit parèy nou yo pami fis Israël yo. Yo se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:9">Nonb 3:9</ref></char></note>don pou nou menm, ki dedye bay SENYÈ a, pou fè sèvis tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Men ou menm ak fis ou yo ap ranpli pozisyon prèt pou tout bagsay ki konsène otèl la, ak andedann vwal la. Ou va fè sèvis yo. Mwen ap bay ou pozisyon prèt kon yon pozisyon donnen. Men okenn lòt ki pwoche va mete a lanmò.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Aaron: “Gade byen, se Mwen Menm ki te bay ou chaj sou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 5:16-18">Lev 5:16-18</ref> </char></note>ofrann Mwen yo, menm tout don sen a fis Israël yo. Mwen te bay ou yo akoz onksyon an nou resevwa, e a fis ou yo kòm yon dwa ki pou tout tan. <verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Sila a va pou nou, soti nan don pi sen pase tout lòt yo ki rezève soti nan dife a; tout ofrann pa yo, menm tout ofrann pa yo, tout ofrann sereyal, tout ofrann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:30">Lev 6:30</ref></char></note>peche ak tout ofrann koupab ke yo rann ban Mwen yo, yo va sen pase tout lòt yo pou nou ak fis nou yo. <verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Kòm don ki sen pase tout lòt yo, nou va manje l. Tout gason va manje li. Li va sen pou nou menm.<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>“Sa osi se pou nou, ofrann a don pa yo, menm tout ofrann balanse vè lotèl a fis Israël yo; Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:1-16">Lev 22:1-16</ref> </char></note>bannou yo ak fis nou yo ak fi nou yo ki avèk nou, kòm yon dwa ki pou tout tan. Tout sila lakay nou yo ki pwòp, kapab manje yo.<verse eid="NUM 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 81:16">Sòm 81:16</ref> </char>
    </note>“Tout sa ki pi bon nan lwil fre a, tout sa ki pi bon nan diven fre a ak nan sereyal la, premye fwi a sila ke yo bay a SENYÈ a, Mwen bannou yo. <verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:29">Egz 22:29</ref> </char></note>Premye nan fwi mi ki nan peyi yo, ke yo pote bay SENYÈ a, va pou ou. Tout moun lakay ou ki pwòp, kapab manje li.<verse eid="NUM 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:1-33">Lev 27:1-33</ref> </char>
    </note>“Tout bagay ki konsakre an Israël va pou ou. <verse eid="NUM 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:13-15">Egz 13:13-15</ref> </char></note>Tout premye pòtre nan vant a tout chè, kit se lòm, kit se bèt, ke yo ofri bay SENYÈ a, va pou nou. Men premye ne a lòm nan, nou va anverite peye ranson, e premye ne bèt ki pa pwòp, nou va peye ranson. <verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Epi pou pri ranson an, soti nan laj yon mwa, nou va peye ranson yo, selon pri nou yo, senk sik an ajan, selon sik sanktyè a, ki se ven gera.<verse eid="NUM 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>“Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:19">Det 15:19</ref> </char></note>premye ne a yon bèf oswa yon mouton, oswa premye ne a yon kabrit, ou pa pou peye ranson. Yo sen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:2">Lev 3:2</ref></char></note>Ou va flite san pa yo sou lotèl la, e ou va ofri grès yo nan lafimen kòm yon ofrann pa dife, kòm yon odè ki bon a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Vyann pa yo va pou ou. Li va pou ou tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:31">Lev 7:31</ref> </char></note> pwatrin ak kwis nan yon ofrann balanse anlè. <verse eid="NUM 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>Tout ofrann a don sen yo, ke fis Israël yo ofri bay SENYÈ a, Mwen te bannou yo, avèk fis ou yo ak fi ou yo ki avèk ou, kòm yon dwa ki pou tout tan. Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:5">II Kwo 13:5</ref> </char></note>yon kontra disèl devan SENYÈ a avèk ou avèk desandan ou yo avèk ou.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>SENYÈ a te di a Aaron: “Ou p ap gen okenn eritaj nan peyi a ni posesyon okenn pati pami yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:33">Jos 13:33</ref> </char></note>Mwen se pati pa ou ak eritaj ou pami fis Israël yo.<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/>“A fis Levi yo, gade byen, Mwen te bay tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30-33">Lev 27:30-33</ref> </char></note>dim an Israël yo kòm eritaj, anretou pou sèvis yo ke yo fè, sèvis a tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Fis a Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:51">Nonb 1:51</ref> </char></note>pa pou pwoche tant asanble a ankò; sinon, yo va pote peche e yo va mouri. <verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>Sèl Levit yo va fè sèvis tant asanble a. Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:1">Nonb 18:1</ref> </char></note>pote inikite pa yo. Sa va yon règleman pou tout tan atravè jenerasyon nou yo. Pami fis Israël yo, yo p ap gen okenn eritaj. <verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>Paske dim a fis Israël yo, ke yo ofri kòm yon ofrann bay SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:9">Det 10:9</ref> </char></note>Mwen te bay a Levit yo kòm eritaj. Konsa, Mwen te di konsènan yo: ‘Yo p ap gen okenn eritaj pami fis Israël yo.’”<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>SENYÈ a te pale a Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>“Anplis, ou va pale avèk Levit yo pou di yo: ‘Lè nou pran soti nan fis Israël yo, dim ke Mwen te bay a nou menm pou eritaj nou, alò nou va prezante yon ofrann ki sòti nan li bay SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:38">Né 10:38</ref> </char></note>yon dim nan dim nan. <verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Ofrann nou va konte pou nou kòm sila ki sòti nan voye anlè glasi a, oswa pwodwi ki nan basen diven an. <verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Konsa, nou va, osi, prezante yon ofrann bay SENYÈ a, ki soti nan dim nou yo, ke nou resevwa de fis Israël yo. Epi soti nan li, nou va bay ofrann SENYÈ a a Aaron, prèt la. <verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>Nan tout don nou yo, nou va prezante tout ofrann ke nou dwe bay a SENYÈ a, soti nan tout sa ki pi bon nan yo, pati ki sakre nan yo.’<verse eid="NUM 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>“Ou va di yo: ‘Lè nou ofri meyè pati a, li va kalkile a Levit yo kòm pwodwi a ofrann voye anlè glasi a, oswa pwodwi a basen diven an. <verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Nou gen dwa manje l nenpòt kote, nou menm avèk lakay nou, paske se pèyman nou an echanj pou sèvis nou nan tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Nou p ap pote peche akoz li, lè nou fin ofri meyè pati a. Men nou pa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:15-16">Lev 22:15-16</ref> </char></note>degrade bagay sakre a fis Israël yo; sinon, nou va mouri.’”<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1"/>Senyè a te pale ak Moïse avèk Aaron e te di: <verse eid="NUM 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2"/>“Sa se règleman lalwa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande a. Li te di: ‘Pale a fis Israël yo pou yo pote ba ou yon gazèl wouj, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:20-25">Lev 22:20-25</ref> </char></note> san defo, sou sila yon jouk pa t janm vin poze. <verse eid="NUM 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>Nou va bay li a Éléazar, prèt la, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:11-21">Lev 4:11-21</ref> </char></note>va pote li deyò kan an, e touye li nan prezans li. <verse eid="NUM 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>Apre, Éléazar, prèt la, va pran kèk nan san li avèk dwèt li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:6-17">Lev 4:6-17</ref> </char></note>flite kèk nan san li an pa devan tant asanble a sèt fwa. <verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>Alò, gazèl la va brile devan zye li; po li, chè li avèk san li, avèk poupou li, va brile. <verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Prèt la va pran bwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:4">Lev 14:4</ref> </char></note>sèd avèk izòp ak twal wouj, e li va jete li nan mitan gazèl k ap brile a. <verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Epi prèt la va lave vètman li yo, benyen kò li nan dlo, e apre, li va antre nan kan an. <verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>Sila ki brile li a, va osi lave kò li nan dlo, apre li va vini nan kan an, e li va rete pa pwòp jis rive nan aswè.<verse eid="NUM 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/>“‘Alò, yon nonm ki pwòp, va ranmase sann gazèl la pou depoze yo deyò kan an nan yon kote ki pwòp. Epi fis Israël yo va konsève li pou sèvi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 8:7">Nonb 8:7</ref> </char></note>dlo pirifikasyon. Li se yon ofrann pou peche. <verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Sila ki ranmase sann gazèl la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:7">Nonb 19:7</ref> </char></note>va lave rad li, e li va rete pa pwòp pou jis rive nan aswè. Li va yon règleman ki pou tout tan pou fis Israël yo ak pou etranje ki rete pami yo a.<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 21:1-11">Lev 21:1-11</ref> </char>
    </note> “‘Sila ki touche kadav a nenpòt moun, va pa pwòp pandan sèt jou. <verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Li dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:19">Nonb 19:19</ref> </char></note>pirifye tèt li avèk dlo nan twazyèm jou a ak nan setyèm jou a. Apre, li va pwòp. Men si li pa pirifye tèt li nan twazyèm jou a ak nan setyèm jou a, li p ap vin pwòp. <verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:21">Lev 7:21</ref> </char></note>Nenpòt moun ki touche yon mò, kò a yon moun mouri, e li pa pirifye tèt li, li degrade tabènak a SENYÈ a; epi moun sa va koupe retire de Israël a. Akoz dlo pirifikasyon an pa t flite sou li, li va vin pa pwòp. Pa pwòp li a rete sou li.<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>“‘Sa se lalwa lè yon nonm mouri nan yon tant: tout moun ki antre nan tant lan ak tout moun ki deja nan tant lan, vin pa pwòp pandan sèt jou. <verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>Tout veso ki louvri, ki pa gen kouvèti mare sou li, pa pwòp.<verse eid="NUM 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 31:19">Nonb 31:19</ref> </char>
    </note>“‘Osi, nenpòt moun ki nan chan louvri, e ki touche yon moun ki te touye pa nepe, oswa ki te mouri nenpòt jan, swa yon zo Kretyen oswa yon tonm, li va vin pa pwòp pandan sèt jou.<verse eid="NUM 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>“‘Alò, pou sila ki pa pwòp yo, yo va pran kèk nan sann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:9">Nonb 19:9</ref> </char></note>pirifikasyon peche ki te brile a, e dlo k ap koule va mele avèk yo nan yon veso. <verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Yon moun pwòp va pran izòp e fonse li nan dlo a, flite li sou tant lan ak sou tout zafè li yo, ak sou tout moun ki te ladann yo, tout sila ki te touche zo a, oswa sa ki te touye, oswa sa ki te mouri yon lòt jan, oswa yon tonm. <verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Alò, moun pwòp la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 36:25">Egz 36:25</ref> </char></note>va flite sou sila ki pa pwòp la nan twazyèm jou a ak nan setyèm jou a. Nan setyèm jou a, li dwe pirifye tèt li. Li va lave rad li, benyen nan dlo e li va pwòp nan aswè. <verse eid="NUM 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>Men sila ki pa pwòp la, ki pa pirifye tèt li a, li va koupe retire nan mitan asanble a, akoz li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:13">Nonb 19:13</ref> </char></note>degrade sanktyè SENYÈ a. Dlo pirifikasyon an pa t flite sou li, e li pa pwòp.<verse eid="NUM 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>“‘Se konsa sa va yon règleman pou tout tan pou yo. Sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:7">Nonb 19:7</ref> </char></note>ki flite dlo pirifikasyon an, va osi lave rad li, e sila ki touche dlo pirifikasyon an va rete pa pwòp jis rive nan aswè. <verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 5:2-3">Lev 5:2-3</ref> </char></note>Anplis, nenpòt bagay ke moun pa pwòp la touche, va vin pa pwòp. Moun ki touche li a, va vin pa pwòp jis rive nan aswè.’”<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Konsa, fis Israël yo, tout kongregasyon an, te vini nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:21">Nonb 13:21</ref> </char></note>dezè a Tsin nan, nan premye mwa a. Pèp la te rete Kadès. Alò, Marie te mouri e li te antere la.<verse eid="NUM 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:1">Egz 17:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Pa t gen dlo pou kongregasyon an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:19-42">Nonb 16:19-42</ref></char></note>e yo te vin reyini yo menm kont Moïse avèk Aaron. <verse eid="NUM 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>Konsa, pèp la te fè kont avèk Moïse e te pale pou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:2-3">Nonb 14:2-3</ref> </char></note>“Si sèlman nou te mouri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:31-35">Nonb 16:31-35</ref></char></note>lè frè nou yo te mouri devan SENYÈ a! <verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:3">Egz 17:3</ref> </char></note>Epi poukisa ou te mennen asanble SENYÈ a antre nan dezè sila a, pou nou menm avèk bèt nou yo vin mouri isit la? <verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>Poukisa ou te fè nou sòti an Égypte pou mennen nou kote mechan sila a? Se pa yon kote ki gen, ni fig, ni grenad, ni pa gen dlo pou bwè.”<verse eid="NUM 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Moïse avèk Aaron te sòti nan prezans asanble a nan pòtay tant asanble a, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:5">Nonb 14:5</ref> </char></note>tonbe sou figi yo. Alò, glwa a SENYÈ a te vin parèt a yo menm. <verse eid="NUM 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>“Pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:17-20">Egz 4:17-20</ref> </char></note>baton an. Ou menm avèk frè ou a, Aaron, rasanble kongregasyon an e pale avèk wòch la devan zye yo, pou li kapab bay dlo pa li. Konsa, ou va fè dlo parèt pou yo sòti nan wòch la e kite kongregasyon an avèk bèt yo bwè.”<verse eid="NUM 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Konsa, Moïse te pran baton an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 17:10">Nonb 17:10</ref> </char></note>soti devan SENYÈ a, jis jan ke Li te kòmande li a. <verse eid="NUM 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>Epi Moïse avèk Aaron te reyini asanble a devan wòch la. Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:33">Sòm 106:33</ref> </char></note>“Koute m koulye a, nou menm k ap fè rebèl; èske n ap fè dlo sòti nan wòch sila a?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Epi Moïse te leve men li e li te frape wòch la de fwa avèk baton an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:16">Sòm 78:16</ref> </char></note>Dlo te sòti an kantite, e kongregasyon an avèk bèt pa yo te bwè.<verse eid="NUM 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Men SENYÈ a te di a Moïse avèk Aaron: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:24">Nonb 20:24</ref> </char></note>“Akoz ke nou pa kwè M, pou trete m tankou sen devan fis Israël yo; pou sa, nou p ap mennen asanble sila a antre nan peyi ke M te bay yo a.”<verse eid="NUM 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Sa yo se te dlo a Meriba yo, akoz fis a Israël yo te fè kont avèk SENYÈ a, e Li te fè prèv sentete Li pami yo.<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Soti nan Kadès, Moïse te voye mesaj vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:31-39">Jen 36:31-39</ref> </char></note>wa Édom an: “Konsa frè ou a, Israël te pale: ‘Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:9-24">Jos 9:9-24</ref></char></note>konnen tout traka ki gen tan pran nou; <verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>ke zansèt nou yo te desann an Égypte, e ke nou te rete an Égypte pandan anpil tan, e ke Ejipsyen yo te maltrete nou anpil. <verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23">Egz 2:23</ref> </char></note>lè nou te kriye fò bay SENYÈ a, Li te tande vwa nou. Li te voye yon zanj pou te mennen nou sòti an Égypte. Alò, gade byen, nou rive Kadès, yon vil nan fwontyè teritwa pa nou an. <verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>“Souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:22">Nonb 21:22</ref> </char></note>kite nou pase nan peyi pa nou an. Nou p ap pase nan chan yo oswa nan rezen yo. Nou p ap menm bwè dlo nan yon pwi. Nou va ale bò kote chemen wa a, san vire ni adwat, ni agoch jiskaske nou fin pase nan tout teritwa nou an.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:18">Nonb 24:18</ref> </char>
    </note>“‘Men Édom te di li: “Ou p ap pase sou nou; sinon, mwen ap vini kont nou avèk nepe.”’”<verse eid="NUM 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>“Ankò, fis Israël yo te di li: ‘Nou va monte vè chemen an, e si Mwen avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:38">Egz 12:38</ref> </char></note>bèt mwen yo bwè nan dlo nou an; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:6-28">Det 2:6-28</ref></char></note>alò, m ap peye pri li. Kite mwen sèlman pase ladann a pye, anyen anplis.’” <verse eid="NUM 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>Men li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:17">Jij 11:17</ref> </char></note>“Ou p ap pase ladann.” Epi Édom te sòti kont li avèk yon gwo fòs ak yon men pwisan. <verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:17">Jij 11:17</ref> </char></note>Konsa, Édom te refize kite Israël pase nan teritwa pa li a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:8">Det 2:8</ref></char></note>Pou sa Israël te vire kite li.<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Alò, yo te sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:1-14">Nonb 20:1-14</ref> </char></note>Kadès, epi fis Israël yo ak tout kongregasyon an te vini nan Mòn Hor.<verse eid="NUM 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse ak Aaron nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:37">Nonb 33:37</ref> </char></note>Mòn Hor akote fwontyè Édom an. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>“Aaron va rasanble vè pèp li a; paske li pa pou antre nan peyi ke Mwen te bay a fis Israël yo, akoz nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:5-10">Nonb 20:5-10</ref> </char></note>vin rebèl kont kòmand Mwen nan dlo a Meriba yo. <verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Pran Aaron avèk fis li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:4">Nonb 3:4</ref> </char></note>Éléazar e mennen yo nan Mòn Hor. <verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>Retire tout vètman yo sou Aaron e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:24">Nonb 20:24</ref> </char></note>mete yo sou fis li a, Éléazar. Konsa, Aaron va rasanble vè pèp li a, e li va mouri la.”<verse eid="NUM 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Konsa Moïse te fè selon SENYÈ a te kòmande a. Yo te monte vè Mòn Hor devan zye a tout kongregasyon an. <verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/>Lè Moïse te fin retire vètman yo sou Aaron, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:29">Egz 29:29</ref> </char></note>mete yo sou Éléazar. Aaron te mouri la sou tèt mòn nan. <verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>Lè tout kongregasyon an te wè ke Aaron te mouri, tout lakay Israël te kriye pou Aaron pandan trant<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:3-10">Jen 50:3-10</ref> </char></note>jou.<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/>Lè Chèf Canaran an, wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 12:14">Jos 12:14</ref> </char></note>Arad la, ki te viv nan Negev la te tande ke Israël t ap vini pa chemen a Atharim nan; alò, li te goumen kont Israël, e li te pran kèk nan yo an kaptif. <verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>Konsa, Israël te fè yon ve a SENYÈ a, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:20">Jen 28:20</ref> </char></note> “Si Ou va vrèman livre pèp sa a nan men m; alò, mwen va detwi vil pa yo a nèt.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/>SENYÈ a te tande vwa Israël. Li te livre yo bay Canaran, epi yo te detwi yo nèt ansanm avèk vil yo. Konsa, kote sa a te vin rele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:45">Nonb 14:45</ref> </char></note>Horma.<verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/>Yo te sòti nan Mòn Hor pa wout Lamè Wouj la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:8">Det 2:8</ref> </char></note>pou travèse peyi Édom an. Epi pèp la te vin pèdi pasyans akoz vwayaj la. <verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/>Pèp la te pale kont Bondye ak Moïse: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:2-3">Nonb 14:2-3</ref> </char></note> “Poukisa ou te mennen nou sòti an Égypte pou mouri nan dezè a? Paske nanpwen manje, ni dlo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:6">Nonb 11:6</ref></char></note>nou rayi move manje sila a.”<verse eid="NUM 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:15">Det 8:15</ref> </char>
    </note>SENYÈ a te voye sèpan dife pami pèp la. Yo te mòde pèp la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:9">I Kor 10:9</ref></char></note>anpil nan pèp Israël la te mouri. <verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Konsa, pèp la te vini a Moïse e te di: “Nou te peche, pwiske nou te pale kont SENYÈ a ak ou menm. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:19">I Sam 12:19</ref> </char></note>Entèsede pou nou avèk SENYÈ a, pou Li kapab retire sèpan sa yo sou nou.” Epi Moïse te entèsede pou pèp la.<verse eid="NUM 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:9">És 14:9</ref> </char></note> sèpan dife e mete li sou yon poto. Konsa, li va vin rive ke tout moun ki mòde, lè li gade li, l ap viv.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/>Moïse te fè yon sèpan an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">II Wa 18:4</ref> </char></note>bwonz e li te mete li sou poto a. Epi li te vin rive ke si yon sèpan te mòde nenpòt moun, lè li te gade vè sèpan an bwonz lan, li te viv.<verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Alò, fis Israël yo te deplase e te fè kan an nan Oboth. <verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>Yo te vwayaje soti Oboth pou te fè kan an nan Ijje-Abarim, nan dezè ki anfas Moab a lès la. <verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:45">Nonb 33:45</ref> </char></note>Soti la, yo te pati pou te fè kan an nan vale Zéred la. <verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>Soti la, yo te vwayaje pou te fè kan an sou lòt kote Arnon an, ki se nan dezè ki sòti nan lizyè Amoreyen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:36">Nonb 22:36</ref> </char></note>paske Arnon se te fwontyè Moab, antre Moab ak Amoreyen yo.<verse eid="NUM 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Konsa, sa di nan Liv Lagè SENYÈ a: “Vaheb nan Supha, avèk ravin sèch nan Arnon an, <verse eid="NUM 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>ak pant ki rive nan ravin sèch yo ki rive jis nan kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:28">Nonb 21:28</ref> </char></note>Ar la e ki touche nan lizyè Moab la.” <verse eid="NUM 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:46-49">Nonb 33:46-49</ref> </char></note>Soti la, yo rive jis nan Beer, ki se pwi kote SENYÈ a te di Moïse, reyini pèp la pou Mwen kapab bay yo dlo a.”<verse eid="NUM 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:1">Egz 15:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Epi Israël te chante chan sila a:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:17">“Vin bwote o pwi! Chante a li!<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>Pwi a ke prens yo nan pèp la te fouye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:18">Avèk baton wayal ak Baton soutyen pa yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Epi soti nan dezè a, yo te kontinye a Matthana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>soti Matthana a Nahaliel, soti nan Nahaliel a Bamoth, <verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>soti Bamoth nan vale ki nan peyi Moab la, nan pwent lan vè Mòn Pisga ki kanpe anwo tout dezè a.<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Alò Israël te voye mesaje yo bay Sihon, wa a Amoreyen yo. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:16-17">Nonb 20:16-17</ref> </char></note>“Kite mwen pase nan peyi ou a. Nou p ap menm vire nan chan, oswa nan rezen yo. Nou p ap bwè dlo nan pwi yo. Nou va ale nan chemen Wa a jiskaske nou fin depase limit fwontyè pa w la.”<verse eid="NUM 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 20:21">Nonb 20:21</ref> </char>
    </note>Men Sihon pa t kite Israël pase nan fwontyè pa li a. Konsa, Sihon te ranmase tout pèp li a pou te sòti kont Israël nan dezè a. Yo te rive a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:32">Det 2:32</ref></char></note>Jahats pou te goumen kont Israël.<verse eid="NUM 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Konsa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:9">Am 2:9</ref> </char></note>Israël te frape li avèk tranch nepe, e te pran posesyon peyi li a soti Arnon pou jis rive Jabbok, soti distans a fis Ammon yo; paske nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:37">Det 2:37</ref></char></note>fwontyè a fis Ammon yo, se te Jazer. <verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25"/>Israël te pran tout vil yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:10">Am 2:10</ref> </char></note>Israël te viv nan tout vil Amoreyen yo, nan Hesbon ak nan tout vil li yo. <verse eid="NUM 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26"/>Paske Hesbon, se te vil a Sihon, wa a Amoreyen yo, ki te goumen kont ansyen wa Moab la, e li te retire tout peyi li a nan men li, jis rive nan Arnon.<verse eid="NUM 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Se pou sa ke sila ki sèvi ak pwovèb yo di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">“Vini Hesbon! Kite li bati!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">Konsa kite vil a Sihon an fin etabli.<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:45">Jr 48:45</ref> </char>
    </note>Paske yon dife te sòti nan Hesbon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Yon flanm soti nan vil a Sihon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Li te devore <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:15">Nonb 21:15</ref></char></note>Ar nan Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Pwent wo yo domine Arnon<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>Malè a nou menm, O Moab!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Nou gen tan fin gate nèt, O pèp Kemosch la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:5">És 15:5</ref> </char>
    </note>Li te bay fis li yo kòm sila k ap sove ale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 16:2">És 16:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi fi li yo kòm kaptif, pou yon wa Amoreyen, Sihon.<verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>Nou te tire sou yo. Hesbon fin gate jis rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:3-34">Nonb 32:3-34</ref> </char></note>Dibon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Konsa, nou te fin piyaje jis rive Nophach,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Ki rive nèt nan Médaba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Pou sa a, Israël te viv nan peyi Amoreyen yo.<verse eid="NUM 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Moïse te voye espyone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:1-35">Nonb 32:1-35</ref> </char></note>Jaezer. Yo te kaptire vil li yo e te piyaje Amoreyen ki te la yo. <verse eid="NUM 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:1-7">Det 3:1-7</ref> </char></note>Epi yo te vire monte nan wout Basan, e Og, wa Basan an, te sòti avèk tout pèp li a pou fè bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:12">Jos 13:12</ref></char></note>Édréï.<verse eid="NUM 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>Men SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:2">Det 3:2</ref> </char></note>“Pa pè li, paske Mwen te bay li nan men nou, tout pèp li a ak tout peyi li a. Ou va fè avèk li jan ou te fè Sihon, wa Amoreyen, ki te viv Hesbon yo.”<verse eid="NUM 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:3-4">Det 3:3-4</ref></char></note>yo te touye li avèk fis li yo ak tout pèp li a, jis pa t menm gen yon retay ki te rete de li. Konsa, yo te posede peyi li a.<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 33:48-49">Nonb 33:48-49</ref> </char>
    </note>Fis a Israël yo te vwayaje pou te fè kan an nan plèn Moab yo, fin kite Jourdain an, anfas Jéricho.<verse eid="NUM 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:25">Jij 11:25</ref> </char></note>Balak, fis Tsippor te wè tout sa ke Israël te fè a Amoreyen yo. <verse eid="NUM 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:15">Egz 15:15</ref> </char></note>Konsa, Moab te nan gran perèz akoz pèp la, pwiske yo te anpil; Moab te sezi avèk gwo laperèz akoz fis Israël yo.<verse eid="NUM 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4"/>Moab te di a ansyen yo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:15-18">Nonb 25:15-18</ref> </char></note>Madian: “Alò, bann moun sa yo va devore tout sa ki antoure nou, jan yon bèf devore zèb nan chan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:4">Balak, fis a Tsippor a te wa Moab nan tan sa a. <verse eid="NUM 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5"/>Konsa, li te voye yon mesaje vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:11">Jd 11</ref> </char></note>Balaam, fis a Beor a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:4">Det 23:4</ref></char></note>Pethor, ki toupre Rivyè a, nan peyi a fis pèp li a. Li te di: “Gade byen, yon pèp te sòti an Égypte. Gade byen, yo kouvri sifas peyi a, e y ap viv anfas mwen. <verse eid="NUM 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:17">Nonb 22:17</ref> </char></note>Alò, pou sa, silvouplè, vin mete yon madichon sou pèp sa a pou mwen; paske, yo twò pwisan pou mwen. Petèt mwen kapab fin bat yo, e pouse yo ale deyò peyi a. Paske mwen konnen ke sila ke ou beni an, beni, e sila ke ou modi a, modi.” <verse eid="NUM 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7"/>Konsa, ansyen a Moab yo avèk ansyen a Madian yo te pati avèk frè pou peye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:23">Nonb 23:23</ref> </char></note>divinasyon nan men yo. Yo te vin kote Balaam pou te repete pawòl a Balak yo pou li.<verse eid="NUM 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>Li te di yo: “Pase nwit lan isit la, e mwen va pote yon pawòl bannou jan SENYÈ a kab petèt pale avè m.” Epi dirijan Moab yo te rete avèk Balaam.<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:3">Jen 20:3</ref> </char></note>Bondye te vini a Balaam, e Li te di: “Ki moun sa yo ye ki avèk ou la a?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Balaam te di a Bondye: “Balak, fis a Tsippor a, wa Moab la te voye yon pawòl ban mwen. <verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>‘Gade byen, gen yon pèp ki sòti an Égypte, yo kouvri sifas peyi a. Alò, vin modi yo pou mwen. Petèt mwen kapab goumen kont yo, e pouse yo deyò.’”<verse eid="NUM 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Bondye te di a Balaam: “Pa ale avèk yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:8">Nonb 23:8</ref> </char></note>Ou p ap modi pèp la, paske yo beni.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Konsa, Balaam te leve nan maten e li te di a chèf Balak yo: “Ale retounen nan peyi nou, paske SENYÈ a refize kite mwen ale avèk nou.”<verse eid="NUM 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Chèf a Moab yo te leve. Yo te ale kote Balak e te di: “Balaam refize vini avèk nou.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Alò, Balak te voye chèf yo ankò, plis an kantite e pi gran pase lòt yo. <verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>Yo te vini a Balaam e te di li: “Konsa pale Balak, fis a Tsippor a: ‘Pa kite anyen, mwen mande ou souple, anpeche ou vini kote mwen; <verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>paske vrèman, mwen va onore ou anpil. Mwen va fè nenpòt sa ou mande mwen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:6">Nonb 22:6</ref> </char></note>Alò, souple, vin modi pèp sa a pou mwen.’”<verse eid="NUM 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Balaam te reponn a sèvitè a Balak yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:14">I Wa 22:14</ref> </char></note>“Malgre Balak ta ban mwen kay li plen avèk ajan ak lò, mwen pa ta kapab fè anyen, ni piti ni gran, ki kontrè kòmand SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an. <verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>Alò, silvouplè, rete isit la aswè a pou m ka twouve ki lòt bagay SENYÈ a va pale mwen.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>Bondye te vin kote Balaam nan aswè. Li te di li: “Si mesye sa yo ta vin rele ou, leve ale avèk yo; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:35">Nonb 22:35</ref> </char></note>se sèlman pawòl ke M pale avèk ou a ke ou va fè.”<verse eid="NUM 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 2:15">II Pi 2:15</ref> </char>
    </note>Konsa, Balaam te leve nan maten. Li te mete yon sèl sou bourik li pou te ale avèk chèf Moab yo. <verse eid="NUM 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>Men Bondye te fache akoz li t ap ale a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:20">Egz 23:20</ref> </char></note>Konsa, zanj SENYÈ a te vin kanpe nan chemen an kòm yon advèsè kont li. Alò, li te monte sou bourik li, e de sèvitè li yo te avèk li. <verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>Lè bourik la te wè zanj SENYÈ a ki te kanpe nan chemen an avèk nepe li parèt nan men l, bourik la te kite chemen an pou te antre nan chan an. Men Balaam te frape bourik la pou fè l retounen nan chemen an.<verse eid="NUM 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Alò, zanj SENYÈ a te kanpe nan yon wout etwat nan chan rezen yo, avèk yon miray sou yon bò, e yon miray sou lòt bò a. <verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Lè bourik la te wè zanj SENYÈ a, li te peze kò l kont mi an, e li te peze pye Balaam kont lòt mi an. Konsa, Balaam te frape li ankò.<verse eid="NUM 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Zanj SENYÈ a te ale pi lwen. Li te kanpe nan yon kote etwat kote pa t gen mwayen pou vire ni adwat, ni agoch. <verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Lè bourik la te wè zanj SENYÈ a, li te kouche anba Balaam. Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:19">Jc 1:19</ref> </char></note>Balaam te fache e li te frape bourik la avèk baton li. <verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:16">II Pi 2:16</ref> </char></note>SENYÈ a te ouvri bouch a femèl bourik la, e li te di a Balaam: “Kisa m te fè ou, pou ou bat mwen twa fwa sa yo?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Alò, Balaam te di a bourik la: “Akoz ou te pase m nan rizib! Si m te gen yon nepe nan men m, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 12:10">Pwov 12:10</ref> </char></note> Mwen ta gen tan touye ou deja.”<verse eid="NUM 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Bourik la te di Balaam: “Èske mwen pa bourik ou, sou sila ou te monte pandan tout vi ou jis rive Jodi a? Èske Mwen janm te konn abitye fè ou sa?” Epi li te reponn: “Non”.<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te ouvri zye a Balaam. Konsa, li te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:13-15">Jos 5:13-15</ref> </char></note>zanj a SENYÈ a ki te kanpe nan chemen an avèk nepe a rale nan men li. Balaam te bese jiska tè.<verse eid="NUM 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>Zanj SENYÈ a te di li: “Poukisa ou te frape bourik ou a twa fwa sa yo? Gade byen, Mwen te parèt kòm yon advèsè, akoz direksyon pa w la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:15">II Pi 2:15</ref> </char></note>kont Mwen. <verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Men bourik la te wè M, e li te vire akote pou evite Mwen twa fwa sa yo. Si li pa t vire akote Mwen, Mwen ta, vrèman, gen tan touye ou nan moman sa a, e kite li menm viv.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Balaam te di a zanj SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:40">Nonb 14:40</ref></char></note>“Mwen te peche, paske mwen pa t konnen ke ou te kanpe nan chemen an kont mwen. Alò, koulye a, si sa pa fè ou plezi, mwen va vire retounen.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>Men zanj SENYÈ a te di a Balaam: “Ale avèk mesye sa yo, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:20">Nonb 22:20</ref></char></note>ou va pale, sèlman, pawòl ke Mwen di ou yo.” Konsa Balaam te ale avèk chèf Balak yo.<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Lè Balak te tande ke Balaam t ap vini, li te sòti pou rankontre li nan vil Moab la, ki nan fwontyè Arnon an, nan dènye pwent lizyè a. <verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Epi Balak te di a Balaam: “Èske mwen pa t voye kote ou an ijans? Poukisa ou pa t vin kote mwen? Èske, vrèman, mwen pa kapab onore ou?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Konsa, Balaam te di a Balak: “Gade byen, Mwen gen tan vini koulye a! Èske mwen kapab pale yon bagay menm? Pawòl ke Bondye mete nan bouch mwen an, se sa ke mwen va pale.”<verse eid="NUM 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Epi Balaam te sòti avèk Balak e yo te vini Kirjath-Hutsoth, <verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>Balak te fè sakrifis bèf avèk mouton, e li te voye kèk bay Balaam avèk chèf ki te avèk li yo. <verse eid="NUM 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Epi li te rive nan maten ke Balak te pran Balaam pou te mennen li monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:28">Nonb 21:28</ref></char></note>wo plas a Baal yo. E li te wè depi la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:13">Nonb 23:13</ref></char></note>yon pati nan pèp Israël yo.<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Alò, Balaam te di a Balak: “Bati sèt lotèl pou mwen isit la, e prepare sèt towo pou mwen isit la.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2"/>Balak te fè ojis sa ke Balaam te pale a. Balak avèk Balaam te ofri yon towo avèk yon belye sou chak lotèl.<verse eid="NUM 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3"/>Balaam te di a Balak: “Kanpe bò kote ofrann brile pa w la, e mwen va ale. Petèt SENYÈ a va vin rankontre m, e nenpòt sa ke Li montre mwen, mwen va di ou li.” Konsa, li te ale kote yon ti mòn ki pa t gen anyen sou li.<verse eid="NUM 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>Bondye te rankontre Balaam, e li te di Li: “Mwen te ranje sèt lotèl yo, e mwen te ofri yon towo avèk yon belye sou chak lotèl.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Det 18:18</ref></char></note>mete yon pawòl nan bouch Balaam. Li te di: “Retounen kote Balak. Ou va pale konsa.”<verse eid="NUM 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>Konsa, li te retounen kote li. E gade byen, Balak te kanpe bò kote ofrann brile li a; li menm avèk tout chèf Moab yo. <verse eid="NUM 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Balaam te pran diskou li, e te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">“Depi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:12">Nonb 22:12</ref></char></note>Aram, Balak te mennen m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">wa Moab ki soti nan mòn Lès yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">‘Vin modi Jacob pou mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">Vin denonse Israël!’<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 22:12">Nonb 22:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kijan mwen kapab modi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">lè Bondye pa t modi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">Epi kijan mwen kapab denonse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">sila ke SENYÈ a pa t denonse?<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>“Jan mwen konn wè li soti anwo nan pwent wòch yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">e mwen gade li depi sou kolin yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:8">Det 32:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gade byen, yon pèp ki rete apa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">ki p ap kab konte pami nasyon yo.<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 13:16">Jen 13:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kilès ki kab konte pousyè a Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">oswa konte menm yon ka an Israël?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Kite mwen mouri lanmò a jis yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">pou lafen pa mwen an tankou pa li.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Konsa, Balak te di a Balaam: “Kisa ou te fè m konsa? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:2">Né 13:2</ref></char></note>Mwen te pran ou pou modi lènmi mwen yo, e gade byen, ou te vrèman beni yo!”<verse eid="NUM 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>Li te reponn: “Èske mwen pa oblije fè atansyon pou pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:20">Nonb 22:20</ref></char></note>sa ke SENYÈ a mete nan bouch mwen?”<verse eid="NUM 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Alò Balak te di li: “Souple, vin avèk mwen nan yon lòt kote pou ou ka wè yo. Malgre w ap wè sèlman ti bout a dènye pwent lan, e ou p ap wè tout a yo. Modi yo pou mwen depi la.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>Konsa, li te pran li rive nan chan Tsophim nan, nan pwent Mòn Pigsa a. Li te bati sèt lotèl e li te ofri yon towo avèk yon belye sou chak lotèl.<verse eid="NUM 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Konsa, li te di a Balak: “Kanpe bò kote ofrann brile ou a, pandan mwen menm, mwen ap rankontre SENYÈ a soti lòtbò.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te rankontre Balaam e Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:20">Nonb 22:20</ref></char></note>te mete yon pawòl nan bouch li. Li te di li: “Retounen jwenn Balak, e konsa ou va pale.”<verse eid="NUM 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>Li te vin kote li, e gade byen, li te kanpe bò kote ofrann brile pa li a, epi chèf Moab yo te avèk li. Konsa, Balak te di li: “Kisa SENYÈ a te pale a?”<verse eid="NUM 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Alò, li te pran diskou li. Li te di:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 23:18"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">“Leve ou menm, O Balak, pou tande!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">Ban m zòrèy ou, O fis a Tsippor!<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 15:29">I Sam 15:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye se pa yon nonm ke li ye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">pou L ta bay manti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">ni fis a yon nonm pou L ta repanti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Èske Li pa t pale, e èske Li p ap fè l vrè?<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20"/>Gade byen, mwen te resevwa lòd pou beni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:20">Lè se Li menm ki beni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:20">alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:13">És 43:13</ref></char></note>mwen p ap kab revoke sa.<verse eid="NUM 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21"/>Li pa t wè malè nan Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">ni Li pa t wè twoub nan Israël.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:12">Egz 3:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>SENYÈ a, Bondye li a avè l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">epi gran vwa a yon wa pami yo.<verse eid="NUM 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:8">Nonb 24:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye mennen yo sòti an Égypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:22">Li pou yo tankou kòn sou bèf mawon.<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 22:7">Nonb 22:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paske, nanpwen wanga kont Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">ni pa gen divinasyon kont Israël.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">Nan tan etabli a, li va pale a Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">e a Israël de sa Bondye te fè a!<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:9">Jen 49:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gade byen, yon pèp ki leve tankou yon manman lyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">tankou yon lyon li leve li menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">Ni li p ap kouche jiskaske li fin devore viktim nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">pou l bwè san a sila li touye a.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Alò, Balak te pale a Balaam: “Pa modi yo ditou, ni pa beni yo ditou!”<verse eid="NUM 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Men Balaam te reponn a Balak: “Èske mwen pa t di ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Nonb 22:18</ref></char></note>‘Nenpòt sa ke SENYÈ a pale, se sa mwen oblije fè’?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Alò Balak te di a Balaam: “Souple, vini; mwen va mennen ou yon lòt kote. Petèt li va agreyab a Bondye pou ou modi yo depi kote sa a.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Konsa, Balak te pran Balaam vè tèt mòn Peor ki domine tout dezè a.<verse eid="NUM 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Balaam te di a Balak, “Bati sèt lotèl pou mwen isit la, e prepare sèt towo ak sèt belye pou mwen isit la.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Balak te fè jan ke Balaam te di a, e li te ofri yon towo avèk yon belye sou chak lotèl.<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Lè Balaam te wè ke sa te fè SENYÈ a plezi pou beni Israël, li pa t ale tankou lòt fwa yo pou chache wanga, men li te fikse figi li vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:28">Nonb 23:28</ref></char></note>dezè a. <verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>Konsa, Balaam te leve zye li anwo, li te wè Israël ki t ap fè kan, tribi pa tribi; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:20">I Sam 19:20</ref></char></note>Lespri Bondye te vini sou li.<verse eid="NUM 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3"/>Li te reprann diskou li e te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:15-16">Nonb 24:15-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pòt pawòl a Balaam nan, fis a Beor a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">Pòt pawòl a nonm ki gen zye louvri a;<verse eid="NUM 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4"/>Pòt pawòl a sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:20">Nonb 22:20</ref></char></note>koute pawòl a Bondye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:4">ki wè vizyon Toupwisan an, ki t ap tonbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:4">men zye li gen tan vin debouche.<verse eid="NUM 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5"/>Ala tant nou yo bèl, O Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:5">ak abitasyon nou yo, O Israël!<verse eid="NUM 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>Tankou vale ki vin ouvri byen laj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">tankou jaden ki bò kote rivyè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">tankou plan lalwa ki plante pa SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">tankou bwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:8">Sòm 45:8</ref></char></note> sèd ki bò kote dlo yo.<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>Dlo yo va koule nan bokit li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">e jèm desandan li yo va bò kote anpil dlo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">Wa li a va pi wo pase <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:8">I Sam 15:8</ref></char></note>Agag, e wayòm li a va vin egzalte.<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:22">Nonb 23:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye mennen l sòti an Égypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Li pou li tankou kòn a yon bèf mawon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Li va devore nasyon ki advèsè li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Li va kraze zo yo an mòso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Li va kraze yo avèk flèch li yo.<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/>Li koube ba, li kouche tankou yon lyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">tankou yon manma lyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">Se kilès ki kab tante deranje l?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:3">Jen 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Beni se tout moun ki beni ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">e modi se tout moun ki modi ou.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Konsa, kòlè Balak te brile kont Balaam. Li frape men l ansanm; epi li te di a Balaam: “Mwen te rele ou pou modi lènmi mwen yo, men gade, ou te pèsiste nan beni yo menm twa fwa sa yo! <verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>Pou sa, kouri ale nan plas ou koulye a. Mwen te di ke mwen ta onore ou anpil, men gade byen, SENYÈ a te anpeche ou resevwa onè a.”<verse eid="NUM 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Balaam te di a Balak: “Èske mwen pa t di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Nonb 22:18</ref></char></note>mesaje ke ou te voye kote mwen yo: <verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>ke menm si Balak te ban mwen kay li plen avèk ajan ak lò, ke m pa t kab fè anyen kontrè ak lòd SENYÈ a, kit bon kit mal <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:28">Nonb 16:28</ref></char></note>nan pwòp volonte pa m. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:8-16">Nonb 31:8-16</ref></char></note>Sa ke SENYÈ a pale a, se sa mwen va pale? <verse eid="NUM 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>Epi koulye a, veye byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:8-16">Nonb 31:8-16</ref></char></note>mwen ap prale kote pèp mwen an. Vini, mwen va bay ou konsèy sou sa ke pèp sa a va fè a pèp pa ou a nan jou k ap vini yo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Li te reprann diskou li e te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:3-4">Nonb 24:3-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pòt pawòl a Balaam nan, fis a Beor a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">e pòt pawòl a nonm avèk zye louvri a di,<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>Li di ki tande pawòl Bondye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">ki gen konesans a Trè Wo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">ki wè vizyon a Toupwisan an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">k ap tonbe, men ak zye li ki gen tan fin ouvri.<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>Mwen wè li, men pa koulye a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Mwen gade l, men pa toupre.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Yon zetwal va sòti nan Jacob.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:10">Jen 49:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yon baton a wa va leve sòti an Israël.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Li va kraze travèse fwon Moab la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">e li va dechire tout fis a Seth yo.<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Am 9:11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Édom va yon posesyon pou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:18">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 32:3">Jen 32:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Séir, lènmi li, osi, va yon posesyon pou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:18">pandan Israël ap aji avèk gwo kouraj.<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>Youn ki soti nan Jacob va gen tout pouvwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:19">li va detwi retay lavil la.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Li te gade Amalec. Li te reprann diskou li e li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">“Amalec se te premye nan nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:24">Nonb 24:24</ref> </char>
    </note>men lafen li pi lwen se destriksyon.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21"/>Epi li te gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:9">Jen 15:9</ref> </char></note>Kenizyen nan, li te reprann diskou li e li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">“Kote ou rete a, gen andirans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">Nich kote ou chita nan falèz la.<verse eid="NUM 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22"/>Malgre, Cain va gate nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:22">jis lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:21-22">Jen 10:21-22</ref></char></note>Asiryen yo pote nou ale an kaptif?”<verse eid="NUM 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>Epi li te vin reprann diskou li. Li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">“Ay, kilès ki ka viv lè Bondye fè sa a?<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Men gwo bato yo va sòti nan kòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:6">Éz 27:6</ref></char></note>Kittim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">Yo va pini Asiryen yo, yo va aflije <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:21">Jen 10:21</ref></char></note>Éber.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">Men li menm tou va vin detwi.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Konsa, Balaam te leve e te pati pou retounen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:14">Nonb 24:14</ref></char></note> plas li, e Balak osi te al fè wout li.<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Pandan Israël te rete nan Sittim, pèp la te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:8">I Kor 10:8</ref></char></note>pwostitiye tèt yo avèk fi Moab yo. <verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15">Egz 34:15</ref></char></note>yo te envite pèp la pou vini nan sakrifis dye pa yo. Pèp la te manje, e te bese devan dye yo a. <verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:28-29">Sòm 106:28-29</ref></char></note>Israël te vin jwenn yo menm avèk Baal Peor, e SENYÈ a te vin fache kont Israël.<verse eid="NUM 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Pran tout chèf a pèp la e touye yo gwo lajounen devan SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:17">Det 13:17</ref></char></note>pou gran kòlè a SENYÈ a kapab vire kite Israël.”<verse eid="NUM 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Konsa, Moïse te di a jij Israël yo: “Chak nan nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:27">Egz 32:27</ref></char></note>touye pwòp mesye pa li ki te jwenn yo mem avèk Baal Peor la.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Alò, vwala, youn nan fis Israël yo te vini pou te mennen bay a fanmi li yo yon fanm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:4">Nonb 22:4</ref></char></note>Madyanit, devan zye Moïse e devan zye a tout kongregasyon fis Israël yo, pandan yo tout t ap kriye devan pòtay tant asanble a. <verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:30">Sòm 106:30</ref></char></note>Lè Phinées, fis Éléazar, fis a Aaron, prèt la, te wè sa, li te leve nan mitan kongregasyon an. Li te pran yon frenn nan men l, <verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>epi li te ale dèyè Izrayelit la nan tant lan e li te frennen tranche kò yo toulède nèt, mesye Israël la ak fanm nan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:46-48">Nonb 16:46-48</ref> </char></note>Konsa gwo epidemi sou fis Israël yo te vin sispann. <verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:48-50">Nonb 16:48-50</ref></char></note>Sila ki te mouri yo akoz gwo epidemi an se te venn-kat-mil (24,000).<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:30">Sòm 106:30</ref></char></note>“Phinées, fis a Éléazar, fis a Aaron, prèt la, te fè detounen kòlè Mwen vè fis Israël yo, akoz li te jalou avèk jalouzi pa Mwen an pami yo; epi konsa, Mwen pa t detwi fis Israël yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Egz 20:5</ref></char></note>nan jalouzi pa Mwen an.<verse eid="NUM 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>“Pou sa pale: ‘Gade byen, Mwen bay li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:10">És 54:10</ref></char></note>akò lapè Mwen. <verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Li va pou li avèk desandan apre li yo, yon akò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:9">Egz 29:9</ref></char></note>pozisyon prèt pou tout tan, akoz ke li te jalou pou Bondye li a, e li te fè ekspiyasyon pou fis Israël yo.’”<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>Alò, non a Izrayelit ki te touye avèk fanm Madyanit la se te Zimri, fis Salu, yon chèf kay pami Simeyonit yo. <verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>Non a fanm Madyanit ki te touye a se te Cozbi, fi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:8">Nonb 31:8</ref></char></note>Zur, ki te chèf kay zansèt a yon pèp nan Madian. <verse eid="NUM 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1">Nonb 25:1</ref> </char></note>“Se pou ou vin mechan avèk Madyanit yo, e frape yo; <verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>paske yo te mechan avèk nou avèk riz pa yo, avèk sila, yo twonpe nou nan zafè Peor la ak nan zafè Cozbi a, fi a chèf Madian an, sè ki te touye nan jou gwo epidemi an pou koz a Peor a.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/>Konsa, li te vin rive apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:9">Nonb 25:9</ref> </char></note> gwo epidemi an ke SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e avèk Éléazar, fis Aaron an, prèt la. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Egz 30:11-16</ref></char></note>“Fè yon kontwòl sou tout kongregasyon a fis Israël la soti nan laj ventan oswa plis, pou lakay zansèt a papa yo, nenpòt moun ki kapab sòti pou fè lagè an Israël. <verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3"/>Se konsa ke Moïse avèk Éléazar te pale avèk yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1">Nonb 22:1</ref></char></note>plèn Moab la, akote Jourdain an, anfas Jéricho. Di yo: <verse eid="NUM 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4"/>Fè yon kontwòl a pèp la soti nan laj a ventan oswa plis, jan SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.” <verse eid="NUM 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5"/>Ruben, premye ne an Israël la, fis a Ruben yo: a Hénoc, fanmi a Enokit yo; a Pallu, fanmi a Paliyit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6"/>a Hetsron, fanmi a Estwonit yo; a Carmi, fanmi a Kamit yo.<verse eid="NUM 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Ribenit yo: sila ki te konte nan yo a se te karann-twa-mil-sèt-san-trant (43,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Fis a Pallu yo: Éliab. <verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>Fis a Éliab yo: Nemeul, Dathan ak Abiram. Sila yo se te Dathan avèk Abiram ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:16">Nonb 1:16</ref></char></note>rele pa kongregasyon an, ki te kont Moïse ak Aaron nan konpanyen Koré yo lè yo te kont SENYÈ a, <verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:32">Nonb 16:32</ref></char></note>tè a te vin ouvri bouch li e te vale yo ansanm avèk Koré, lè konpanyen sa yo te vin mouri, lè dife a te devore de-san-senkant (250) mesye. Konsa, yo te devni yon egzanp. <verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:27-33">Nonb 16:27-33</ref> </char></note>fis a Koré yo pa t mouri.<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12"/>Fis a Siméon yo selon fanmi pa yo: a Nemeul, fanmi Nemilit yo, a Jamin, fanmi a Jaminit yo; a Jakin, fanmi a Jakinit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13"/>a Zérach, fanmi a Zerakit yo; a Saül, fanmi a Saoulit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Simeyonit yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:23">Nonb 1:23</ref> </char></note>venn-de-mil-de-san (22,200).<verse eid="NUM 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Fis a Gad selon fanmi pa yo: a Tsephon, fanmi a Sefonit yo; a Haggi, fanmi a Agit yo; a Schuni, fanmi a Chounit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>a Ozni, fanmi a Oznit yo; a Éri, fanmi a Erit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>a Arod, fanmi a Awodit yo; a Areéli, fanmi a Areyelit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>Sila yo se fanmi a fis a Gad yo selon sila ki te konte nan yo, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:25">Nonb 1:25</ref></char></note>karant-mil-senk-san (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 38:2">Jen 38:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Juda yo te Er avèk Onan, men Er avèk Onan te mouri nan peyi Canaran. <verse eid="NUM 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20"/>Fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:3">I Kwo 2:3</ref></char></note>Juda yo selon fanmi pa yo te: Schéla, fanmi a Chelanit yo; a Peret, fanmi a Peretit yo; a Zérach, fanmi a Zerakit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21"/>Fis a Peret yo te: a Hetsron, fanmi a Etswonit yo; a Hamul, fanmi a Amilit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Juda selon sila ki te konte nan yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:27">Nonb 1:27</ref></char></note>swasann-sèz-mil-senk-san (76,500). <verse eid="NUM 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:13">Jen 46:13</ref></char></note>Issacar yo selon fanmi pa yo: a Thola, fanmi a Tolatit yo; a Puva, fanmi a Pivit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>a Jaschub, fanmi a Jachoubit yo; a Shimron, fanmi a Chimwonit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Issacar, selon sila ki te konte nan yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:29">Nonb 1:29</ref></char></note>swasann-kat-mil-twa-san (64,300).<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Fis a Zabulon yo selon fanmi pa yo: a Séred, fanmi a Seredit yo; a Élon, fanmi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:14">Jen 46:14</ref> </char></note>a Elonit yo; a Jaheel, fanmi a Jayelit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Zabilonit yo selon sila yo ki te konte nan yo, se te swasant-mil-senk-san (60,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 46:20">Jen 46:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Joseph yo selon fanmi pa yo: Manassé ak Ephraïm. <verse eid="NUM 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29"/>Fis a Manassé yo: a Makir, fanmi a Makirit yo; epi Makir te devni papa a Galaad; a fanmi Galaadit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30"/>Sila yo se fis a Galaad yo: a Jézer, fanmi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11-34">Jij 6:11-34</ref></char></note>Jezerit yo; a Hélek, fanmi a Helekit yo, <verse eid="NUM 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31"/>epi a Asriel, fanmi a Asriyelit yo; epi Sichem, fanmi a Sichemit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32"/>epi a Schemida, fanmi a Schemidayit yo; epi a Hépher, fanmi a Eferit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Alò, Tselophchad, fis a Hépher a, pa t gen fis, men sèlman fi; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:1">Nonb 27:1</ref></char></note>non a fi a Tselophchad yo se te Machla, Noa, Hogla, Milca, ak Thirtsa.<verse eid="NUM 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Manassé yo; epi sila ki te konte nan yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:35">Nonb 1:35</ref></char></note>senkann-de-mil-sèt-san (52,700). <verse eid="NUM 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Sila yo se fis a Ephraïm yo selon fanmi pa yo: a Schutélach, fanmi a Chutelachit yo; a Béker, fanmi a Bekerit yo; a Thachan, fanmi a Tachanit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Sila yo se fis a Schutélach yo: a Éran fanmi a Eranit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Sila yo se fanmi a fis a Ephraïm yo selon sila ki konte nan yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:33">Nonb 1:33</ref></char></note>trann-de-mil-senk-san (32,500). Sila yo se fis a Joseph yo selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Fis a Benjamin yo selon fanmi pa yo: a Béla, fanmi a Belit yo; a Aschbel, fanmi a Achbelit yo; a Achiram, fanmi a Achiramit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>a Schupham, fanmi a Choufamit yo; a Hupham, fanmi a Oufamit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Fis a Béla yo se te: Ard ak Naaman: nan Ard, fanmi a Adit yo; nan Naaman, fanmi a Naamanit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Sila yo se fis a Benjamin selon fanmi pa yo; epi sila ki te konte nan yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:37">Nonb 1:37</ref></char></note>karann-senk-mil-sis-san (45,600). <verse eid="NUM 26:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Sila yo se fis a Dan yo selon fanmi pa yo: a Schucham, fanmi a Chouchamit yo. Sila yo se fanmi a Dan selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>Tout fanmi a Chouchamit yo selon sila ki te konte nan yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:39">Nonb 1:39</ref> </char></note>swasann-kat-mil-kat-san (64,400). <verse eid="NUM 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Fis a Aser yo, selon fanmi pa yo: a Jimna, fanmi a Jimnit yo; a Jischvi, fanmi a Jischvit yo; a Beria, fanmi a Berit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>A fis a Beria yo: Héber, fanmi a Eberit yo; a Malkiel, fanmi a Malkyelit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Fi a Aser a te rele Sérach. <verse eid="NUM 26:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Sila yo se fanmi a fis Aser yo selon sila ki te konte nan yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:41">Nonb 1:41</ref> </char></note>senkant-twa-mil-kat-san (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Fis a Nephtali yo, selon fanmi pa yo: a Jahtséel, fanmi a Jatseyelit yo; a Guni, fanmi a Gounit yo; <verse eid="NUM 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>A Jetser, fanmi a Jetsrit yo; a Schillem, fanmi a Chilemit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Nephtali yo selon fanmi pa yo, epi sila ki te konte avèk yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:43">Nonb 1:43</ref> </char></note>karann-senk-mil-kat-san (45,400). <verse eid="NUM 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Sila yo se sa yo ki te konte nan fis Israël yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:37">Egz 12:37</ref></char></note>sis-san-en-mil-sèt-san-trant (601,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/>Alò SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>Pami sila yo, peyi a va divize kòm yon eritaj selon fòs kantite pèp la. <verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:54">Nonb 33:54</ref></char></note>Nan sila ki pi gran yo, ou va ogmante eritaj pa yo, e nan pi piti yo, ou va diminye eritaj yo. Chak va bay eritaj yo selon sila ki te konte nan yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55"/>Men peyi a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:54">Nonb 33:54</ref></char></note>divize pa tiraj osò. Yo va resevwa eritaj yo selon fòs kantite ki te konte pami yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56"/>Selon tiraj osò a, eritaj pa yo a va divize antre sila ki pi gran ak sila ki pi piti yo.<verse eid="NUM 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:57 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 46:11">Jen 46:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sila yo se sa yo ki te konte pami Levit yo selon fanmi pa yo: a Guerschon, vin desann fanmi a Gèchonit yo; a Kehath, fanmi a Keyatit yo; a Merari, fanmi a Merarit yo. <verse eid="NUM 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Sila yo se fanmi a Levi yo: fanmi a Libnit yo, fanmi a Ebwonit yo, fanmi a Machlit yo, fanmi a Mouchit yo, fanmi a Korit yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:20">Egz 6:20</ref></char></note>Kehath te devni papa a Amram. <verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>Non a madanm Amram nan se te Jokébed, fi pou Levi a, ki te ne a Levi an Égypte; epi li te fè pou Amram: Aaron avèk Moïse avèk sè yo, Marie. <verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:2">Nonb 3:2</ref></char></note>Pou Aaron te ne Nadab avèk Abihu, Éléazar ak Ithamar. <verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lev 10:1-2</ref></char></note>Men Nadab avèk Abihu te mouri lè yo te ofri dife etranje devan SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>Sila ki te konte nan yo te venn-twa-mil (23,000), tout gason soti nan yon mwa oswa plis, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:47">Nonb 1:47</ref></char></note>yo pa t konte pami fis a Israël yo akoz pa t gen eritaj ki te bay a yo menm pami fis Israël yo.<verse eid="NUM 26:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Sila yo se sa ki te konte pa Moïse avèk Éléazar, prèt la, ki te konte fis a Israël yo, nan plèn a Moab bò kote Jourdain an, nan Jéricho. <verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:14-16">Det 2:14-16</ref></char></note>Men pami sila yo, pa t gen yon mesye nan sa yo ki te konte pa Moïse avèk Aaron, prèt la, ki te konte fis a Israël yo nan dezè a Sinaï a. <verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/>Paske, SENYÈ a te di a yo menm: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Nonb 14:26-35</ref></char></note>“Yo va, anverite, mouri nan dezè a.” Epi pa menm youn nan yo te rete, sof ke Caleb, fis a Jephaunné a avèk Josué, fis a Nun nan.<verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:33">Nonb 26:33</ref> </char></note>fis Tselophchad yo, fis a Hépher a, fis a Galaad la, fis a Makir a, fis a Manassé a, nan fanmi a Manassé, fis a Joseph la, te vin rapwoche; epi sila yo se non a fi li yo: Machia, Noe, Hogla, Milca, ak Thirtsa, <verse eid="NUM 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2"/>Yo te kanpe devan Moïse ak Éléazar, prèt la, ak devan chèf a tout kongregasyon yo, nan pòtay a tant asanble a, e te di: <verse eid="NUM 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3"/>“Papa nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:64-65">Nonb 26:64-65</ref></char></note>mouri nan dezè a. Malgre sa, li pa t pami konpanyen a sila ki te rasanble yo menm kont SENYÈ a nan konpanyen a Koré yo, men li te mouri nan pwòp peche pa li. E li pa t gen fis. <verse eid="NUM 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>Poukisa non a papa nou ta dwe retire soti nan fanmi li akoz ke li pa t gen fis? Bannou yon posesyon pami frè a papa nou yo.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 9:8">Nonb 9:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Moïse te mennen ka yo devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 36:2">Nonb 36:2</ref></char></note>“Fi a Tselophchad yo gen rezon nan sa yo di a. Ou va, vrèman, ba yo yon posesyon eritaj pami frè a papa yo, e ou va transfere eritaj a papa yo a ba yo menm.<verse eid="NUM 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8"/>“Anplis, ou va pale avèk fis Israël yo e di: ‘Si yon nonm mouri e li pa t gen fis, ou va transfere eritaj li a bay fi li. <verse eid="NUM 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9"/>Si li pa gen fi, alò, ou va bay eritaj li a a frè li yo. <verse eid="NUM 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10"/>Si li pa gen frè, alò, ou va bay eritaj li a a frè papa li yo. <verse eid="NUM 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11"/>Si papa li pa gen frè, alò, ou va bay eritaj li a a fanmi ki pi prè nan pwòp fanmi li. Li va posede li. Konsa, sa va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:29">Nonb 35:29</ref> </char></note>règleman nèt pou fis Israël yo jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.’”<verse eid="NUM 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:47-48">Nonb 33:47-48</ref></char></note>mòn Abarim nan, pou wè peyi ke Mwen te bay a fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>Lè ou fin wè li, ou va vin rasanble vè zansèt ou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:24-28">Nonb 20:24-28</ref></char></note>jan sa te rive avèk frè ou a, Aaron. <verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>Paske, nan dezè Tsin nan, pandan asanble a t ap fè kont, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:51">Det 32:51</ref></char></note>ou te fè rebèl kont lòd Mwen pou trete Mwen tankou sen devan zye yo kote dlo a.” (Sila yo se dlo a Meriba yo nan Kadés nan dezè a Tsin nan.)<verse eid="NUM 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>“Alò, Moïse te pale avèk SENYÈ a. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:22">Nonb 16:22</ref></char></note>Ke SENYÈ a, Bondye a lespri tout chè yo, ta chwazi yon mesye sou kongregasyon an, <verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:2">Det 31:2</ref></char></note>ki va sòti e antre devan yo, ki va mennen yo deyò, e rale yo antre, pou kongregasyon SENYÈ a pa devni tankou yon mouton ki san bèje.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18"/>Konsa SENYÈ a te di a Moïse: “Pran Josué, fis a Nun nan, yon nonm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:25-29">Nonb 11:25-29</ref></char></note>nan sila Lespri a rete a, e poze men ou sou li. <verse eid="NUM 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19"/>Konsa, fè li kanpe devan Éléazar, prèt la, ak devan tout kongregasyon an, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:28">Det 3:28</ref></char></note>ba li lòd komisyon an devan zye yo. <verse eid="NUM 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>Ou va mete otorite pa w sou li, pou tout kongregasyon a fis Israël yo kapab obeyi a li menm. <verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/>Anplis, li va kanpe devan Éléazar, prèt la, ki va fè ankèt pou li selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Egz 28:30</ref></char></note>jijman a Orim nan devan SENYÈ a. A kòmand pa li, yo va sòti e a kòmand pa li, yo va antre, ni li, ni fis Israël yo avèk li menm, tout kongregasyon an menm.”<verse eid="NUM 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Moïse te fè jis sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande li. Li te pran Josué e te mete li devan Éléazar, prèt la, avèk tout kongregasyon an. <verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/>Konsa, li te poze men li sou li e te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:23">Det 31:23</ref></char></note>li lòd komisyon an, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te pale pa Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>Bay lòd a fis Israël yo, e di yo: “Ou va fè atansyon pou prezante ofrann Mwen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:11">Lev 3:11</ref></char></note>manje Mwen pou ofrann pa dife Mwen yo, a yon odè ki santi bon anvè Mwen, nan lè ki deziye pou yo a. <verse eid="NUM 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38-42">Egz 29:38-42</ref></char></note>Ou va di yo: ‘Sa se ofrann pa dife ke ou va ofri bay SENYÈ a: de mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, san defo, yon ofrann chak jou ki p ap janm sispann. <verse eid="NUM 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4"/>Ou va ofri yon jenn mouton nan maten e lòt jenn mouton an nan aswè lè l fenk kòmanse fènwa; <verse eid="NUM 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>osi, yon dizyèm efa farin fen kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:1">Lev 2:1</ref></char></note>ofrann sereyal mele avèk yon ka hin lwil ki bat. <verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Li se yon ofrann brile tout tan ki te òdone nan mòn Sinaï kòm yon odè ki bon, yon ofrann pa dife bay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Epi ofrann bwason li va yon ka hin lwil pou chak mouton. Ou va vide yon ofrann bwason ak bwason fò a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:42">Egz 29:42</ref></char></note>nan plas ki sen an. <verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Lòt jenn mouton an, ou va ofri li nan aswè lè l fenk kòmanse fènwa. Menm jan ak ofrann sereyal maten an, ak ofrann bwason pa l, ou va ofri li, yon ofrann pa dife, yon odè ki bon bay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>“‘Epi nan jou Saba a, de jenn mouton mal san defo, ak de dizyèm a yon efa farin fen, kon yon ofrann sereyal, mele avèk lwil, avèk ofrann bwason li an: <verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Sila a se ofrann brile a chak Saba, anplis ke ofrann brile tout tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref></char></note>ki fèt kontinyèlman, ak ofrann bwason an.<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 10:10">Nonb 10:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Nan kòmansman a chak nan mwa nou yo, nou va prezante yon ofrann brile a SENYÈ a: de towo avèk yon belye, sèt jenn mal mouton, avèk laj 1 nan san defo, <verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:4-12">Nonb 15:4-12</ref></char></note>epi twa dizyèm efa farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann sereyal pou chak towo; epi de dizyèm nan farin fen mele avèk lwil pou yon ofrann pou yon sèl belye; <verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>epi yon dizyèm efa farin fen mele avèk lwil kòm yon ofrann sereyal pou chak jenn mouton, kòm yon ofrann brile, yon odè ki santi bon, yon ofrann pa dife bay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Ofrann bwason pa yo a va avèk yon mwatye hin diven pou yon towo, yon tyè hin pou belye a, ak yon ka hin pou yon jenn mouton. Sa se ofrann brile a pou chak mwa pandan tout mwa nan ane yo. <verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche bay SENYÈ a. Li va ofri anplis ke ofrann brile <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref></char></note>ki pou fèt tout tan yo avèk ofrann bwason li.<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/>“‘Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Lev 23:5-8</ref></char></note>nan katòzyèm jou a, nan premye mwa a, se va Pak SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:6">Lev 23:6</ref></char></note>Nan kenzyèm jou nan mwa a, va gen yon fèt pen san ledven ki va manje pandan sèt jou.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:6">Lev 23:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:7">Lev 23:7</ref></char></note>premye jou fèt la, yon konvokasyon sen; nou pa pou fè okenn travay ki di. <verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>Nou va prezante yon ofrann pa dife, yon ofrann brile bay SENYÈ a: de towo avèk yon belye ak sèt mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:21">Det 15:21</ref></char></note>ki san defo, <verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>avèk ofrann sereyal pa yo, nou va ofri farin fen mele avèk lwil. Nou va ofri twa dizyèm efa pou yon towo ak de dizyèm pou belye a. <verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>Yon dizyèm efa, nou va ofri li pou chak nan sèt jenn mouton yo; <verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>epi yon mal kabrit pou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref></char></note> ofrann peche pou fè ekspiyasyon pou nou. <verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Nou va prezante sa yo anplis ke ofrann brile maten an, ki se pou yon ofrann brile k ap fèt tout tan. <verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>Nan menm jan sila a, nou va prezante li chak jou pandan sèt jou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:11">Lev 3:11</ref></char></note>manje a ofrann pa dife a, kòm yon odè ki santi bon a SENYÈ a. Li va prezante avèk ofrann bwason pa li an ki anplis ofrann brile k ap fèt tout tan an. <verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Nan setyèm jou a, nou va fè yon konvokasyon sen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:18">Nonb 28:18</ref></char></note> Nou pa pou fè okenn travay ki di.<verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/>“‘Osi, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23:15-21</ref></char></note>jou premye fwi yo, lè nou prezante yon ofrann sereyal nèf bay SENYÈ a nan fèt semèn yo, nou va fè yon konvokasyon sen. Nou pa pou fè okenn travay ki di. <verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Nou va ofri yon ofrann brile pou yon odè ki bon a SENYÈ a: de jenn towo, yon belye, sèt mal mouton nan laj 1 nan; <verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>epi ofrann sereyal pa yo, farin fen mele avèk lwil: twa dizyèm efa pou chak towo, de dizyèm pou yon belye. <verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>Yon dizyèm pou chak nan sèt jenn mouton yo; <verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>osi yon mal kabrit pou fè ekspiyasyon pou nou. <verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref></char></note>Anplis, ofrann brile kontinyèl la avèk ofrann sereyal li an, nou va prezante yo avèk ofrann bwason pa yo a. Yo va san defo.<verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:16">Egz 23:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Alò, nan setyèm mwa nan premye jou nan mwa a, nou va osi fè yon konvokasyon sen. Nou pa pou fè okenn travay ki di. Li va pou nou yon jou pou soufle twonpèt. <verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Ou va ofri yon ofrann brile kòm yon odè ki bon a SENYÈ a: yon towo, yon belye, ak sèt mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>osi, ofrann sereyal pa yo, farin fen mele avèk lwil: twa dizyèm efa pou towo a, de dizyèm pou belye a, <verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>epi yon dizyèm pou chak nan sèt jenn mouton yo. <verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Ofri yon mal kabrit pou yon ofrann peche, pou fè ekspiyasyon pou nou, <verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>anplis, ofrann brile a lalin nèf yo avèk ofrann sereyal li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref></char></note>ofrann brile ki fèt tout tan an avèk ofrann sereyal li, ofrann bwason pa li, selon òdonans pa yo, pou yon odè ki santi bon, yon ofrann pa dife bay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/>“‘Epi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:29-34">Lev 16:29-34</ref></char></note>dizyèm jou nan setyèm mwa a, nou va fè yon konvokasyon sen, e nou va imilye nou. Nou p ap fè okenn travay. <verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Nou va prezante yon ofrann brile bay SENYÈ a kòm yon odè ki santi bon: yon towo, yon belye, sèt mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:21">Det 15:21</ref></char></note>ki pa gen okenn defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>epi ofrann sereyal pa yo, farin fen mele avèk lwil: twa dizyèm efa pou towo a, de dizyèm pou yon belye, <verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>yon dizyèm pou chak nan sèt jenn mouton yo; <verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>yon mal kabrit pou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:3-5">Lev 16:3-5</ref></char></note>ofrann peche, anplis ke ofrann peche pou ekspiyasyon an, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref></char></note>ofrann brile ki fèt tout tan an, avèk ofrann sereyal la, ak ofrann bwason pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/>“‘Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-35">Lev 23:33-35</ref> </char></note>kenzyèm jou a nan setyèm mwa a, nou va fè yon konvokasyon sen. Nou va obsève yon fèt a SENYÈ a pandan sèt jou. <verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Nou va prezante yon ofrann brile, yon ofrann pa dife kòm yon odè ki santi bon a SENYÈ a: trèz towo, de belye, katòz mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, ki san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>epi ofrann sereyal pa yo, farin fen mele avèk lwil: twa dizyèm efa pou chak nan trèz towo yo, de dizyèm pou chak nan de belye yo, <verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>epi yon dizyèm pou chak nan katòz belye yo; <verse eid="NUM 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>epi yon mal mouton pou yon ofrann peche, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref></char></note>anplis ofrann brile kontinyèl la, ofrann sereyal la, ak ofrann bwason pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>“‘Epi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref></char></note>dezyèm jou a: douz towo, de belye, katòz mal mouton nan laj 1 nan san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>epi ofrann sereyal avèk ofrann bwason pa yo pou towo yo, pou belye yo ak pou jenn mouton yo, pa nimewo a yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:1-6">Lev 2:1-6</ref></char></note>selon òdonans lan; <verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:8">Nonb 28:8</ref></char></note>anplis ofrann kontinyèl la avèk ofrann sereyal ak ofrann bwason pa yo.<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>“‘Epi nan twazyèm jou a: onz towo, de belye, katòz mal mouton nan laj 1 nan san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>epi ofrann sereyal pa yo, ofrann bwason pou towo yo, pou belye yo ak pou jenn mouton yo, selon nimewo òdonans lan; <verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche, anplis de ofrann brile k ap fèt tout tan an, ofrann sereyal la, ak ofrann bwason pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>“‘Epi nan katriyèm jou a: de towo, de belye, katòz mal mouton nan laj 1 nan san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>ofrann sereyal pa yo a ak ofrann bwason pou towo yo, pou belye yo ak pou jenn ti mouton yo, selon nimewo òdonans lan; <verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche, anplis ofrann brile ki fèt tout tan an, ofrann sereyal la ak ofrann bwason pa li.<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>“‘Epi nan senkyèm jou a: nèf towo, de belye, katòz mal mouton nan laj 1 nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:28">Eb 7:28</ref></char></note>san defo’ <verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>epi ofrann sereyal pa yo ak ofrann bwason pou towo yo, pou belye yo ak pou mouton yo selon nimewo òdonans lan; <verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche, anplis de ofrann brile ki fèt tout tan an ak ofrann sereyal avèk ofrann bwason pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>“‘Alò, nan sizyèm jou a: uit towo, de belye, katòz mal mouton 1 nan san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>epi ofrann sereyal yo ak ofrann bwason pou towo yo, pou belye yo ak pou jenn ti mouton yo, selon nimewo òdonans lan; <verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche, anplis de ofrann brile ki fèt tout tan an avèk ofrann sereyal ak ofrann bwason pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>“‘Alò, nan setyèm jou a: sèt towo, de belye, katòz mal mouton nan laj 1 nan, san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>epi ofrann sereyal pa yo ak ofrann bwason yo pou towo yo, pou belye yo ak pou jenn mouton yo selon nimewo òdonans lan, <verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche, anplis de ofrann brile ki fèt tout tan an, ofrann sereyal la ak ofrann bwason pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Nan uityèm jou a, nou va fè yon asanble solanèl; nou pa pou fè okenn travay di nan jou sa yo. <verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Men nou va prezante yon ofrann brile, yon ofrann pa dife kòm yon ofrann ki santi bon bay SENYÈ a: yon towo, yon belye, sèt mal mouton nan laj 1 nan san defo; <verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>ofrann sereyal la ak ofrann bwason pa yo pou towo a, pou belye a ak pou jenn mouton yo, selon nimewo òdonans lan; <verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>epi yon mal kabrit kòm yon ofrann peche, anplis de ofrann brile ki fèt tout tan an ak ofrann sereyal la avèk ofrann bwason pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 29:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>“‘Nou va prezante sila yo bay SENYÈ a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:2">Lev 23:2</ref> </char></note>lè fèt apwente nou chwazi yo—anplis, ofrann ve nou yo ak ofrann bòn volonte nou yo—pou ofrann brile nou yo, pou ofrann sereyal pa nou yo, ofrann bwason pa nou yo ak ofrann lapè nou yo.’”<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40"/>Moïse te pale avèk fis Israël yo an akò avèk tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande li yo.<verse eid="NUM 29:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Alò, Moïse te pale a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:4-16">Nonb 1:4-16</ref></char></note>chèf a tribi fis Israël yo. Li te di: “Sa se pawòl ke SENYÈ a te kòmande a. <verse eid="NUM 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:21-23">Det 23:21-23</ref></char></note>Si yon nonm fè yon ve a SENYÈ a, oswa fè yon sèman ki mare li ak yon angajman, li pa pou vyole pawòl li. Li va fè li an akò avèk tout sa ki sòti nan bouch li.<verse eid="NUM 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>“Osi, si yon fanm fè yon ve a SENYÈ a, e li mare li ak yon angajman lakay papa li, pandan jenès li, <verse eid="NUM 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>epi papa li te tande ve li a, angajman pa sila li te mare tèt li a, e papa li pa di li anyen, alò, tout ve li yo va kanpe e tout angajman pa sila li te mare tèt li yo, yo va kanpe. <verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>Men si papa li ta anpeche li nan jou ke li tande sa a, okenn nan ve sa yo ni angajman pa sila li te mare tèt li yo, p ap kanpe. SENYÈ a va padone li akoz ke papa li te anpeche li.<verse eid="NUM 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6"/>“Si li ta marye pandan li anba ve oswa sèman a bouch li ki te manke sajès la, pa sila li te vin mare tèt li a, <verse eid="NUM 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7"/>epi mari li tande sa e li pa di anyen a li menm nan jou ke li tande sa a; alò, ve li a va kanpe, e angajman pa sila li te mare tèt li a, va kanpe. <verse eid="NUM 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>Men si nan jou ke mari li tande sa a, li anpeche li; alò, li va anile ve ke li anba li a, ak sèman ki te manke sajès pa sila li te mare tèt li a. SENYÈ a va padone li.<verse eid="NUM 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>“Men yon ve pa yon vèv, oswa yon fanm divòse, tout sa pa sila li te mare tèt li a, va vin kanpe kont li.<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>“Si li te fè ve a lakay mari li, oswa li te mare tèt li pa yon angajman avèk yon sèman, <verse eid="NUM 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>epi mari li te tande sa; men pa t di anyen a li menm, e li pa t anpeche li; alò, tout ve li yo va kanpe e tout angajman pa sila li te mare tèt li yo, va vin kanpe. <verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>Men si, vrèman, mari li anile yo nan jou ke li tande yo a; alò, okenn ve oswa angajman ki sòti nan lèv li, p ap kanpe. Mari li te anile yo. SENYÈ a va padone li. <verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>Nenpòt ve oswa nenpòt sèman pa sila li te mare tèt li a, mari li kapab aksepte li, oswa mari li kapab anile li. <verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Men si mari li, vrèman, pa di anyen a li menm de jou an jou; alò, li te aksepte li. Paske li pa di anyen a li menm nan jou ke li te tande yo a. <verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>Men si li, vrèman, anile yo apre li te tande yo a; alò, mari a va pote koupabilite chaj li.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Sa yo se règleman ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse yo, antre yon mesye ak madanm li, oswa antre yon papa ak fi ki nan laj jenès li, ki te viv lakay papa li.<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-17">Nonb 25:1-17</ref></char></note>Pran vanjans konplè pou fis Israël yo kont Madyanit yo. Apre, ou va rasanble anvè pèp ou a.<verse eid="NUM 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Moïse te pale avèk pèp la e te di: “Bay gason pami nou yo zam pou fè lagè; pou yo kapab sòti kont Madian pou egzekite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:25">Lev 26:25</ref> </char></note>vanjans SENYÈ a kont Madian. <verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Yon milye ki soti nan chak tribi a tout tribi Israël yo, nou va voye yo nan lagè.” <verse eid="NUM 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>Konsa, te vin disponib soti nan milye an Israël, yon milye soti nan chak tribi, douz mil avèk zam prepare pou lagè. <verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Moïse te voye yo, yon milye sòti nan chak tribi nan lagè, e Phinées, fis Éléazar a, prèt la, nan lagè avèk yo, avèk veso sen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:8-9">Nonb 10:8-9</ref> </char></note>twonpèt yo pou sone alam ki nan men l lan.<verse eid="NUM 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>Konsa, yo te fè lagè kont Madian, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:13">Det 20:13</ref></char></note>yo te touye tout gason yo. <verse eid="NUM 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>Yo te touye wa a Madian yo ansanm avèk lòt ki te mouri yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:15">Nonb 25:15</ref></char></note>Evi, Rékem, Tsur, Hur, ak Réba, senk wa a Madian yo. Yo osi te touye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:22">Jos 13:22</ref></char></note>Balaam fis a Beor a avèk nepe. <verse eid="NUM 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>Fis a Israël yo te pran an kaptif fanm a Madian avèk timoun piti yo, tout bèf yo avèk tout bann bèt yo ak tout byen yo te piyaje yo. <verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>Yo te brile tout vil kote yo te rete yo ak tout kan yo avèk dife. <verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:14">Det 20:14</ref></char></note>Yo te piyaje ak tout sila ki te pran an kaptif yo, ni moun, ni bèt. <verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>Yo te mennen kaptif yo avèk bèt yo avèk sa yo piyaje yo bay Moïse ak Éléazar, prèt la ak bay kongregasyon fis Israël yo, nan kan nan plèn Moab la, ki akote Jourdain an anfas Jéricho.<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Moïse avèk Éléazar, prèt la ak tout chèf ki nan kongregasyon yo te ale deyò kan an pou rankontre yo. <verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Moïse te fache avèk ofisye lame a, kapitèn a dè milye ak kapitèn dè santèn ki te sòti nan sèvis lagè yo.<verse eid="NUM 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>Moïse te di yo: “Èske nou te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:14">Det 20:14</ref></char></note>tout fanm yo lavi? <verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Nonb 25:1-9</ref></char></note>Gade byen, sila yo te fè fis Israël yo avèk konsèy Balaam nan vin peche kont SENYÈ a nan zafè Peor a; konsa, gwo epidemi te vin pami kongregasyon SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:2">Det 7:2</ref> </char></note>Pou sa, touye tout gason pami pitit yo, e touye tout fanm ki gen tan fin kouche avèk gason. <verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Men tout fi ki poko konnen gason, konsève yo pou nou menm.<verse eid="NUM 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 19:11-22">Nonb 19:11-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Epi nou menm, fè kan deyò kan an pandan sèt jou; nenpòt moun ki te touye yon moun, e nenpòt moun ki te touche yon mò, pirifye tèt nou, nou menm avèk kaptif nou yo, nan twazyèm jou ak nan setyèm jou a. <verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Nou va pirifye tèt nou, tout rad nou yo, tout bagay ki fèt an kwi, tout travay an po kabrit ak tout bagay an bwa.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Alò, Éléazar, prèt la, te di a mesye lagè ki te ale nan batay yo: “Sa se règleman a lalwa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la: <verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22"/>sèlman lò avèk ajan, avèk bwonz, fè, fè blan ak plon, <verse eid="NUM 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23"/>tout sa ki kapab sipòte dife, nou va fè pase nan dife, e li va vin pwòp; men li va pirifye avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:9-17">Nonb 19:9-17</ref></char></note>dlo pirifikasyon an. Men nenpòt sa ki pa kab sipòte dife, nou va pase yo nan dlo. <verse eid="NUM 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Epi nou va lave rad nou nan setyèm jou a pou nou vin pwòp; epi apre, nou kapab antre nan kan an.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te pale a Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>“Ou menm avèk Éléazar, prèt la, chèf a lakay zansèt yo nan kongregasyon an, pran kontwòl de sa ki te pran an kaptif yo, ni lòm, ni bèt; <verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:8">Jos 22:8</ref></char></note>divize piyaj la antre gèrye ki te sòti nan batay yo ak tout kongregasyon an. <verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21-30">Nonb 18:21-30</ref></char></note>Fè ranmase yon taks ki pou SENYÈ a sou gèrye ki te soti nan batay yo, youn nan chak senk san moun ke yo te pran an kaptif yo, nan bèf, nan bourik ak nan mouton; <verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>pran li nan mwatye pa yo, e bay li a Éléazar, prèt la, kòm yon ofrann bay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Soti nan mwatye fis Israël yo, ou va pran youn ki sòti nan chak senkant moun, nan bèf, nan bourik ak nan mouton, nan tout bèt; epi bay yo a Levit ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:7-37">Nonb 3:7-37</ref></char></note>responsab lòd nan tabènak SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="NUM 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Moïse avèk Éléazar, prèt la, te fè jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32"/>Alò, piyaj ki te rete nan byen ke mesye lagè yo te piyaje a te si-mil-swasann-kenz (675,000) mouton, <verse eid="NUM 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33"/>swasann-douz-mil (72,000) bèf, <verse eid="NUM 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34"/>swasanteyen-mil (61,000) bourik, <verse eid="NUM 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35"/>epi nan Kretyen kaptif yo, fanm ki pa t janm konnen gason yo, tout moun te trann-de-mil (32,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Mwatye a, pati a sila ki te ale nan lagè yo te konsa: kantite mouton yo te: twa-san-trann-sèt-mil-senk-san, <verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>taks SENYÈ a te sis-san-swasann-kenz (675); <verse eid="NUM 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>bèf yo te trann-si-mil (36,000), ladann taks la te swasann-douz (72); <verse eid="NUM 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>bourik yo te trant-mil-senk-san (30,500), ladan yo taks SENYÈ a te swasanteyen (61); <verse eid="NUM 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>moun vivan yo te sèz-mil (16,000), ladan yo taks SENYÈ a te trann-de (32) moun.<verse eid="NUM 31:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Moïse te bay taks la, ofrann SENYÈ a Éléazar, prèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:9-10">Nonb 5:9-10</ref></char></note>jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Epi pou mwatye a fis Israël yo, ke Moïse te retire nan men mesye ki te ale nan lagè yo—— <verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>Mwatye kongregasyon an te twa-san-trann-sèt-mil-senk-san (337,500) mouton, <verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>trann-si-mil (36,000) bèf, <verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>trant-mil-senk-san (30,500) bourik, <verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>moun vivan yo te sèz-mil (16,000) <verse eid="NUM 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>epi soti nan mwatye fis Israël yo, Moïse te retire nan chak senkant, ni nan lòm ak nan bèt yo, e li te bay yo a Levit yo, ki te kenbe lòd nan tabènak SENYÈ a, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Alò, ofisye ki te sou dè milye nan lame yo, kapitèn a dè milye e kapitèn a dè santèn yo te apwoche Moïse, <verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>epi yo te di a Moïse: “Sèvitè nou yo te pran kontwòl a mesye lagè ki sou chaj nou yo, e nanpwen pèsòn pami nou ki pa la. <verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>Konsa, nou vin pote yon ofrann bay SENYÈ a sou sa ke chak moun te twouve, bagay an lò, chenèt, braslè, bag, zanno ak kolye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:12-16">Egz 30:12-16</ref></char></note>pou fè ekspiyasyon pou nou menm devan SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="NUM 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Moïse avèk Éléazar, prèt la, te pran lò pa yo, tout kalite bagay ki fonn. <verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>Tout lò pou ofrann, yo te ofri devan SENYÈ a, soti nan kapitèn dè milye ak kapitèn dè santèn yo, se te sèz-mil-sèt-san-senkant (16,750) sik. <verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:32">Nonb 31:32</ref></char></note>Mesye lagè yo te pran piyaj la, chak nonm pou kont li.<verse eid="NUM 31:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Konsa, Moïse avèk Éléazar, prèt la, te pran lò kapitèn dè milye ak dè santèn yo, e yo te pote li nan tant asanble a kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:16">Egz 30:16</ref></char></note>souvni a fis Israël yo devan SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Alò, fis Ruben yo avèk fis Gad yo te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:38">Egz 12:38</ref></char></note>vrèman yon gran kantite bèt. Konsa, lè yo te wè teren nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:22">Nonb 21:22</ref></char></note>Jaezer a ak peyi a Galaad la, ke li te vrèman yon kote ki bon pou bèt. <verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>Fis a Gad avèk fis a Ruben yo te vin pale avèk Moïse ak Éléazar, prèt la, avèk chèf kongregasyon an. Yo te di yo, <verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:34-38">Nonb 32:34-38</ref></char></note>“Atharoth, Dibon, Jaezer, Nimra, Hesbon Elealé, Sebam, Nebo ak Beon, <verse eid="NUM 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4"/>peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:34">Nonb 21:34</ref></char></note>ke SENYÈ a te bat devan kongregasyon Israël yo, se yon peyi ki pou pran swen bèt, e sèvitè ou yo gen bèt.” <verse eid="NUM 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>Yo te di: “Si nou twouve favè nan zye ou, kite peyi sa a vin bay a sèvitè ou yo kòm yon posesyon. Pa mennen nou lòtbò Jourdain an.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Men Moïse te di a fis Gad yo e a fis Ruben yo: “Èske frè nou yo va ale nan lagè, pou nou menm rete chita isit la? <verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:27-33">Nonb 13:27-33</ref></char></note>Koulye a, poukisa nou ap dekouraje fis Israël yo travèse lòtbò a pou antre nan peyi ke SENYÈ a te ba yo a? <verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/>Se sa ke papa nou yo te fè lè mwen te voye yo sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:3-26">Nonb 13:3-26</ref></char></note>Kadès-Barnéa pou wè peyi a. <verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>Paske, lè yo te monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:24">Nonb 13:24</ref></char></note>vale Eschcol pou te wè peyi a, yo te dekouraje fis Israël yo jiskaske yo pa t antre nan peyi ke SENYÈ a te ba yo a.<verse eid="NUM 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10"/>“Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:11">Nonb 14:11</ref></char></note>kòlè SENYÈ a te brile nan jou sa a, Li te sèmante, e te di: <verse eid="NUM 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-30">Nonb 14:26-30</ref></char></note>‘Okenn nan mesye sa yo ki monte kite Égypte, ki gen laj plis ke ventan p ap wè peyi ke Mwen te sèmante a Abraham, Isaac, e a Jacob la; paske yo pa t swiv Mwen nèt, <verse eid="NUM 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>sof Caleb, fis a Jephunné a, Kenizyen an, ak Josué, fis a Nun nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:36">Det 1:36</ref></char></note>paske yo te swiv SENYÈ a nèt.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:33-35">Nonb 14:33-35</ref></char></note>Konsa, chalè a SENYÈ a te brile kont Israël, e Li te fè yo vin egare nan dezè a pandan karantan, jiskaske tout jenerasyon sa a pami sila ki te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a yo, te vin detwi.<verse eid="NUM 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>“Koulye a, veye byen, nou te vin leve nan plas papa nou yo, yon nich moun plen peche, pou vin mete menm plis sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:37">Det 1:37</ref></char></note>kòlè SENYÈ a kont Israël. <verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Paske si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:17-18">Det 30:17-18</ref></char></note>vire akote, e nou pa swiv Li, Li va, yon fwa, ankò abandone yo nan dezè a; epi nou va detwi tout pèp sa yo.” <verse eid="NUM 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16"/>Alò, yo te vin pwoche li e te di: “Nou va bati isit la pak mouton pou bèt nou yo ak vil pou pitit nou yo; <verse eid="NUM 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:12-13">Jos 4:12-13</ref></char></note>men nou, nou menm, nou va pran zam tou prepare pou ale devan fis Israël yo, jiskaske nou enstale yo nan plas yo. Pandan pitit nou yo ap viv nan vil fòtifye akoz sila k ap viv nan peyi yo. <verse eid="NUM 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:1-4">Jos 22:1-4</ref> </char></note>Nou p ap retounen lakay nou jiskaske chak moun nan fis Israël yo gen tan posede eritaj pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Paske nou p ap gen yon eritaj avèk yo lòtbò Jourdain an, oswa pi lwen, paske eritaj pa nou an te tonbe bannou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 12:1">Jos 12:1</ref></char></note>nan kote Jourdain a sila a, vè lès la.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 3:18">Det 3:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa Moïse te di yo: “Si nou va fè sa, si nou va pran zam nou yo devan SENYÈ a pou fè lagè a, <verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>epi nou tout mesye avèk zam yo travèse Jourdain a devan SENYÈ a jiskaske Li pouse lènmi Li yo soti devan Li, <verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:20">Det 3:20</ref></char></note>epi peyi a vin anba kontwòl devan SENYÈ a. Alò, apre nou va retounen, lib de angajman yo vè SENYÈ a, ak vè Israël. Konsa, peyi sila a va pou nou kòm yon posesyon devan SENYÈ a.<verse eid="NUM 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>“Men si nou pa fè sa, veye byen, nou te peche kont SENYÈ a, e fòk nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:7">Jen 4:7</ref></char></note>peche nou va vin jwenn nou. <verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>Bati pou nou menm gran vil pou pitit nou yo, pak pou mouton nou yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:2">Nonb 30:2</ref></char></note>fè sa ke nou te pwomèt yo.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Fis a Gad avèk fis a Ruben yo te pale avèk Moïse. Yo te di: “Sèvitè ou yo va fè ojis sa ke mèt mwen kòmande yo a. <verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:14">Jos 1:14</ref></char></note>Pitit nou yo, madanm nou yo, ak bèt nou yo va rete nan vil Galaad yo; <verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>pandan sèvitè ou yo, chak ki gen zam pou fè lagè, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:12">Jos 4:12</ref></char></note>travèse lòtbò nan prezans SENYÈ a pou batay la, jis jan ke mèt mwen pale.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/>Konsa, Moïse te pase lòd konsènan yo a Éléazar, prèt la, a Josué, fis a Nun nan, e a chèf lakay papa zansèt yo, a tribi a fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>Moïse te di yo: “Si fis a Gad avèk fis a Ruben yo, tout sila ki te pran zam pou batay yo, va travèse avèk nou lòtbò Jourdain an nan prezans SENYÈ a, e peyi a vin soumèt devan nou, alò nou va ba yo peyi a Galaad la kòm yon posesyon. <verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>Men si yo refize travèse avèk nou avèk zam yo, yo va genyen posesyon yo pami nou nan peyi Canaran.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Fis a Gad avèk fis a Ruben yo te reponn e te di: “Jan SENYÈ a te pale a sèvitè ou yo, konsa nou va fè. <verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>Nou menm, nou va travèse lòtbò avèk zam yo nan prezans SENYÈ a, nan peyi Canaran, e posesyon eritaj nou va rete avèk nou lòt kote Jourdain an.” <verse eid="NUM 32:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:8-17">Det 3:8-17</ref></char></note>Konsa, Moïse te bay yo, fis a Gad avèk fis a Ruben yo, mwatye tribi fis a Joseph la, Manassé, wayòm a Sihon, wa a Amoreyen yo, wayòm a Og la, wa a Basan an, peyi a avèk vil pa yo, teritwa pa yo, vil a teritwa ki te antoure yo.<verse eid="NUM 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Fis a Gad yo te bati Dibon avèk Ataroth ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:36">Det 2:36</ref></char></note>Aroër, <verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>Atroth-Schophan, Jaezer, Jogbetha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:3">Nonb 32:3</ref></char></note>Beth Nimra avèk Beth Haran, kòm vil byen fòtifye ak pak pou mouton. <verse eid="NUM 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Fis a Ruben yo te bati Hesbon, Elealé, avèk Kirjathaïm, <verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 46:1">És 46:1</ref></char></note>Nebo avèk Baal-Meon——non ki te chanje yo—ak Sibma, e yo te bay lòt non a vil ke yo te bati yo.<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:23">Jen 50:23</ref></char></note>Makir yo, fis a Manassé yo te ale Galaad pou te pran li, e yo te deplase Amoreyen ki te rete ladann yo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Konsa, Moïse te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:12-15">Det 3:12-15</ref></char></note>Galaad a Makir, fis a Manassé a, e li te viv ladann. <verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:14">Det 3:14</ref></char></note>Jaïr, fis a Manassé a te ale pran vil li yo, e li te rele yo Havvoth-jaïr. <verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Nobach te ale pran Kenath avèk vil pa li yo, e li te rele li Nobach selon pwòp non pa li.<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1"/>Sa se vwayaj a fis Israël yo sou sila yo te sòti nan peyi Égypte la pa lame pa yo, anba <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:26">Sòm 105:26</ref></char></note>direksyon Moïse avèk Aaron. <verse eid="NUM 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2"/>Moïse te ekri yon rapò pou montre pwent kòmansman nan vwayaj yo selon kòmand SENYÈ a, e sa yo se vwayaj selon pwent kòmansman sila yo.<verse eid="NUM 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:37">Egz 12:37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Ramsès nan premye mwa a, sou kenzyèm jou a. Nan jou apre Pak la, fis Israël yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:8">Egz 14:8</ref></char></note>soti avèk gwo kouraj devan zye a tout Ejipsyen yo, <verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>pandan tout Ejipsyen yo t ap antere tout premye ne ke SENYÈ a te frape detwi pami yo. SENYÈ a te osi egzekite jijman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:12">Egz 12:12</ref></char></note>sou dye ki te pou yo.<verse eid="NUM 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:37">Egz 12:37</ref></char></note>fis a Israël yo te vwayaje soti Ramsès pou te fè kan nan Succoth.<verse eid="NUM 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:20">Egz 13:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vwayaje soti Succoth pou te fè kan nan Etham, ki sou kote dezè a.<verse eid="NUM 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:1-2">Egz 14:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vwayaje soti Etham pou te vire fè bak jis nan Pi-Hahiroth, ki anfas Baal-Tsephon, e yo te vin fè kan devan Migdol.<verse eid="NUM 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:22">Egz 14:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vwayaje soti devan Pi-Hahiroth. Yo te pase nan mitan lanmè a pou rive nan dezè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:22">Egz 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 15:23">23</ref></char></note>yo te vwayaje pandan twa jou nan dezè Étham an, e yo te vin fè kan nan Mara.<verse eid="NUM 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:27">Egz 16:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vwayaje soti Mara pou te rive nan Élim. Nan Élim, te gen douz sous dlo, swasann-dis pye palmis, e yo te fè kan an.<verse eid="NUM 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Élim, pou te fè kan bò kote Lamè Wouj.<verse eid="NUM 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>Yo te vwayaje soti Lamè Wouj pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:1">Egz 16:1</ref></char></note>dezè Tsin nan.<verse eid="NUM 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan dezè Tsin nan pou te fè kan nan Dophka.<verse eid="NUM 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Dophka pou te fè kan nan Alusch.<verse eid="NUM 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>Yo te vwayaje soti Alusch pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1">Egz 17:1</ref></char></note>Rephidim. Se te la ke pèp la pa t gen dlo pou bwè a.<verse eid="NUM 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Rephidim pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1">Egz 19:1</ref></char></note>dezè Sinaï a.<verse eid="NUM 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan dezè Sinaï a pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:34">Nonb 11:34</ref></char></note>Kibroth-Hattaava.<verse eid="NUM 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Kibroth-Hattaava pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:35">Nonb 11:35</ref></char></note>Hatséroth.<verse eid="NUM 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Hatséroth pou te fè kan nan Rithma.<verse eid="NUM 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Rithma pou te fè kan nan Rimmon-Pérets.<verse eid="NUM 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Rimmon-Pérets pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:1">Det 1:1</ref></char></note>Libna. <verse eid="NUM 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Libna pou te fè kan nan Rissa.<verse eid="NUM 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Rissa pou te fè kan nan Kehélatha. <verse eid="NUM 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Kehélatha pou te fè kan nan Schapher.<verse eid="NUM 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Mòn Schapher pou te fè kan nan Harda. <verse eid="NUM 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Harda pou te fè kan nan Makhéloth.<verse eid="NUM 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Makhéloth pou te fè kan nan Tahath.<verse eid="NUM 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Tahath pou te fè kan nan Tarach.<verse eid="NUM 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Tarach pou te fè kan nan Mithka.<verse eid="NUM 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Mithka pou te fè kan nan Haschmona.<verse eid="NUM 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Haschmona pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:6">Det 10:6</ref></char></note>Moséroth.<verse eid="NUM 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Moséroth pou te fè kan nan Bené-Jaakan.<verse eid="NUM 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:27">Jen 36:27</ref></char></note>Bené-Jaakan pou te fè kan nan Hor-Guidgad.<verse eid="NUM 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Hor-Guidgad pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:7">Det 10:7</ref></char></note>Jothbatha. <verse eid="NUM 33:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Jothbatha pou te fè kan nan Abrona.<verse eid="NUM 33:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Abrona pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:8">Det 2:8</ref></char></note>Etsjon-Guéber.<verse eid="NUM 33:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Etsjon-Guéber pou te fè kan nan dezè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:1">Nonb 20:1</ref></char></note>Tsin nan: sa vle di, Kadès.<verse eid="NUM 33:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Kadès pou te fè kan nan Mòn Hor, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:16">Nonb 20:16</ref></char></note>lizyè peyi Édom an.<verse eid="NUM 33:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 20:28">Nonb 20:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Aaron, prèt la, te monte nan Mòn Hor selon lòd SENYÈ a, e li te mouri la nan karantyèm ane apre fis Israël yo te sòti nan peyi Égypte la, nan premye jou sou senkyèm mwa a.<verse eid="NUM 33:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Aaron te gen san-venn-twazan (123) lè li te mouri sou Mòn Hor a.<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/>Alò, Kananeyen an, wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:1">Nonb 21:1</ref></char></note> Arad ki te rete Negev la nan peyi Canaran an, te tande ke fis Israël yo t ap pwoche.<verse eid="NUM 33:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>Alò, yo te vwayaje soti nan Mòn Hor pou te fè kan nan Tsalmona.<verse eid="NUM 33:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Tsalmona pou te fè kan nan Punon.<verse eid="NUM 33:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Punon pou te fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:10-11">Nonb 21:10-11</ref></char></note>Oboth.<verse eid="NUM 33:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Oboth pou te fè kan nan Ijjé-Abarim nan lizyè Moab la.<verse eid="NUM 33:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Ijjé-Abarim pou te fè kan nan Dibon-Gad.<verse eid="NUM 33:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Dibon-Gad pou te fè kan nan Almon-Diblathaïm.<verse eid="NUM 33:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan Almon-Diblathaïm pou te fè kan nan mòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12">Nonb 27:12</ref></char></note>Abarim yo devan Nebo.<verse eid="NUM 33:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>Yo te vwayaje soti nan mòn Abarim yo pou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1">Nonb 22:1</ref></char></note>fè kan nan plèn a Moab yo akote Jourdain an, anfas Jéricho.<verse eid="NUM 33:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>Yo te fè kan akote Jourdain an, soti nan Beth-Jeschimoth pou jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1">Nonb 25:1</ref></char></note>Abel-Sittim nan plèn a Moab yo.<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse nan plèn a Moab yo akote Jourdain an anfas Jéricho. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>Pale avèk fis Israël yo e di yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:17">Jos 3:17</ref></char></note>“Lè nou fin travèse Jourdain an pou antre nan peyi Canaran an, <verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>alò, nou va chase deyò tout abitan nan peyi a soti devan nou. Nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:5">Det 7:5</ref></char></note>detwi tout zidòl taye an wòch pa yo, detwi tout imaj fonn yo, e kraze nèt tout wo plas yo.<verse eid="NUM 33:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:53 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:31">Det 11:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Konsa, nou va pran posesyon peyi a pou viv ladann. Paske Mwen te bay peyi a a nou pou posede li. <verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:53-56">Nonb 26:53-56</ref></char></note>Nou va eritye teren an pa tiraj osò selon fanmi nou yo. Pou pi gran fanmi yo, eritaj la va vin plis, pou pi piti yo, nou va bay mwens nan eritaj la. Nenpòt lè tiraj osò a tonbe sou nenpòt fanmi, sila a va pou li. Nou va eritye pa tribi a zansèt nou yo.<verse eid="NUM 33:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>“Men si nou pa pouse mete deyò, tout abitan peyi a devan nou, alò, li va vin rive ke sila ke nou kite pami nou yo, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:13">Jos 23:13</ref></char></note>vin pike zye nou. Yo va devni tankou pikan bò kote nou, e yo va twouble nou nan peyi kote nou rete a. <verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Epi li va rive ke sa M te anvizaje fè yo, M ap vin fè l nou.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>Kòmande fis Israël yo e di yo: “Lè nou antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:8">Jen 17:8</ref></char></note>nan peyi Canaran an, sa se peyi ki va vin tonbe pou nou kòm eritaj la; peyi a Canaran an menm, selon lizyè pa li.<verse eid="NUM 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 15:1-3">Jos 15:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pati sid la va rive soti nan dezè Tsin nan akote Edom. Lizyè sid la va kouri soti nan pwent Lamè Sale a pou ale vè lès. <verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>Epi lizyè nou an va vire soti nan sid pou monte vè Akrabbim, e kontinye rive nan Tsin, epi dènye pwent li an va nan sid <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:8">Nonb 32:8</ref></char></note>Kadès-Barnéa. Konsa, li va rive nan Hatsar-Addar pou kontinye rive nan Atsmon. <verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>Lizyè a va vire soti nan Atsmon nan ti flèv Égypte la, pou fini nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:4">Jos 15:4</ref></char></note>lanmè.<verse eid="NUM 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>“‘Epi selon fwontyè lwès la, nou va genyen Gran Lamè a, sa vle di kot li. Sa va fwontyè lwès la.<verse eid="NUM 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:15-17">Éz 47:15-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Epi sa va fwontyè nò nou: nou va trase lizyè a soti nan Gran Lamè a pou rive nan Mòn Hor. <verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>Nou va trase yon lizyè soti nan Mòn Hor pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:5">Jos 13:5</ref></char></note>nan Lebo-hamath, e fwontyè a va vin fini nan Tsedad. <verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>Konsa, fwontyè a va kontinye nan Ziphron, e dènye pwent li an va nan Hatsar-Énan. Sa va fwontyè nò nou.<verse eid="NUM 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>“‘Pou fwontyè lès la, nou va osi trase yon lizyè soti nan Hatsar-Énan pou rive nan Schepham. <verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>Konsa, fwontyè a va desann soti nan Schepham nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:33">II Wa 23:33</ref></char></note>Ribla nan kote lès a Aïn nan. Epi lizyè a va desann rive nan pant sou kote lès a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:17">Det 3:17</ref></char></note>Lamè Kinnéreth la. <verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>Konsa, fwontyè a va desann rive nan Jourdain an, e li va fini nan Lamè Sale a. Sa va peyi pa nou an selon lizyè yo ki antoure li a.’”<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/>Konsa, Moïse te kòmande fis Israël yo. Li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:24">Det 11:24</ref></char></note>Sa se peyi ke nou gen pou separe selon tiraj osò pami nou menm kòm posesyon, ke SENYÈ a te kòmande pou bay a nèf tribi edmi yo. <verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nonb 32:33</ref></char></note>Paske, tribi a fis Ruben yo te deja resevwa pa yo selon lakay zansèt pa yo, tribi a fis a Gad yo selon lakay zansèt pa yo, e mwatye tribi a Manassé a te resevwa posesyon pa l. <verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>De tribi edmi sa yo te resevwa posesyon pa yo lòtbò Jourdain an, anfas Jéricho, vè lès, vè solèy leve a.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse e te di: <verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:1-2">Jos 14:1-2</ref></char></note>“Sila yo se non a mesye ki va divize peyi a bannou kòm eritaj nou yo: Éléazar, prèt la, avèk Josué, fis a Nun nan. <verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>Nou va pran yon chèf nan chak tribi pou divize peyi a kòm eritaj nou.<verse eid="NUM 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>“Sila yo se non a mesye sa yo: nan tribi Juda a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:6-30">Nonb 13:6-30</ref></char></note>Caleb, fis a Jephaunné a.<verse eid="NUM 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>“Nan tribi fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:33">Jen 29:33</ref></char></note>Siméon yo, Samuel fis a Ammihud la.<verse eid="NUM 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>“Nan tribi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:12">Det 33:12</ref></char></note>Benjamin an, Élidad fis a Kislon an. <verse eid="NUM 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>Nan tribi fis a Dan yo, yon chèf, Buki, fis a Jogli a.<verse eid="NUM 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>“Nan tribi fis Joseph yo: nan tribi a fis a Manassé yo, chèf Hanniel, fis a Éphod la.<verse eid="NUM 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>“Nan tribi a fis a Éphraïm nan, yon chèf, Kemuel, fis a Schiphtan an.<verse eid="NUM 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>“Nan tribi a fis a Zabulon yo, yon chèf, Élitsaphan, fis a Parnac la.<verse eid="NUM 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>“Nan tribi a fis a Issacar yo, yon chèf, Paltiel, fis a Azzan an.<verse eid="NUM 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>“Nan tribi a fis a Aser yo; yon chèf, Ahihud, fis a Schelomi a.<verse eid="NUM 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>“Nan tribi a fis a Nephtali yo, yon chèf, Pedahel, fis a Ammihud la.”<verse eid="NUM 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Sa yo se sila ke SENYÈ a te kòmande pou divize eritaj a fis Israël yo nan peyi Canaran an.<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:32-34">Lev 25:32-34</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse nan plèn Moab yo akote Jourdain an anfas Jéricho. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2"/>Kòmande fis a Israël yo pou yo bay a Levit yo soti nan eritaj a posesyon pa yo vil pou Levit yo rete ladan. Konsa, nou va bay a Levit yo teren patiraj ki antoure vil yo. <verse eid="NUM 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>Vil yo va pou yo, pou yo viv ladann. Teren pa yo va pou bèf pa yo, pou twoupo pa yo ak pou tout bèt pa yo.<verse eid="NUM 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>Teren patiraj lavil ke nou te bay a Levit yo va rive soti nan miray lavil yo, pou lonje rive jis a mil (1,000) koude. <verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Nou va, osi, mezire deyò lavil la nan kote lès, de-mil (2,000) koude, nan kote sid, de-mil (2,000) koude, nan kote lwès, de-mil (2,000) koude, ak nan kote nò, de-mil koude, avèk vil nan mitan li an. Sa va devni pou yo kòm teren pa yo pou vil yo.<verse eid="NUM 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6"/>Vil ke nou va bay a Levit yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:7-9">Jos 20:7-9</ref></char></note>sis vil azil kote moun ki touye moun kapab sove ale. Anplis de sa yo, nou va bay karann-de vil. <verse eid="NUM 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7"/>Tout vil ke nou va bay a Levit yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:41">Jos 21:41</ref></char></note>karanntuit vil ansanm avèk teren patiraj pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:32-34">Lev 25:32-34</ref></char></note>Selon vil ke nou va bay soti nan posesyon a fis Israël yo, nou va pran plis nan men pi gran yo, e nou va pran mwens nan men pi piti yo. A tout selon eritaj li ke li resevwa va bay kèk nan vil pa li yo a Levit yo.<verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Moïse. Li te di: <verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Jos 20:1-9</ref></char></note>“Pale avèk fis Israël yo pou di yo: ‘Lè nou fin travèse Jourdain an pou lantre nan peyi Canaran an, <verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>alò, nou va apwente pou nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:1">Jos 20:1</ref></char></note>vil azil nou, pou sila ki touye moun yo, san entansyon eksprè, kapab sove ale. <verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:4-6">Det 19:4-6</ref></char></note>Vil yo va pou nou yon refij kont vanjè yo, pou sila ki touye moun nan pa mouri jiskaske li ta vin kanpe devan kongregasyon an pou jije. <verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Vil ke nou bay yo va sis vil nou yo pou azil. <verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:41">Det 4:41</ref></char></note>va bay twa vil lòtbò Jourdain an ak twa vil nan peyi Canaran an. Yo va sèvi kòm vil azil. <verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Sis vil sila yo va tankou refij pou fis Israël yo, pou etranje a ak pou sila ki demere pami yo, pou nenpòt moun ki touye yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:11">Nonb 35:11</ref></char></note>san entansyon eksprè kapab sove ale pou rive la.<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:31">Nonb 35:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Men si li te frape detwi li avèk yon objè an fè, pou l ta vin mouri, li se yon asasen. Yon asasen va, anverite, vin mete a lanmò. <verse eid="NUM 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17"/>Si li te frape li avèk yon wòch nan men l, pou l ta vin mouri, epi li mouri, li se yon asasen. Asasen an va vrèman, vin mete a lanmò. <verse eid="NUM 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18"/>Oswa, si li te frape li avèk yon bout bwa nan men l pou li ta mouri, e li vin mouri, li se yon asasen. Asasen an va vrèman, vin mete a lanmò. <verse eid="NUM 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19"/>Vanjè san an va, li menm, mete asasen an a lanmò. Li va mete li a lanmò depi li rankontre li. <verse eid="NUM 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Jen 4:8</ref></char></note>Si li t ap pouse li akoz rayisman, oswa jete yon bagay sou li lè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:14">Egz 21:14</ref></char></note>kouche pou fè pèlen, e kòm rezilta, li te vin mouri, <verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>oswa, si li te frape li avèk men l an rayisman, e li vin mouri, sila ki te frape li a va, vrèman, vin mete a lanmò. Li se yon asasen. Vanjè san an va mete asasen an a lanmò lè li rankontre li.<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:11">Nonb 35:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Men si li vin pouse li sibitman san rayisman, oswa li te jete yon bagay sou li san entansyon, <verse eid="NUM 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23"/>oswa, avèk nenpòt objè mòtèl an wòch, men san wè, li vin tonbe sou li e li vin mouri, pandan li pa t lènmi li, ni li pa t ap chache pou fè li mal, <verse eid="NUM 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24"/>alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:6">Jos 20:6</ref></char></note>kongregasyon an va jije antre moun ki touye moun nan avèk vanjè san an, selon òdonans sa yo. <verse eid="NUM 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>Kongregasyon an dwe pwoteje moun ki touye moun nan de men a vanjè san an, e kongregasyon an va voye li retounen nan vil azil kote li te sove ale a. Epi konsa, li va viv ladann jiskaske lanmò wo prèt ki te onksyone avèk lwil sen an.<verse eid="NUM 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>“‘Men si moun ki touye moun nan sòti pi lwen ke lizyè pwòp vil azil pa li a, kote li te gen dwa sove ale a, <verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>epi vanjè san an vin jwenn li deyò lizyè vil azil li a; epi vanjè san an touye moun ki te touye moun nan, li p ap koupab de san an, <verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>akoz li te dwe rete nan vil azil pa li a jiskaske wo prèt la vin mouri. Men apre lanmò wo prèt la, moun ki te touye moun nan va retounen vè peyi posesyon pa li a.<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>“‘Bagay sa yo va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:11">Nonb 27:11</ref></char></note>òdonans lalwa pou tout jenerasyon nou yo nan tout abitasyon nou yo.<verse eid="NUM 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:16">Nonb 35:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Si, yon moun touye yon moun, asasen an va vin mete a lanmò sou temwayaj temwen yo, men pèsòn pa pou mete a lanmò sou temwayaj a yon sèl temwen.<verse eid="NUM 35:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>“‘Anplis, nou pa pou pran ranson pou lavi a yon asasen ki koupab jiska lanmò. Li va, vrèman, vin mete a lanmò. <verse eid="NUM 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>Nou pa pou pran ranson pou sila ki te sove ale nan vil azil la, pou l kab retounen viv nan peyi a avan lanmò a wo prèt la.<verse eid="NUM 35:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:38">Sòm 106:38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Alò, nou pa pou kontamine peyi kote nou rete a; paske san an va kontamine peyi a e nanpwen ekspiyasyon pou peyi pou san ki koule ladann, sof <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:6">Jen 9:6</ref></char></note>pa san a sila ki te fè vèse san an. <verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Nou pa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:24">Lev 18:24</ref></char></note>konwonpi peyi kote nou rete a, kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:3">Nonb 5:3</ref></char></note>Mwen menm rete a. Paske Mwen, SENYÈ a, Mwen ap viv pami fis Israël yo.’”<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 27:1">Nonb 27:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi chèf lakay zansèt a fis a Galaad yo, fis a Makir yo, fis a Manassé a, a zansèt a Joseph yo, te vin toupre pou te pale devan Moïse ak devan chèf yo, chèf lakay zansèt a fis Israël yo. <verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/>Yo te di: “SENYÈ a te kòmande mèt pa mwen an pou bay peyi a pa tiraj osò a fis Israël yo. E mèt mwen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:5-7">Nonb 27:5-7</ref></char></note>te kòmande pa SENYÈ a pou bay eritaj a Tselophchad la, frè nou an, bay pitit fi li yo. <verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Men si yo marye avèk youn nan fis nan lòt tribi fis Israël yo, eritaj yo va retire nan eritaj zansèt nou yo, e li va vin ajoute a eritaj a tribi sou sila yo vin manm nan. Konsa, l ap retire nan eritaj ki te tonbe nan dwa nou an. <verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:10">Lev 25:10</ref></char></note>jibile a rive, alò, eritaj pa yo a va ajoute a eritaj tribi kote yo manm nan. Konsa, eritaj pa yo a va retire nan eritaj tribi a zansèt nou yo.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Alò, Moïse te kòmande fis a Israël yo pa pawòl a SENYÈ a, e te di: “Sa ke tribi a fis Joseph yo di a se sa. <verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:7">Nonb 27:7</ref></char></note>Se sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande konsènan fi a Tselophchad yo e te di: ‘Kite yo marye ak nenpòt moun ke yo vle; men fòk yo marye nan pwòp fanmi a tribi zansèt papa pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:3">I Wa 21:3</ref></char></note>nanpwen eritaj nan fis Israël yo ki va transfere de tribi a tribi, paske fis Israël yo va chak kenbe eritaj a tribi zansèt yo. <verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Chak fi ki vin posede yon eritaj nan yon tribi a fis Israël yo va madanm a yon moun ki nan fanmi tribi zansèt papa li a, pou chak fis Israël yo kapab posede eritaj a zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>Konsa nanpwen eritaj k ap transfere de yon tribi rive nan yon lòt tribi. Paske, tribi a fis Israël yo va chak kenbe nan pwòp eritaj pa yo.’”<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10"/>Jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la, se konsa fi a Tselophchad yo te fè: <verse eid="NUM 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:33">Nonb 26:33</ref></char></note>Machla, Thirtsa, Hogla, Milca, ak Noa, fi a Tselophchad yo, yo te marye avèk fis a tonton yo. <verse eid="NUM 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>Yo te marye sa yo soti nan fanmi a fis a Manassé yo, fis a Joseph la, e eritaj yo te rete avèk tribi a fanmi zansèt papa yo.<verse eid="NUM 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:46">Lev 26:46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sa yo se kòmandman ak règleman ke SENYÈ a te kòmande a fis Israël yo pa Moïse nan plèn Moab yo akote Jourdain an, anfas Jéricho.<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
